INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(284634,79,'1girl,solo,cross-legged position,lotus position,in mid-air,leaning on sword,hands resting on sword pommel,supporting body weight on sword,sword stuck into the ground vertically,full weight on sword,yellow cape billow in wind,giant blue earth background,planet earth from space,swirling wind energy,air blades,flying leaves,full body,centered composition,green grass meadow,gusts of wind blowing flying grass leaves,giant blue earth background,planet earth from space,2d illustration,anime style,silver thin rapier stuck into the ground,extremely thin needle blade,blade visible only as a razor-thin vertical silver line,an anime-style female character balances high above the atmosphere,her legs crossed in mid-air. her entire body weight is supported solely by a long sword vertically stuck into the ground beneath her,with both of her hands pressing firmly on the top of the sword pommel. a vibrant yellow cape billows outwards in the strong upper-atmosphere winds. behind her,the massive blue arc of earth fills the cosmos,while swirling wind currents and air blades circle around the sword and her floating figure.her entire body weight is perfectly balanced on her hands pressing down on the pommel of an extraordinarily long and slender silver rapier stuck vertically into the ground,the razor-thin silver blade is almost invisible,appearing only as a precise,paper-thin vertical silver line extending to the grassy earth.in mid-air above a sweeping green grassy meadow.strong gusts of wind sweep across the prairie,launching countless grass leaves into the air against the backdrop of a massive blue earth in space.2::closed eyes::,','立剑浮空','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789448957,'549ca14c-e49e-4e76-9535-24e1a1bd7965','6e0f3f7d-ff70-4a55-9bd4-5d45e31b0a98');
