INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(284660,75,'Tono Hanna and Tachibana Sherry are flying high above Tokyo city on a broomstick,seen from a dramatic bird’s-eye view with a strong sense of height,speed,and depth. The composition is dynamic and cinematic rather than flat,with the broom flying diagonally across the frame and the two girls placed slightly off-center. They are shown at a moderate distance,small enough for the vast city below to feel enormous,but still close enough for their poses,silhouettes,and main outfit features to remain recognizable. Tono Hanna sits at the front of the broom,leaning forward and gripping it with both hands as she controls the flight. Her long pale-blonde twin tails,ribbons,and the layered frills of her green,black,and white floral dress stream backward in the wind.','橘远翱翔于东京上空（5）','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789448957,'1d8056df-71ee-4f91-b5e1-49aad5701ccd','48b28d76-22bc-45ce-bc70-9493d51250ce');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(284661,75,'Tachibana Sherry sits directly behind Tono Hanna,holding Tono Hanna with one arm around her waist while pointing her other hand forward in the direction of flight. Her short blue hair,small dark hat,blue-toned outfit,cape-like outer layer,and skirt are lifted by the wind,adding motion and energy to the scene. Their bodies follow the forward direction of the broom,creating a clear feeling of fast movement through the sky rather than a still floating pose.','橘远翱翔于东京上空（5）','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789448957,'4c6904c4-10ae-44fd-8a87-318b389e1d87','48b28d76-22bc-45ce-bc70-9493d51250ce');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(284662,75,'The space around them has rich layering and atmosphere. Thin clouds and drifting mist pass in front of and behind the girls,with some clouds partially crossing the broom or the lower part of their bodies,creating a stronger sense of altitude and depth. Far below,the huge urban sprawl of Tokyo city stretches endlessly across the frame,filled with dense buildings,roads,and blocks of city structure. Tokyo Tower is clearly visible and more prominent within the cityscape,acting as an important visual landmark rather than a tiny distant detail. The city gradually fades into pale bluish haze in the distance,while the sky remains bright,airy,and luminous.','橘远翱翔于东京上空（5）','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789448957,'30de8402-a1c5-401d-98ac-b2269b64b1c1','48b28d76-22bc-45ce-bc70-9493d51250ce');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(284663,75,'The overall color palette is soft but vivid,combining the fresh green and white tones of Tono Hanna,the cool blue tones of Tachibana Sherry,the pale blue sky,and the gray-blue city below. The contrast between the colorful girls and the slightly muted city helps the characters stand out,while the clouds,wind,diagonal composition,and vast aerial view make the scene feel adventurous,magical,and visually rich.','橘远翱翔于东京上空（5）','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789448957,'f2424757-bafc-40ba-ad77-3f2623a61a0e','48b28d76-22bc-45ce-bc70-9493d51250ce');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(284664,75,'looking afar,looking at another,smile,happy,','橘远翱翔于东京上空（5）','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789448957,'fe2d5986-5711-4715-a829-e5438a591d18','48b28d76-22bc-45ce-bc70-9493d51250ce');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(284665,75,'sidesaddle,sitting,broom riding,wind,dynamic pose,afloat,floating hair,Tachibana Sherry hugs Tono Hanna from behind.','橘远翱翔于东京上空（5）','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789448957,'00e41db5-fe71-42c6-9f0e-979c640080cc','48b28d76-22bc-45ce-bc70-9493d51250ce');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(284666,75,'a wide anime illustration viewed from behind at eye level,showing two girls walking away along a gently rising residential lane on a bright summer afternoon. they occupy the lower centre of the frame as small full-body figures,surrounded by dense green trees,pale utility poles and distant buildings softened by humid sunlight.','互相踢踏的打闹','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789448957,'e3187a3b-f8e8-4a23-ac5f-3fff27cfe944','48b28d76-22bc-45ce-bc70-9493d51250ce');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(284667,75,'on the left,a girl continues walking uphill with both hands folded loosely behind her back,apparently unaware of what is about to happen. her posture is upright and unhurried,with one brown loafer placed ahead of the other. an ahoge rises above a brown beret decorated with a black bow. her very long white hair is divided into two thick braids that hang down her back and sway outward with her stride. she wears a loose white long-sleeved coat over a white shirt and black striped bowtie,a grey grid-and-plaid skirt,black thigh-high stockings and brown loafers. the coat tails and braids overlap naturally across her back,shifting with the warm breeze.','互相踢踏的打闹','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789448957,'946c5246-eaf2-4535-86b8-6b8837534616','48b28d76-22bc-45ce-bc70-9493d51250ce');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(284668,75,'to her right,a short blue-haired girl performs a playful sideways kick while still moving forward. she balances on her right foot with that knee slightly bent,tilts her upper body away to counterbalance the motion,and extends her left leg horizontally behind the white-haired girl. the sole and rounded toe of her brown loafer make light contact with the centre of the other girl’s skirt-covered backside. her hips rotate into the kick while both arms tuck behind her back in an exaggerated attempt to look innocent. she turns her face sideways toward her companion,blue eyes watching closely and her mouth curled into a mischievous smile.','互相踢踏的打闹','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789448957,'1b9e384c-6692-45a4-a1b4-605608731102','48b28d76-22bc-45ce-bc70-9493d51250ce');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(284669,75,'the blue-haired girl wears a short-sleeved white serafuku with a blue sailor collar and blue neckerchief,a blue pleated skirt,white knee-high socks and brown loafers. her lifted skirt pleats,neckerchief and short hair react to the quick motion,while her planted shoe remains firmly aligned with the sloping pavement.','互相踢踏的打闹','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789448957,'c2ded58e-4b9b-4697-92ea-de781692464c','48b28d76-22bc-45ce-bc70-9493d51250ce');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(284670,75,'capture the precise comic instant of contact: the white-haired girl’s upper body has only just begun to pitch forward,one braid bouncing upward and her beret shifting slightly,while the blue-haired girl remains poised on one leg. their overlapping silhouettes make the action immediately readable from behind.','互相踢踏的打闹','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789448957,'481de774-aef8-4b6a-a129-472f1ef44c88','48b28d76-22bc-45ce-bc70-9493d51250ce');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(284671,75,'large leafy branches frame the upper corners and cast irregular patches of sun and shade across the road. a white wire fence,glimpses of apartment façades,flowering shrubs and striped safety markings on a utility pole establish a quiet japanese neighbourhood. the brightest opening lies farther uphill between the trees,drawing the girls forward. use saturated summer greens,cool blue shadows and warm dappled highlights,with the playful kick as the clear centre of the scene','互相踢踏的打闹','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789448957,'30183324-0399-424e-838b-5ecabab04950','48b28d76-22bc-45ce-bc70-9493d51250ce');
