INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(284693,73,'wallpaper,epic high-end anime illustration,refined cel-shaded rendering,intricate lineart,rich dense visual detail,cinematic wide-angle view,expansive vista,grand landscape shot,environment-dominant composition,strong visual impact,dramatic depth,richly layered scenery,complex light and shadow,a vast open lake occupying a large portion of the scene,broad open water view,visible distant horizon,strait-like lake composition,open water corridor leading the eye toward the horizon,crystal-clear glass-like lake water,mirror-smooth reflective surface,pristine transparent shallow water in the foreground,extremely clear reflections of the sky and scenery,faint delicate ripples only,subtle underwater visibility near the shore,a few small rocks emerging from the lake,sparse aquatic grass,scattered maple leaves,a little stream of japanese paper lanterns floating on the water,naturally dispersed in irregular loose clusters,uneven spacing and varying density,gently drifting with the current toward the far distance,forming a soft organic flowing trail as if many lanterns were released together upstream,softly blurred reeds and lakeside grass entering the near foreground,forest masses distributed along both sides of the lake instead of forming a continuous horizontal band,vivid red maple trees mixed with dark green pine forest,irregular curved shoreline,peninsulas and inlets,broken tree lines,staggered tree heights,overlapping vegetation,natural openings revealing distant water and sky,an elegant detailed japanese torii in the mid-distance near one side of the lakeshore,smaller in scale relative to the whole landscape,seen from a slight diagonal angle rather than front-facing,pristine and well-maintained,vermilion red with dark wood,black and subtle gold accents,layered crossbeams,refined ornamental fittings,decorative central plaque,naturally integrated into the scenery,a distant scarlet devil mansion by the lakeside,medium-small in scale,iconic scarlet european gothic mansion,architecturally rich but visually legible,layered towers of varying height,steep dark roofs,elegant spires,tall arched windows,selective ornate details,crisp architectural forms,strong recognizable silhouette,partially reflected in the lake,mount fuji rising in the far distance off to one side of the horizon,clearly placed away from the center of the frame,iconic snow-capped volcanic peak,surrounding mountain ridges forming secondary layers,drifting mist,deep atmospheric perspective,towering colossal clouds filling the sky,enormous three-dimensional cloud masses,deeply layered cloud banks,intricate turbulent cloud structures,dramatic glowing dusk clouds,dense illuminated cloud volumes,strong light-and-shadow separation,luminous cloud edges,vivid sunset colors,deep blue,violet,crimson,magenta and brilliant gold,subtle meteor streaks,epic fantasy japanese atmospherehigh-end anime illustration,refined cel shading,intricate lineart,rich detailed complex light and shadow,dense environmental detail,elaborate anime background art,dramatic atmospheric lighting,volumetric cloud rendering,richly layered scenery,cohesive character and scenery rendering,','魔女飞跃黄昏（推荐横图）','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789448957,'48e24f31-8064-4712-9dd2-b2227a500cde','4cd4a244-9e15-48b2-8f10-85d18634105d');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(284694,73,'char1：girl,modern luxurious lolita fashion,ornate black and white fantasy lolita dress with subtle gold accents,layered frills,intricate lace,corset waist,ribbons,decorative embroidery,elegant puff sleeves,jeweled brooches,tasteful ornamental details,refined witch hat with elegant decorations,long flowing full body,positioned slightly to the right side of the frame,smaller relative to the environment,riding her magic broom low above the lake surface,flying forward toward the distant horizon,skimming closely above the water,three-quarter rear-side view,face mostly visible in side profile,looking ahead rather than at the viewer,calm focused expression,leaning slightly forward in a natural flying posture,both legs naturally balanced around the broom,one hand holding the broom securely,hair,ribbons and layered skirt streaming backward in the wind,subtle water disturbance and reflected silhouette beneath her,naturally integrated into the landscape,','魔女飞跃黄昏（推荐横图）','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789448957,'5d0122aa-2280-4bba-a0d8-1f21177ed013','4cd4a244-9e15-48b2-8f10-85d18634105d');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(284695,73,'orange background,sky,rooftop,school,chain-link fence,from side,wide-angle,panorama,drop shadow,intense shadows,sidelight,sunbeam,lens flare,floating hair,through chain-link fence view,from below to side,ray tracing,cinematic lighting,chiaroscuro,sun,another throwing bouquet,blue irises and red rose,floating peals,floating red rose,floating blue irises,trees,floating bouquet,full body,{{{wide shot}}},the light covered half face,closed eyes,leaning forward,floating legs,upside down,looking down,lens flare,head down,speed lines,falling from rooftop,','天台跃下','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789448957,'66de71a4-4935-46cf-94ef-b7aede0f31d1','4cd4a244-9e15-48b2-8f10-85d18634105d');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(284696,73,'from side,dynamic angle,close to,stomach,groin,nsfw,armpit,shiny skin,green trees,dappled sunlight,vine,moss,dewdrop on leaf,after rain,reflective dewdrop,water surround,reflective water,shiny water,under water,soaking,ripple,lying back forward,from above,vine,forest,backlight,soft light,high contrast,colorful,detailed light,sunlight,shine on girl''s body,','沉入水潭（5）','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789448957,'910d00f3-0506-4555-b3a1-3042e5d788dc','4cd4a244-9e15-48b2-8f10-85d18634105d');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(284697,849,'2::chibi,chibi only::,2::no pupils::,5::upper body::,5::4格漫画::,a four-panel manga-style scene set in a magical,starry night.in the top-left panel,a wide view of a deep blue night sky filled with twinkling stars and a large,luminous full moon,glowing softly above a quiet meadow.in the top-right panel,a girl stands beneath the moon,raising both hands toward it,using her fingers to measure or frame its size — as if comparing its width to her outstretched hands,a playful,curious expression on her face.in the bottom-left panel,she reaches up with both hands and actually grabs the moon,which has become a solid,glowing sphere,holding it firmly in her palms,her eyes wide with surprise and delight.in the bottom-right panel,she runs away,holding the glowing moon above her head like a giant snowball,her arms stretched high,legs dashing forward,the moon trailing a soft wake of stardust and silver sparkles. her expression is a mix of mischief,excitement,and slight panic,as if she’s making a joyful escape.the overall mood is whimsical,adventurous,and filled with childlike wonder.','手可摘月亮','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789448957,'9d8452be-882a-4a9f-a9d6-85adcfbdc97b','7472a6a5-c336-46a2-8aa5-f5bdb4d2c29f');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(284698,849,'2::chibi,chibi only::,2::no pupils::,5::upper body::,5::4格漫画::,a four-panel manga-style scene in a cozy wooden-floored room.in the top-left panel,a close-up of a dusty wooden floor,where a small glass vial lies on its side,filled with a shimmering golden liquid,with a tiny paper label tied around its neck bearing the chinese characters “喝我” (drink me) in elegant ink.in the top-right panel,a girl crouches down,picking up the vial with both hands,examining it with a mix of curiosity and amusement,then uncorks it and brings it to her lips.in the bottom-left panel,she has just swallowed the liquid,her eyes widening as her body begins to expand—her shoulders broaden,her legs stretch,and she rises rapidly,her clothes straining.in the bottom-right panel,from a low angle,she is now towering over the room,her head bumping against the ceiling,and her shoulder accidentally knocks over a large wooden chair beside her,sending it clattering to the floor. she looks down with a surprised,slightly apologetic expression.the overall mood is playful,magical,and gently chaotic.','饮用变大药水','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789448957,'f0a49aa9-3d83-41fa-a9e8-1366064ec629','7472a6a5-c336-46a2-8aa5-f5bdb4d2c29f');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(284699,849,'2::chibi,chibi only::,2::no pupils::,5::upper body::,5::4格漫画::,a four-panel manga-style scene in a cozy kitchen early in the morning.in the top-left panel,a close-up of a toaster lever being pushed down,with a slight click.in the top-right panel,the girl stands by the counter,waiting,arms crossed,watching the toaster with sleepy but patient eyes.in the bottom-left panel,the toast pops up,and she catches it with a napkin,steam rising from the golden surface.in the bottom-right panel,she carries the toast on a small plate toward a table set with a cup of tea and a knife with butter.the overall mood is simple,warm,and comforting.','制作早饭','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789448957,'6edcb647-25cb-47a3-a0bb-3bf934a73c66','7472a6a5-c336-46a2-8aa5-f5bdb4d2c29f');
