INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285733,73,'a young girl flowing hair that transitions from white at the roots to streaks of grey and blue sits on the floor,hugging her knees tightly against her chest in a solitary pose. she has a melancholic expression with her mouth closed,looking downwards in sadness. her outfit is a frilled blue dress made of a silk-like material,featuring long sleeves with ruffled cuffs and armor plating on the bodice,suggesting she is a knight. a matching blue capelet drapes over her shoulders,and she wears black cross-laced boots. a star-shaped flower ornament adorns her side-swept blunt bangs. she sits with her knees pulled up,arms crossed over her shins,looking forlorn amidst the clutter of the room.the scene takes place indoors in a room with grey brick walls,bathed in cool,moody lighting that suggests a rainy day. behind the girl is a large window with broken glass panes and tattered curtains hanging loosely; through the window,two translucent figures of armored knights stand outside,observing the interior. the floor around her is scattered with various objects: to her left,a large metal anchor leans against the wall near a polearm and a lifebuoy hanging on the wall. to her right,on top of a wooden crate,sits a small blue owl figurine and a knight''s helmet resting nearby. additional details include ropes coiled on the floor,glass bottles,a barrel,a net,and spider webs clinging to the corners,creating an abandoned and somber atmosphere.','人物环境','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'b86d03d8-7d4f-4999-8ae9-6c73d525e79a','4cd4a244-9e15-48b2-8f10-85d18634105d');
