INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285808,864,'from behind,bathing,a girl with relaxes in a bathtub filled with pale green water,holding a tablet. her long hair spreads across the water surface as she focuses on the screen in her hands. the modern bathroom features beige countertops with folded towels. floor-to-ceiling glass windows frame a stark outdoor view of barren mountains and twisted rock formations under a cloudy sky. the bathtub sits centered in the bright space surrounded by clean-lined bathroom fixtures and fluffy bath accessories.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'6291ec92-2705-4ffc-a307-18254a468585','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285809,864,'neon holographic puzzle pieces floating in zero gravity,glow-in-the-dark angel wings with circuit board patterns,transparent jelly slippers with LED lights,levitating while assembling puzzle pieces with telekinesis,cyberpunk bedroom with floating furniture,Neon pink and blue lighting,holographic interface displaying heart rate and affection levels,interlocking fingers with second invisible character (implied presence),neon constellation projections on skin,glowing circuit tattoos,futuristic pajamas with luminescent piping,quantum entanglement visual effects between puzzle pieces,cyber angel theme,interactive AR elements visible through smart contact lenses','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'df0ba6f9-9d11-4042-8081-2a9b18fc7a3e','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285810,864,'翻译：漂浮在零重力环境中的霓虹全息拼图、带有电路板图案的夜光天使翅膀、带 LED 灯的透明果冻拖鞋、利用心灵感应组装拼图时悬浮、带有浮动家具的赛博朋克卧室、霓虹粉色和蓝色照明、显示心率和感情水平的全息界面、与第二个隐形角色（暗示存在）交叉的手指、皮肤上的霓虹星座投影、发光电路纹身、带有发光滚边的未来派睡衣、拼图之间的量子纠缠视觉效果、赛博天使主题、可通过智能隐形眼镜看到的交互式 AR 元素','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'2cd40a71-2081-47c9-9396-79a4aeaffdf1','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285811,864,'nautical compass necklace,striped sailor shirt,rolled up sleeves,white shorts,weathered leather satchel,binoculars hanging from neck,wooden ship wheel background,ocean horizon view,seagulls flying,wind-blown hair,determined expression,rope bracelet,folded map in hand,golden hour lighting,distant lighthouse,waves crashing against rocks,telescope tucked in belt,captain''s hat slightly tilted,compass rose tattoo on forearm,salt spray on skin,sunset colors reflecting on water,dynamic pose looking forward','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'0f183efa-c1bf-46ec-81e5-958534ab7fe5','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285812,864,'a girl stands in the center of decaying gothic ruins under pale moonlight,surrounded by crumbling stone walls covered in glowing moss. rotting zombie hands emerge from cracked earth around her feet,clawing at broken chains and rusted iron fences. an eerie blue mist blankets the forest floor where skeletal trees twist toward stormy skies. her silhouette glows faintly against shattered stained-glass fragments embedded in ancient pillars. icy aura freezes the ground beneath her feet,creating jagged crystal patterns spreading toward shadowy figures lurking in fog. flickering lanterns cast long distorted shadows across moss-covered tombstones and collapsed clock towers.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'69eb8114-6d79-45f3-9b8d-e8c02f586b0c','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285813,864,'a girl stands amidst twisted vines with glowing eyes,her bare feet entangled by thorny roots emerging from cracked soil. jagged branches spiral around her torso like skeletal hands,their bark pulsating with faint crimson veins. clusters of bioluminescent flowers bloom nearby,petals releasing shimmering spores that cling to her torn dress. shadowy cat-like creatures with glowing amber eyes peer from gnarled tree hollows,their claws scraping against petrified wood. thin rivulets of blood trickle down her ankles where barbed tendrils pierce the skin,droplets crystallizing upon touching the ashen ground. a low-hanging mist swirls with fragmented whispers,distorting the girl''s silhouette into wavering afterimages under dim blue-green light.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'5b861703-b27e-49d1-a47f-d0fc11037ab5','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285814,864,'depicts a fierce warrior woman,clad in a revealing black outfit,holding a glowing red sword. the composition uses dramatic lighting to emphasize her muscular physique and the intricate tattoos on her arm. the cityscape background,illuminated by neon signs,adds a cyberpunk vibe. the artist skillfully blends sharp lines and vibrant colors to create a dynamic,almost cinematic scene. the image is suggestive.1girl,solo,breasts,looking at viewer,shirt,skirt,navel,closed mouth,bare shoulders,sitting,thighs,outdoors,sky,sleeveless,barefoot,midriff,sword,black skirt,miniskirt,holding weapon,feet,black shirt,legs,clothing cutout,toes,sleeveless shirt,bare arms,bare legs,tattoo,floating hair,night,glowing,holding sword,katana,building,side slit,knee up,rain,city,arm tattoo,cityscape,navel cutout,shoulder tattoo,neon lights','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'6ebabb47-e59b-46d1-a80e-c62003a72c95','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285815,864,'a girl stands in a dimly-lit corridor surrounded by intricate mechanical devices and glowing blue energy cores. broken gears and twisted pipes litter the ground near her boots. her gaze focuses on a massive circular portal emitting faint golden light,its surface etched with ancient religious symbols. behind her,a towering mechanical structure hums with exposed wires and rotating cogs. her hands hover over a control panel covered in glowing runes and holographic interfaces. shadows cast by overhead machinery stretch across the stone walls adorned with faded murals of robed figures.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'b5b787cc-c05f-442b-94c6-ed0d40fde35f','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285816,864,'a girl in the a dimly lit underground chamber,surrounded by glowing blue runes etched into ancient stone pillars. thick green liquid drips from cracked incubation pods lining the walls,while translucent eggs float in viscous fluid nearby. flickering torchlight casts elongated shadows resembling tentacles across moss-covered walls. her feet sink slightly into the damp stone floor littered with broken chains and shattered cultist masks. behind her,a massive circular incubation pool bubbles with bioluminescent organisms,emitting faint whispers of forbidden chants. the air shimmers with particles of ancient dust illuminated by floating energy spheres.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'e9774b8d-04bb-4797-99ed-e98c015955f7','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285817,864,'a girl in a ruined industrial zone with broken metal structures and scattered debris,holding a rifle. she runs through narrow alleyways between collapsed concrete walls and shattered machinery,debris flying around her. rocket turrets and mechanical devices emit steam and glowing sparks in the background. her determined expression matches the dynamic pose as she dodges falling metal fragments. explosions and smoke create chaos near damaged rocket parts and twisted pipes. she aims forward with precision,surrounded by flickering neon lights and floating dust.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'ce66672a-0716-4986-a281-315acbb71bfe','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285818,864,'cellphone,collarbone,completely nude,convenient censoring,hair down hand on own hip,holding phone,indoors,mirror,navel,selfie,standing,wet,depicts a delicate anime-style character with flowing hair,adorned with intricate lace and heart motifs. the soft,ethereal lighting and delicate brushstrokes evoke a dreamy,otherworldly atmosphere. the use of pastel colors and heart shapes adds a whimsical,romantic touch. the composition is suggestive,with a focus on the character''s expressive,large eyes and soft,inviting smile. the texture is smooth,with a blend of soft gradients and fine details enhancing the overall ethereal quality. the image is sfw.1girl,solo,long hair,looking at viewer,simple background,shirt,dress,bow,bare shoulders,twintails,upper body,pink hair,heart,frills,hairband,parted lips,wings,choker,pink eyes,lips,low twintails,black background,pink bow,feathered wings,pink shirt,angel wings,white wings,red lips','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'5e23e9c5-a4f5-4daf-829e-8786998969d0','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285819,864,'翻译：手机、锁骨、完全裸体、方便审查、头发垂下，手放在臀部，拿着手机，室内，镜子，肚脐，自拍，站立，湿的，描绘了一个精致的动漫风格人物，有着飘逸的头发，装饰着复杂的蕾丝和心形图案。柔和、空灵的灯光和精致的笔触营造出梦幻般的超凡脱俗的氛围。柔和的色彩和心形的运用增添了异想天开的浪漫气息。构图富有暗示性，重点突出人物富有表现力的大眼睛和柔和迷人的微笑。纹理光滑，柔和的渐变和精致的细节融合，增强了整体空灵的品质。图像是 sfw.1girl、独奏、长发、看着观众、简单的背景、衬衫、连衣裙、蝴蝶结、裸露的肩膀、双马尾、上身、粉红色的头发、心形、褶边、发带、分开的嘴唇、翅膀、颈链、粉红色的眼睛、嘴唇、低双马尾、黑色背景、粉红色的蝴蝶结、羽毛的翅膀、粉红色的衬衫、天使的翅膀、白色的翅膀、红色的嘴唇','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'c246cdd8-2d4c-49ed-87ac-a877c400e402','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285820,864,'duel disk on left arm,glowing energy particles,wind-blown school uniform,determined expression,outstretched right hand,golden summoning circle (intricate yugioh-style),holographic monster emerging (dragon/sphinx hybrid),card projection holograms,dramatic backlighting,sparks flying,dynamic camera angle from below,floating card fragments,glowing eyes,energy surge effect,stadium background with cheering crowd silhouette,motion blur on outstretched arm,''summon'' text in katakana floating nearby,shoulder-length hair whipping upward,knee-high socks wrinkled from movement,loose necktie flapping,sweat droplet on forehead,glowing duel disk interface,card sleeves visible on belt,shadow of monster cast on face','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'b8b4124c-7017-46ca-82d3-efe30ab66145','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285821,864,'a girl stands in the ruins of a futuristic cityscape,surrounded by shattered mechanical structures and glowing energy cores. she wears combat-ready armor with luminous circuit patterns,gripping an advanced energy rifle. antwer canyon looms behind her,its cliffs embedded with half-destroyed artillery platforms. neon-lit market stalls spill broken robotics nearby,while holographic warnings flicker above collapsing industrial pipelines. battle drones hover in the smoke-filled sky,their searchlights cutting through the haze.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'7ee783f1-ccae-42f7-a981-bd15b607b790','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285822,864,'face shield helmet,the helmet is semi-transparent,with yellow crosshair flashing across the visor,along with red "s.w.a.t." alerts,armor,breastsplate,police uniform,police badge,led,from above,running','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'61b2f794-582e-4b0d-8c51-3b23afc2a3bc','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285823,864,'a dark and eerie machinery factory,girl stands in a combat stance she wears glowing warcraft armor with a shoulder-mounted artillery system. her figure is elegant yet exudes an overwhelming intensity. her long hair flows slightly with her movement,and her head is tilted slightly with a stern expression. she wears a transparent glass face shield,giving her a high-tech yet unsettling appearance,dark see-through glass mask covered face,screen on face,her body is embedded with numerous cables,wires,batteries,and screws. exposed mechanical components and energy conduits emit a red glow and light particles,evoking a strong sense of physical terror. in one mechanical hand,she holding handgun and big shield,mechanical backbag extend from her back,with thrusters and cylindrical energy batteries glowing on her armor. her body bears barcodes and identification markings such as "05," suggesting she might be an ai-assisted weapon created for war. the scene is shown in a close-up,cowboy-shot perspective,rich in detail and texture. it''s a visually stunning masterpiece,blending futuristic aesthetics with horror and mech elements into a breathtaking','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'9af52740-545c-4e38-a792-bff1fffefd7d','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285824,864,'翻译：面罩式头盔，头盔呈半透明状，面罩上闪烁着黄色十字准线，并印有红色“特警”警示标志，盔甲，胸甲，警服，警徽，led，俯视图，奔跑','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'d098c302-0bd0-4741-ab96-131bf4959585','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
