INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285831,864,'翻译：{{{{1girl}}}},{{{{solo}}}},看着观众，蒸汽朋克幻想背景，蒸汽动力飞艇翱翔在充满钟表发明和齿轮装饰建筑的另类维多利亚时代城市景观之上，而路灯则在下面的鹅卵石街道上投下温暖的光芒，高度精细的爱德华时代时尚，带有齿轮和齿轮图案的帽子，站在金属阳台上，她穿着蒸汽朋克服装（裤子、夹克、带护目镜的帽子）、短袖白色 T 恤、小腰包、旅行、大钟、鸽子、市场、火车、蒸汽、飞艇、金色、机制、齿轮、管道、蒸汽朋克、蒸汽朋克服装、紧身胸衣、帽子、斗篷、特斯拉线圈、用途不明的巨大蒸汽动力装置、{{{体积蒸汽}}}、动态姿势、动态视图','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'bcb50230-779e-4863-bc87-d96de7d953b6','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285832,864,'hair rings (delicate gold),solo,hair ornament (peony-shaped),oil-paper umbrella (red with cherry blossom pattern),butterfly (blue morpho resting on finger),flower (white peony tucked behind ear),open mouth (slightly parted),facial mark (red crescent moon under left eye),smile (gentle),forehead mark (gold dot),portrait,looking at viewer,traditional chinese dress (qipao style with floral embroidery),standing on wooden bridge,morning mist background,soft sunlight filtering through trees,hand holding umbrella at 45-degree angle,loose strands of hair blowing in wind,jade bracelet on wrist,faint blush on cheeks,morning mist background (dense fog swirling around wooden bridge),soft sunlight filtering through maple leaves (golden hour glow),distant mountains with layered ink wash effect,cobblestone path leading to red torii gate,koi pond reflections with floating lotus pods,paper lanterns hanging from tree branches (soft amber glow),falling cherry blossom petals in air (delicate pink),stone lantern with faint blue flame,traditional chinese architecture silhouette in distance,dew drops on spider webs between railings','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'52db6eaf-75d9-40f6-bcec-e30859d49a4d','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285833,864,'white silk mermaid gown with crystal embroidery,sweetheart neckline with pearl beading,off-shoulder lace sleeves with silver threading,fitted corset bodice with satin ribbon lacing,layered tulle petticoat for volume,10-foot cathedral train with floral appliqués,scalloped hemline with swarovski accents,illusion back with delicate beaded lattice,opera-length satin gloves with button closures,thigh-high white leather boots with stiletto heels,boots feature embroidered vine patterns,matching pearl-encrusted belt at natural waist,built-in bustle for train adjustment,hidden side slit for mobility,hand-sewn french seams throughout,couture-level construction details','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'2cc36850-afca-4c0a-9de9-11959c3549ab','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285834,864,'the scene is characterized by very strong lighting originating from the horizon,creating dramatic light and moody lighting effects with intense highlights on the water. the artwork depicts a solitary figure,appearing as a young woman with dark,shoulder-length hair,standing submerged to her thighs in a body of water that stretches towards a luminous horizon. positioned off-center,she is presented mostly in silhouette against the brilliant glare of a setting or rising sun. her gaze is directed downwards,towards the water before her,suggesting a moment of quiet contemplation or introspection. the sun''s reflection creates a dazzling path of light across the water''s surface,rendered in fragmented patches of bright yellow,white,pink,and iridescent blues,conveying the shimmering quality of light on gentle waves. the water transitions from these vibrant,light-filled areas to deeper,cooler shades of purple and blue in the foreground. the sky above mirrors the water''s palette,shifting from warm hues near the horizon to a pale,clear blue. despite the figure''s silhouetted form,subtle variations in color hint at the ambient light catching her hair and clothing,adding depth to her presence within the tranquil,ethereal waterscape. the overall atmosphere is one of serene solitude,enhanced by the expressive,painterly execution and the evocative use of light and color.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'16f5e962-202a-47dd-9558-726c97cd0890','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285835,864,'a girl,delicate facial features,large sparkling eyes,seductive yet cute expression,hair with golden highlights,youthful charm,elegant oriental dance,fluid and graceful movements,dynamic pose,twirling skirt,holding a silk ribbon,wearing a flowing oriental dress,light pink and moon-white colors,translucent sheer fabric,gold and silver accents,fox-themed hair ornaments,intricate embroidery,ornate oriental garden,cherry blossoms,peonies,moonlit night,red wooden pavilion,hanging lanterns with tassels,lotus pond,glowing fireflies,falling petals','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'4ca08243-7554-45df-9907-0936a613e47b','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285836,864,'the composition centers on a detailed figurine of a young girl,viewed in profile from the left foreground. she wears a simple white t-shirt adorned with a pink graphic design. her gaze is directed intently towards the right,her hands hovering near the surface of a brightly illuminated glass display case,conveying a sense of curiosity or admiration.occupying the right side of the frame,inside the display case,stands a prominent,intricately designed mecha or robot figurine. this imposing figure features a complex grey and silver armored exoskeleton with accents of red plating,particularly visible on the chest and joints. its design incorporates sharp angles,multiple layers of armor,and articulated limbs,culminating in a helmeted head with pointed crests and glowing orange optical sensors or eyes. the robot is posed dynamically,facing slightly towards the viewer and the girl figurine.the display case housing the robot is brightly lit from above by cool,blue-white light strips,which cast strong highlights and deep shadows across the robot''s metallic surfaces,emphasizing its form and texture. visible reflections shimmer on the glass barrier separating the girl from the displayed items. behind the primary robot figure,numerous other smaller anime girl figurines are arranged on shelves within the same case,adding depth and context to the display.in the background,beyond the girl figurine and partially obscured by a shallow depth of field,are shelves densely packed with various forms of merchandise,likely anime figures,dvds,or other collectibles,rendered in warmer tones. this background is softly blurred,employing a bokeh effect that draws focus to the foreground interaction between the girl figurine and the robot display,creating a scene reminiscent of a collector''s room or a specialty hobby shop.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'497682ad-b7c3-4625-a985-18e339e597f3','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285837,864,'翻译：构图的中心是一个精致的年轻女孩小雕像，从左前景观看，呈侧面造型。她穿着一件简单的白色 T 恤，上面装饰着粉色图案。她的目光专注地望向右侧，双手悬停在明亮的玻璃展示柜表面附近，传达出好奇或钦佩的感觉。在画面右侧，展示柜内，矗立着一个显眼、设计精巧的机甲或机器人小雕像。这个威风的人物具有复杂的灰色和银色装甲外骨骼，带有红色镀层，尤其是在胸部和关节处。它的设计融合了锐利的角度、多层装甲和铰接式四肢，最终形成一个戴着头盔的头部，头部有尖尖的冠冕和发光的橙色光学传感器或眼睛。机器人摆出动态姿势，略微面向观众和女孩人偶。放置机器人的展示柜上方被蓝白色冷光条照亮，在机器人的金属表面上投射出强烈的高光和深色阴影，突出了机器人的形态和质感。将女孩与展示品隔开的玻璃屏障上，反射的光线清晰可见。在主机器人人偶的后面，许多其他较小的动漫女孩人偶排列在同一个展示柜的架子上，为展示增添了深度和背景。在背景中，在女孩人偶的后面，被浅景深部分遮挡的，是密密麻麻地摆放着各种商品的架子，可能是动漫人偶、DVD 或其他收藏品，色调较暖。背景经过柔和虚化，采用散景效果，将焦点吸引到女孩人偶和机器人展示之间的前景互动上，营造出一种让人联想到收藏家房间或专业爱好商店的场景。','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'74f13b8a-9efe-433f-bdd9-90f37638fc84','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285838,864,'the scene is depicted with bright,even illumination consistent with a retail environment. the image portrays an aisle within what appears to be a hobby or model kit store,densely stocked with merchandise. white metal shelving units line the walls,filled neatly with numerous packaged model kits. the boxes predominantly feature artwork of futuristic mecha,spaceships,and particularly female characters integrated with cybernetic or mechanical components,rendered in a similar anime aesthetic. many boxes share a color scheme involving shades of pink,white,and grey,suggesting a specific product line or theme.dominating the central background is a large,eye-catching vertical display or poster showcasing a detailed illustration of a female character. this character embodies a blend of human and machine,clad in minimal,form-fitting cybernetic armor that reveals significant portions of her physique while incorporating complex mechanical elements,including large weapon attachments and propulsion units extending from her back and arms. she has long,dark hair and large,expressive eyes typical of the genre,gazing towards the viewer.in the foreground and midground,shoppers interact with the environment. on the right,a young boy and a slightly younger girl,presumably siblings,are shown from the back and side respectively. the boy stands observing the shelves,while the girl reaches towards a stack of model kit boxes placed on the floor,seemingly examining them. both are dressed casually. partially visible in the extreme foreground is the head and shoulders of another young girl with similar hair color to the central character,adding depth to the scene but obscuring the lower portion of the view. the overall composition emphasizes the abundance of specialized merchandise and the consumer environment associated with anime and mecha model kits.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'619a7c40-83d1-46ff-8307-e60890e3ba14','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285839,864,'{{limited palette}}},floating digital data stream hair with dynamic motion trails,glowing circuit patterns across skin,holographic particle emissions,asymmetric cyberpunk composition,blank white void background,45-degree tilted dutch angle camera,prismatic iridescent hair colors with chromatic shift,cyberpunk aesthetic with urban decay elements,neon blue-pink highlights,translucent fiber-optic hair strands with data packet transfer effect,dynamic motion lines suggesting movement,futuristic sci-fi atmosphere,glowing cyan eyes with hud elements,techwear accessories including illuminated arm bands,floating geometric polygonal shapes,digital glitch effects with scan lines,chromatic aberration artifacts,cybernetic facial implants with gold circuitry,backlit silhouette effect,floating disconnected ui elements,data cable tendrils,electromagnetic field distortion,augmented reality overlay,biometric display fragments,nanotech swarm particles,retractable visor mechanism,kinetic energy glow,quantum computing motifs,neural interface nodes','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'e1f2bac2-305e-456b-80c9-ff4a1e54b7b8','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285840,864,'翻译：带有动态运动轨迹的浮动数字数据流头发、皮肤上发光的电路图案、全息粒子发射、不对称赛博朋克构图、空白的白色空白背景、45 度倾斜的荷兰角相机、带有色度变化的棱柱形彩虹色头发颜色、带有城市衰败元素的赛博朋克美学、霓虹蓝粉色高光、带有数据包传输效果的半透明光纤发束、暗示运动的动态运动线、未来科幻氛围、带有 HUD 元素的发光青色眼睛、包括发光臂章在内的科技服饰配饰、浮动的几何多边形、带有扫描线的数字故障效果、色差伪影、带有金色电路的控制论面部植入物、背光轮廓效果、浮动断开的 UI 元素、数据线卷须、电磁场畸变、增强现实叠加、生物识别显示碎片、纳米技术群粒子、可伸缩遮阳板机制、动能辉光、量子计算图案、神经接口节点','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'177d3d6d-7435-4141-a976-59fbc66febb3','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285841,864,'complex 3d render ultra detailed of a beautiful porcelain profile woman android face,cyborg,robotic parts,150 mm,beautiful studio soft light,rim light,vibrant details,luxurious cyberpunk,lace,hyperrealistic,anatomical,facial muscles,cable electric wires,microchip,octane render,h. r. giger style,robot,silver halmet,full body,sitting,human head,legs diverged slightly','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'4042bfc0-9773-4af2-a170-f5256d2bb290','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285842,864,'翻译：复杂的 3D 渲染，超详细的美丽瓷器轮廓女人机器人脸，机器人，机器人部件，150 毫米，美丽的工作室柔光，边缘光，充满活力的细节，奢华的赛博朋克，蕾丝，超现实主义，解剖，面部肌肉，电缆电线，微芯片，辛烷值渲染，H. R. Giger 风格，机器人，银色头盔，全身，坐着，人头，腿略微分开','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'b57b0205-7f81-4f86-9893-2213e96e40b3','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285843,864,'looking at viewer,smile,:d,parody,meme,a digital illustration shoot from above about a close-up view of a character lying on a bed with a focus on her lower body,lying on her stomach on a white bed with her legs spread apart,wearing black thigh-high stockings and a short black skirt. on the right side of the image,who appears to be lying down with a relaxed expression,flowing manner,casting gentle shadows on her body. the background is simple and uncluttered,with a light blue sky visible in the top right corner. the overall style is anime-inspired,with smooth shading and detailed textures.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'fde755c5-4aea-4a25-8770-2830a0dc433a','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285844,864,'翻译：看着观众、微笑、：d、模仿、模因、从上方拍摄的数字插图，特写镜头中一个角色躺在床上，重点是她的下半身，她趴在白色的床上，双腿张开，穿着黑色过膝袜和黑色短裙。在图像的右侧，她似乎表情放松、举止流畅地躺着，在她身上投下柔和的阴影。背景简洁整洁，右上角可见淡蓝色的天空。整体风格是动漫风格，阴影平滑，纹理细致。','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'a187e176-9bb7-4f0b-bcf6-c365e87963dd','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285845,864,'looking at viewer,smile,long sleeves,bare shoulders,standing,collarbone,white shirt,:d,pleated skirt,detached sleeves,puffy sleeves,black skirt,miniskirt,black footwear,collar,crop top,sleeves past wrists,hand on own hip,strapless,red skirt,blue bow,white skirt,leg up,standing on one leg,multicolored clothes,puffy long sleeves,clothes writing,spikes,black collar,layered sleeves,tube top,key,short over long sleeves,spiked collar,mouse,asymmetrical sleeves,blue sleeves,multicolored skirt,cheese,strapless shirt,mismatched sleeves,yellow sleeves,yellow socks,a vibrant and colorful digital illustration of a cute,a short black skirt,and yellow gloves. she is positioned in the middle of the image,a small smile,and is standing with one hand on her hip and the other holding a small blue bag. her body is slim,and she has a playful and confident pose. the background is a colorful,abstract pattern with geometric shapes and pastel colors,including pink,blue,yellow,and green. the overall style is reminiscent of japanese manga and anime art,with bold lines and vibrant colors that bring out the character''s cheerful and playful demeanor.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'857a753f-140c-448e-9b38-e397b5721418','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285846,864,'翻译：看着观众，微笑，长袖，裸肩，站立，锁骨，白衬衫，：d，百褶裙，分离袖子，泡泡袖，黑裙，迷你裙，黑色鞋类，衣领，露脐上衣，袖子过腕，手放在臀部，露肩，红裙子，蓝色蝴蝶结，白裙子，腿向上，单腿站立，多彩多姿的衣服，蓬松的长袖，衣服写作，尖刺，黑色衣领，分层袖子，抹胸，钥匙，短袖长袖，尖刺衣领，老鼠，不对称袖子，蓝色袖子，多彩多姿的裙子，奶酪，露肩衬衫，不匹配的袖子，黄色袖子，黄色袜子，一个充满活力和色彩鲜艳的可爱数字插图，一条黑色短裙和黄色手套。她位于图像中间，面带微笑，一只手放在臀部，另一只手拿着一个蓝色的小袋子。她身材苗条，姿势俏皮而自信。背景是色彩鲜艳的抽象图案，具有几何形状和柔和的色彩，包括粉色、蓝色、黄色和绿色。整体风格让人联想到日本漫画和动画艺术，大胆的线条和鲜艳的色彩展现了角色开朗俏皮的风度。','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'032a3b3b-ba68-4d32-b73f-39db9c52a86a','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285847,864,'pixel art,8bit style,popup window frame with blinking alert icon,pixel heart (animated pulse effect),envelope with wax seal stamp,upper body portrait,1girl,solo,chibi proportions (2.5 head ratio),square pixels clearly visible,limited 16-color palette,retro game aesthetic (NES era),CRT scanlines with phosphor glow,neon pixel edges (cyan/magenta shift),floating letter particles in background,blinking text cursor (underscore animation),vhs distortion with tracking errors,16:9 aspect ratio,isometric perspective with parallax layers,dotted line border (golden ratio spacing),mail notification icon (exclamation mark inside star),90s computer interface (beige UI elements),digital glitch effect (random pixel shifts),low poly count (visible triangle meshes),flat shading with dithering patterns,no anti-aliasing,ADDED: floppy disk accessory,pixelated bowtie,binary code background,RGB split effect,command prompt textbox,pixel dust particles,window reflection effect,chromatic aberration,pixel-perfect outlines,data stream ribbon,cassette tape details,command line interface elements','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'b31f9eb1-eaaf-4e87-9ba2-7adc03e0073a','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285848,864,'翻译：像素艺术、8 位风格、带有闪烁警报图标的弹出窗口框架、像素心脏（动画脉冲效果）、带有蜡封邮票的信封、上身肖像、1个女孩、独奏、赤壁比例（2.5 头部比例）、方形像素清晰可见、有限的 16 色调色板、复古游戏美学（NES 时代）、带有荧光粉的 CRT 扫描线、霓虹灯像素边缘（青色/品红色偏移）、背景中的浮动字母颗粒、闪烁的文本光标（下划线动画）、带有跟踪错误的 vhs 失真、16：9 宽高比、具有视差层的等距透视、虚线边框（黄金比例间距）、邮件通知图标（星内的感叹号）、90 年代计算机界面（米色 UI 元素）、数字故障效果（随机像素偏移）、低多边形数量（可见三角形网格）、带有抖动图案的平面阴影、无抗锯齿文本框、像素灰尘颗粒、窗口反射效果、色差、像素完美轮廓、数据流带、磁带细节、命令行界面元素','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'fb128702-1aaa-4744-b602-cbef1845f85e','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285849,864,'in a high-fantasy,futuristic art style reminiscent of modern video game concept art,the scene features numerous holographic user interface elements displaying in-game statistics and data. at the center,a woman with blue eyes,cloaked in a dark hood,conjures a glowing,shimmering orb of light as if beginning a magical incantation. behind her stands a shadowy,armored figure,a sheathed sword at their side,acting as a guardian. floating screens surround the pair,filled with detailed readouts and character statistics written in an indecipherable,ancient script,suggesting the rules of an intricate card game. the color palette emphasizes deep purples,blues,and blacks in the shadows,sharply contrasted by the intense,electric greens,yellows,and lighter blues emanating from the light orb and outlining the forms,consistent with a digital painting aesthetic featuring vibrant neon accents.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'5732506c-afd6-4a18-ba33-1f730f59dedf','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285850,864,'a weathered wooden gate with curved ceramic roof tiles stands surrounded by dense tropical foliage under dappled sunlight. dozens of folded paper cranes in rainbow colors hang from invisible strings between maple branches,fluttering above moss-covered stone steps. a carved stone monument bearing japanese inscriptions partially emerges from ferns beside the path,its surface speckled with light penetrating through leafy canopy.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'bc51919d-0510-4444-976d-57e2bb88e36a','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285851,864,'this is a pixel art illustration in a retro anime style,characterized by a color palette dominated by deep blues,purples,and contrasting pinks with bright white accents,defined by distinct pixelated outlines,and an overall blocky,pixelated texture. the image employs a dark theme,with strong backlighting originating from a prominent circular celestial body,creating a moody lighting effect where elements appear to glow in the dark.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'105d9c1f-9219-42b8-a6a7-2802d5a838a3','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285852,864,'the composition is centered around three female characters rendered in an anime aesthetic. the central figure,positioned prominently against a large,luminous white circular backdrop suggestive of a full moon,gazes directly forward with an enigmatic expression. she possesses long,flowing blue hair that cascades over her shoulders and wears attire that hints at a fantasy or mystical setting,with discernible details in her clothing despite the pixelated rendering. flanking her are two other female characters,contributing to a balanced triangular arrangement. the character on the left,featuring shorter,tousled reddish-pink hair,is depicted from a three-quarter back view,her head turned slightly as if looking towards or past the central figure. the character on the right,distinguished by long,flowing pink hair and a noticeable antenna-like ahoge,is presented in profile,gazing towards the central character,her features clearly defined against the dark background.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'d10a13e7-adc2-4060-b81f-766b5a42587d','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285853,864,'dominating the mid-ground,beneath the trio of characters,is a prominent title in large,stylized white japanese script,this title is intricately interwoven with ornate,pixelated filigree patterns resembling stylized floral motifs or baroque scrollwork,rendered in shades of blue,light blue,and white,adding a layer of decorative complexity to the visual hierarchy. the background consists of a dark,deep blue expanse,simulating a night sky,which is subtly animated with small,twinkling pixelated stars and delicate vertical streaks of light that suggest a gentle fall of celestial particles,enhancing the ethereal atmosphere.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'5343a4cd-84c6-426c-b6b9-e0c44a9b65e3','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285854,864,'at the bottom of the frame,three distinct rectangular buttons,characteristic of a video game''s main menu interface,are aligned horizontally. these buttons are rendered with a pixelated bevel effect,giving them a slightly three-dimensional appearance. each button features capitalized english text in a bold,sans-serif pixel font. the leftmost button reads "start." the central button displays "jrpg," with the smaller subtext "continue" positioned directly beneath it. the rightmost button is labeled "exit." the overall visual presentation strongly suggests a title screen for a japanese role-playing game (jrpg),skillfully evoking a sense of mystery,adventure,and nostalgia through its thematic elements,character designs,and dedicated retro pixel art execution.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'4ca96921-efcb-4077-b52b-7188e6e25390','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285855,864,'在画面底部，三个独特的矩形按钮水平排列，这体现了电子游戏主菜单界面的典型特征。这些按钮采用像素化斜面效果渲染，略带三维效果。每个按钮都以粗体无衬线像素字体显示大写英文。最左侧的按钮显示“开始”。中间的按钮显示“jrpg”，其下方则显示较小的副标题“继续”。最右侧的按钮显示“退出”。整体视觉效果强烈地暗示着一款日式角色扮演游戏 (jrpg) 的标题画面，巧妙地通过其主题元素、角色设计和精致的复古像素艺术营造出神秘、冒险和怀旧的氛围。','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'34e88292-8d74-4386-b980-afe6fe6643e3','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285856,864,'1girl,riding dinosaur,sweet lolita style,pastel color palette,frilly sundress,straw hat with ribbon,knee-high socks,mary jane shoes,fluffy hair with flower clips,happy expression,open mouth smile,sparkling eyes,candy-colored gradient background,floating hearts,soft lighting,chubby cheeks,windblown skirt,sunshine glow,cherry blossom petals,watercolor texture,round animal ears,pastel gradient stockings,bubblegum pink accents,oversized bow tie,candy necklace,ferocious dinosaur,sharp teeth,glowing eyes,armored scales,volcanic background,smoke effects,molten lava cracks,towering posture,shadow casting,roaring expression,prehistoric jungle,towering ferns,ancient ruins,dynamic pose,claws extended,spiked tail,glowing markings,battle scars,menacing aura','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'6e829dee-9efd-458e-b7e5-d59a0a525180','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285857,864,'翻译：1girl、骑乘恐龙、甜美洛丽塔风格、柔和的色调、褶边太阳裙、带丝带的草帽、及膝袜、玛丽珍鞋、带花夹的蓬松头发、幸福的表情、张开的嘴巴微笑、闪闪发光的眼睛、糖果色的渐变背景、漂浮的心、柔和的灯光、胖乎乎的脸颊、被风吹拂的裙子、阳光照耀、樱花花瓣、水彩纹理、圆形动物耳朵、柔和的渐变长袜、泡泡糖粉色点缀、超大领结、糖果项链、凶猛的恐龙、锋利的牙齿、发光的眼睛、装甲鳞片、火山背景、烟雾效果、熔岩裂缝、高耸的姿势、阴影投射、咆哮的表情、史前丛林、高耸的蕨类植物、古代遗迹、动态姿势、伸出的爪子、尖刺的尾巴、发光的标记、战斗伤痕、险恶的气氛','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'f883eed7-fab1-4155-aefb-e6c75ad10a27','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285858,864,'victory pose,both hands making v-sign near cheeks,slightly tilted head,mischievous wink with one eye closed,tongue slightly sticking out,fluffy oversized sweater with paw prints,pastel color knee-high socks with stripes,glowing sparkle effects around fingers,wooden floor background with scattered crayons,chalkboard with doodles in background,rainbow gradient shadow,floating hearts and stars particles,cheeks puffed slightly,knee-socks with asymmetrical patterns,oversized sweater slipping off one shoulder,cute animal slippers,rainbow suspenders,stacked crayon boxes as seat,giant plush toy beside character,watercolor splatter effect','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'56b781c6-9962-476e-b3de-e775fdce6fa5','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285859,864,'翻译：胜利姿势，双手在脸颊附近做出V字手势，头部微微倾斜，闭上一只眼睛调皮地眨眼，舌头微微伸出，带有爪印的蓬松超大毛衣，带有条纹的柔和色彩及膝袜，手指周围闪烁着闪光效果，散落着蜡笔的木地板背景，背景中带有涂鸦的黑板，彩虹渐变阴影，漂浮的心和星星粒子，脸颊微微鼓起，带有不对称图案的及膝袜，从一侧肩膀滑落的超大毛衣，可爱的动物拖鞋，彩虹吊带，堆叠的蜡笔盒作为座位，人物旁边的巨型毛绒玩具，水彩飞溅效果','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'af860947-0792-4245-9b6d-ed7d7f682c2c','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285860,864,'a dynamic fantasy illustration with a cool aesthetic,rendered with painterly textures and subtle brushwork. features an eerie,surreal atmosphere,employing dramatic,high-contrast lighting like rim light or backlighting,and glowing elements to evoke a mythic,poignant narrative.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'2a390fa9-9ba6-4984-b5c9-8eed8615824e','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285861,864,'late at night,seen from a slightly high angle,kneeling beside large,empty bed,her hands clasped in a silent prayer or wish. her sakura pink hair,tipped with sky blue,catches the warm,singular light spilling from a small bedside lamp,casting long,soft shadows across the room. her maid outfit is immaculate,and her expression,though mostly obscured by her bowed head,hints at unwavering loyalty and a touch of melancholy longing for presence. quiet devotion,solitary vigil,warm intimacy,dramatic shadows.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'b8717beb-6602-46d4-b3de-5a323a5d8098','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285862,864,'{{{full body}}},the grandmaster,master style,sharp action,solo,a girl,closed eyes,quiet,flaming eyes,eye trail,she is dressed in a flowing white taoist robe layered over a gray long shirt,bare shoulder,sprint,meditate,ink splash,chic and elegant,meditate,one flower,one world; one leaf,one bodhi.heaven and earth have righteousness,beautiful mountains and rivers','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'f9101430-0712-484b-a788-8ab12b33a6c0','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
