INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285864,864,'a girl wears a puffy dark blue coat with fur trim,an orange knit hat,and light blue jeans,paired with fur-trimmed boots. she smiles with closed eyes,walking through snow while holding a leash attached to a light brown shiba inu (white chest and belly). snowy footprints trail behind them,with trees and a chain-link fence visible in the background under a cloudy winter sky. the composition captures a cozy,playful winter stroll.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'c0972f2b-eaa0-4ebe-83c2-aa402ac0be09','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285865,864,'this is a technical illustration in a detailed schematic style,featuring a predominantly monochrome (black ink on off-white grid paper) palette with a blue accent,characterized by precise yet slightly textured linework and texture rendering through detailed lines and stark black shading suggesting metallic surfaces.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'54c33d7d-3de9-47d0-b10d-866687c834b0','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285866,864,'the image utilizes strong,hard lighting,evidenced by the high-contrast shading on the subject and the distinct,sharp-edged blue shadow it casts upon the underlying grid.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'64f7ee43-7625-429f-9314-78cd62bc7108','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285867,864,'presented as a technical blueprint on gridded paper,the central subject is a heavily armed,bipedal combat mech shown in a three-quarter perspective,angled slightly towards the viewer''s left. the machine possesses a robust and utilitarian design,constructed from angular plates,exposed joints,and numerous mechanical components. its posture is stable,supported by powerful,reverse-jointed legs terminating in large,flat feet designed for traction and weight distribution. intricate details such as pistons,actuators,and segmented armor are visible on the limbs. the main chassis,or torso,is boxy and substantial,likely housing the primary systems and cockpit,indicated by a sloped front section with small sensor arrays or viewports. prominently mounted weaponry includes two large cannons extending backwards over the shoulders and a multi-barrel rotary cannon affixed to the front-left aspect of the torso. the illustration employs heavy black ink for shading,utilizing both solid fills and dense cross-hatching to convey form,depth,and the metallic nature of the mech''s surfaces. surrounding the mech are various elements typical of a schematic diagram,including text boxes,leader lines pointing to specific components (labeled with placeholder text like "power system," "weapon system," "control system"),inset diagrams showing alternate views or details in the lower-left corner,and title blocks in the upper-left and lower-right corners. a distinctive solid blue shadow is cast by the mech onto the grid background,indicating a directional light source from the upper left and adding a layer of dimensionality to the otherwise flat presentation format.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'161bc0f7-cc75-408a-a84f-014da9c163bd','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285868,864,'the image utilizes strong,hard lighting,evidenced by the high-contrast shading on the subject and the distinct,sharp-edged shadow it casts upon the underlying grid.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'389a3052-22e7-435c-aa6f-38e167f600c8','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285869,864,'presented as a technical blueprint on gridded paper,the central subject is a banshee gundam shown in a three-quarter perspective,angled slightly towards the viewer''s left. the illustration employs heavy black ink for shading,utilizing both solid fills and dense cross-hatching to convey form,depth,and the metallic nature of the mech''s surfaces. surrounding the mech are various elements typical of a schematic diagram,including text boxes,leader lines pointing to specific components (labeled with placeholder text like "power system," "weapon system," "control system"),inset diagrams showing alternate views or details in the lower-left corner,and title blocks in the upper-left and lower-right corners.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'ca6db930-4516-4e94-98c9-8f22835517db','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285870,864,'looking at viewer,smile,hand up,nail polish,fingernails,sketch,tattoo,dutch angle,glowing,black background,portrait,cross,fire,black nails,veil,glowing eyes,blue nails,spot color,high collar,blue theme,long bangs,nun,habit,limited palette,glowing eye,blue fire,barcode,flaming eye,light trail,traditional nun,barcode tattoo,eye trail,this digital drawing features a close-up of a young girl,emitting a faint blue glow from her left eye. she has a pale complexion and is dressed in a white and grey outfit,with black accents. the background is stark black with splashes of blue,creating a dramatic and intense atmosphere. the girl''s hand is raised,palm open,fingers splayed,as if casting a spell. the lighting is artificial,with the blue glow intensifying the scene. the style is reminiscent of anime with sharp lines and high contrast. the image is angled slightly from below,emphasizing the mysterious and powerful aura of the character','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'c75ca182-f3d0-4c7b-94ee-2d73a1fd5b5a','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285871,864,'the image captures a young woman,presumably a musician,in an engaged moment of performance. she is the central figure,presented in a medium close-up shot,angled slightly to the viewer''s left. her head is tilted downwards,her gaze directed towards the instrument she is playing or slightly away from the microphone. dark,wavy,shoulder-length hair frames her face,emerging from beneath a black,peaked military-style cap which features a gold-colored circular emblem,possibly a wreath or insignia,on its front. her facial features are distinct,with a pale complexion providing a contrast to her dark hair and the vibrant red lipstick applied to her full lips. she appears to be singing or have just finished a vocal line,as her lips are slightly parted near a black,professional-grade microphone mounted on a stand positioned directly before her.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'3788113a-7ce2-4d1d-a8c4-820ff14ad0e8','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285872,864,'her attire consists of a dark navy or black zip-up jacket,which is worn partially unzipped and draped off her left shoulder. this reveals a significant portion of her left arm and shoulder,as well as a white or light-colored v-neck top underneath. the open v-neck of the top and the way the jacket is worn expose a considerable area of her upper chest and cleavage. an in-ear monitor is visible in her left ear,indicative of a professional musical performance setting. clipped to her jacket,near her left armpit,is a small,dark rectangular electronic device,likely a wireless transmitter pack for her instrument or microphone.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'bfe34622-544b-48fa-814b-0e26059c52e0','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285873,864,'she is actively playing a reddish-brown electric bass guitar,identified by its four thick strings and the visible headstock with tuning pegs. her right hand is captured fretting the strings on the neck of the guitar. a patterned guitar strap,predominantly green with intricate lighter-colored details,runs over her right shoulder and diagonally across her chest,supporting the instrument. the background of the photograph is softly blurred,creating a bokeh effect,which emphasizes the subject. this out-of-focus backdrop consists of diffuse shapes in pale pink and blue hues,with larger,bright circular forms in the upper left quadrant that suggest out-of-focus stage lights or other elements of a performance venue. the overall impression is one of concentration and artistic expression within a live music environment.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'9ff66e89-68c6-4252-94c6-8b781a924ff4','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285874,864,'翻译：照片捕捉到了一位年轻女子，大概是一位音乐家，正沉浸在表演之中。她是画面中心人物，以中特写镜头呈现，角度略微偏向观看者的左侧。她低着头，目光直视着正在演奏的乐器，或略微远离麦克风。一头齐肩的深色波浪卷发勾勒出她的脸庞，从一顶黑色尖顶军帽下露出，帽檐上有一个金色的圆形徽章，可能是花环或徽章。她的五官清晰，苍白的肤色与她深色的头发和涂在丰满嘴唇上的鲜艳红色唇膏形成鲜明对比。她似乎正在唱歌，或者刚刚唱完一段歌，因为她的嘴唇微微张开，靠近一个黑色的专业级麦克风，麦克风就架在她正前方的支架上。她的着装是一件深蓝色或黑色的拉链夹克，拉链部分拉开，披在她的左肩上。照片中，她左臂和左肩的大部分露了出来，里面是一件白色或浅色的v领上衣。v领的敞开和夹克的穿法，让她上胸部和乳沟的大片区域都暴露在外。她的左耳上戴着一个入耳式耳机，这表明她身处专业的音乐表演场所。她的夹克上，靠近左腋窝的地方，夹着一个小型的深色矩形电子设备，很可能是她乐器或麦克风的无线发射器。','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'31b183d3-c70d-46e5-816c-7678ff4c066d','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285875,864,'foreground effect),floor-to-ceiling window,girl seen through glass,sitting on wooden chair,one leg up on chair,hugging own leg,head resting on knee,staring blankly out window,blank expression,vacant stare,melancholic mood,sad eyes,soft indoor lighting emanating from room,cozy room details visible through window (e.g.bookshelf,dim lamp),reflections on wet window surface (showing faint outside elements or blurring interior),dark moody atmosphere,cool color palette,cinematic shot,medium shot from outside,eye level with girl through window,slight condensation on inner window pane (optional,if warm inside','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'4c399b0e-1966-43c8-b72c-7752ac24e36e','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
