INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285879,864,'the artwork depicts a vibrant coastal landscape under a bright,cloud-dappled sky. in the lower right foreground,two figures,viewed from behind,stand upon a grassy and rocky slope overlooking the water. they appear equipped for a journey,each wearing a wide-brimmed,straw-like hat and carrying a substantial backpack; the figure on the left leans on a wooden walking stick,while the one on the right has coiled rope and other gear attached to their pack. their gaze is directed towards the scene unfolding before them: a tranquil bay and a prominent headland. the shoreline curves from the left foreground into the middle ground,composed of earth-toned rocks and pebbles of varying sizes,some partially submerged in the clear,turquoise water where underwater stones are visible through the calm surface. jutting into the bay from the left is a small peninsula or headland,dominated by a large,ancient-looking tree with a distinctive,gnarled structure. its substantial trunk features exposed,pale,almost white bark interspersed with streaks of reddish-brown,twisting upwards towards a dense canopy of green foliage. several white birds are depicted in flight around the tree and scattered across the expansive blue sky. the water of the bay reflects the bright sky,transitioning from turquoise near the shore to deeper blues further out. across the water,a hazy,distant landmass forms the horizon line. the sky itself is rendered with dynamic,loose brushstrokes,conveying a sense of light and atmosphere with soft white clouds against the cerulean backdrop. white text in a handwritten style is overlaid at the top,reading "artwork by frank","to the beach",and the date "2025.4.16". the entire composition is framed by a thin,slightly textured white border.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'87b7d7b3-e2c2-423d-ac58-0ec6896bc0f8','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
