INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285905,864,'looking at viewer,expressionless,closed mouth,hand up,half-closed eye,eyelasheep hatching,view from below. a young girl is standing in front of the viewer with her back to the viewer. she is wearing a black dress that reaches her knees and has large breasts. the girl''s hands are clenched into fists and she looks down at the viewer with a serious expression on her face. her mouth is closed and there is no blush on her cheeks. the background is white.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'658c98a4-3eea-431d-bc3a-d507fa434f54','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285906,864,'翻译：{{{{线性阴影}}}},{{{{素描}}}},{{{{白色背景}}}},{{{{单色}}}},{{{{透视缩短}}}},{{{{蓝色主题}}}},{{{{灰度主题}}}},{{{{简单背景}}}},{{{{tareme}}}},{{{{卡通人物}}}},{{阴影（纹理）}}','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'b4507143-7a02-43a4-be30-7bed1fdc4748','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285907,864,'a soft-spoken girl in a loose cardigan sits by the window of a quiet backstreet café,golden sunlight filtering through the lace curtains,casting delicate patterns on the wooden table,ceramic mug in hand still steaming gently,the hum of conversation blending with the distant chime of a tram bell,light dust dancing in the rays like slow-moving snow,trailing ivy outside gently swaying with the breeze,glass bottles on the windowsill glowing amber in the light,warm tones of cream,maple,and faded blue form a nostalgic color palette,asymmetrical framing with an off-center teacup and a half-eaten croissant,background blurred into softness with subtle textures of worn wood and chalkboard menus,a tabby cat curled beneath a sunlit chair,the faint sound of a record player spinning an old jazz tune,a moment suspended in stillness and light,evoking themes of simplicity,comfort,and the quiet rhythm of everyday life.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'ed67b344-53c0-40e5-a0af-3073b89fcb8b','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285908,864,'a girl seated by window,translucent curtain,embroidered silk robe,handheld round fan,soft afternoon light,lush green garden,hanging vines,porcelain teacup,lotus pond reflection,golden sunlight filtering through leaves,traditional lattice window,faint mist,harmonious composition,muted pastel tones.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'02b27bdd-61e0-4e2a-8710-6a66950ea396','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285909,864,'barefoot,bare shoulders,collarbone,a girl wears a very short two-strap yellow dress with orange horizontal neckline. a layer of translucent white fabric extends downward from beneath her dress. mini white bloomers with orange bowtie. a red ribbon with red tassels and a green jade pendant is secured at her waist. a jade bracelet encircles one wrist. around her neck hangs a gold necklace featuring jade gemstones. a simple metal ring wraps around her ankle. her attire features a fluffy white stole. she holds a golden lantern steady in her hand.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'c5f45059-1bfb-40d6-a7b1-46919e6bae7d','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285910,864,'gothic lolita,defeated low-tier enemy pose,glitchy tears vfx,broken gamepad weapon,pixel art trash mob label floating,torn gamer jersey (size xl),dropped pixel coins,crt static aura,"wasted" text flicker,one sneaker missing,kneeling on pixel grass,chibi protest sign "easy mode plz",band-aid on nose,safety shorts visible,pixel strawberry milk spill','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'4da5dcd0-1564-4a6c-b3fe-8973645a3902','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285911,864,'翻译：哥特式洛丽塔，击败低级敌人的姿势，故障的眼泪视觉特效，破损的游戏手柄武器，像素艺术垃圾暴徒标签漂浮，撕裂的游戏玩家球衣（尺寸xl），掉落的像素硬币，crt静态光环，“浪费”文本闪烁，一只运动鞋丢失，跪在像素草地上，赤壁抗议标志“请进入简单模式”，鼻子上的创可贴，安全短裤可见，像素草莓牛奶溢出','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'b0b02ba0-fc6a-4a56-a8b3-2d935ae46d59','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285912,864,'a dark and foreboding graveyard,a monstrous beast flees from the fury of a young woman. long blonde hair flows in the night air as she chases it,her piercing eyes filled with anger and determination. tears stream down her face,yet she remains unwavering in her pursuit. dark theme,the horror theme is palpable; an atmosphere of dread hangs heavy in the air. a graveyard full of ancient tombstones looms ominously behind them,adding to the surreal scene. amidst all this chaos and terror,there is an undeniable sense of bravery emanating from this determined heroine','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'bbb3f3ba-19ff-4c58-a46d-b5208b7ceb58','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285913,864,'extreme anger,motion blur,vibrating with rage,steam coming from head,red face,veins popping,clenched teeth,flying hair,shaking fists,distorted facial features,comic-style anger lines,exaggerated expression,floating exclamation marks,messy hair,glowing eyes,spittle flying,cartoonish rage aura,torn clothing edges,floating debris,dynamic action lines,dramatic perspective,chibi proportions,super deformed style,vibrating outline,speed lines,floating anger symbols,chaotic background,scribbly shading','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'da809530-ae72-458e-973f-d8ba1ba9f02c','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285914,864,'this is a digital painting in a highly expressionist style,filled with a chaotic and violent energy. a vague human figure occupies the center of the frame. its facial features are rendered unrecognizable by rough,powerful brushstrokes and splattered colors,making it seem as if it''s undergoing a violent disintegration or letting out a scream. the color palette is dominated by deep blacks,fiery reds,and stark yellows. these high-contrast colors collide and merge,creating a visual effect reminiscent of burning or an explosion. the brushwork is wild and unconventional,featuring a mix of heavy textures,sharp scratching marks,and splattered spots. these chaotic textures combine to construct the figure''s inner turmoil,be it pain,rage,or ecstasy. light seems to burst forth from within the figure itself,especially in the facial area,where highlights of red and yellow resemble burning embers,creating a stark contrast with the surrounding darkness. the overall atmosphere of the painting is dark,surreal,and charged with a raw,unrestrained emotional power.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'73449d23-4abe-4940-9148-79ed8f84c745','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285915,864,'blue sky,white clouds,aerial platform,black-haired girl,black cat,silhouette contrast,intricate metal structure,hanging cables,pendulum swaying below,cool color palette,mysterious atmosphere,peaceful scene,wind blowing hair,distant horizon,platform extending into distance,standing side by side,facing away from viewer,gradient lighting,soft shadows,geometric shapes,industrial elements,suspended architecture,minimalist composition,close-up shot,leaning against railing,hair flowing in wind,cat tail curling around leg,platform swaying slightly,sun rays breaking through clouds,atmospheric perspective,warm highlights on cold surfaces,reflective metal surfaces,safety harness straps,distant birds in flight,platform edge fading into mist,girl''s hand resting on cat''s back,dynamic balance composition,cinematic framing,shallow depth of field.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'2aee2f28-dc42-4e30-a3a4-90353a69b8da','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
