INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285924,864,'lone explorer with backpack standing in awe beneath colossal futuristic megastructure reaching impossibly high into cloudy sky,massive cylindrical architecture with intricate geometric paneling and industrial framework creating cathedral-like interior space,dramatic low-angle perspective emphasizing the overwhelming scale of the monumental construction,soft diffused lighting filtering through atmospheric haze and structural openings casting ethereal blue-tinted illumination,detailed technical drawing style with precise architectural linework and realistic shading,science fiction concept art aesthetic blending brutalist concrete forms with advanced engineering elements,scattered debris and weathered surfaces suggesting post-apocalyptic or abandoned setting,monochromatic blue color palette creating melancholic and contemplative mood,anime-influenced character design with small human figure providing scale reference against the titanic environment,cinematic composition capturing themes of human insignificance and technological sublime in dystopian future landscape.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'9281db6c-b6a0-4d6c-82c7-101f8843725e','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285925,864,'from attack on titan,serene expression,sleeping peacefully,a single tear on cheek,resting head on eren''s chest,{{red scarf}},wrapped around her neck,{eren jaeger (spirit)},ghost,ethereal,{translucent},made of light,luminous,gentle smile,looking down at mikasa,one hand gently caressing her hair,his body slightly fading,lying on a grassy field,under the lone tree on a hill,dappled sunlight,god rays','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'693e7d39-c45d-4960-8fe1-b084f92b1c23','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285926,864,'holding weapon,staff,weapon on back,headband,red headband,jacket,white coat,red vest,striped sleeves,black shirt,black shorts,black gloves,boots,standing,full body,looking at viewer,door,open door,doorway in the sky,exit sign,glowing sign,holding door,hand on doorknob,stepping out,surreal,scenery,night,night sky,star (sky),moon,crescent moon,bird,clouds,clouds in foreground,field,grass,house,text,english text,warm lighting,glowing,the image features a female character,centrally positioned and framed within a brightly lit,open doorway. she is depicted mid-stride,stepping forward through the doorway towards the viewer,with her body angled slightly to her left (viewer''s right) while her head is turned to look directly forward. her left hand is positioned on the handle of the open door,holding it steady. the doorway itself acts as a portal,located in the middle ground of the composition,seemingly floating in a dark night sky. a large,fluffy mass of clouds occupies the entire foreground,situated at the character''s feet and below the floating doorway,obscuring the bottom of the door and her lower legs','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'afb4530f-f99a-4498-a775-4f05941231f2','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285927,864,'subtle expressions,silk slip dress under white shirt,unbuttoned collar,black garter belt visible,one leg in sheer black stockings,other stocking rolled down to mid-thigh,lace-trimmed camisole peeking through shirt gap,pencil skirt hiked up to hips,sitting sideways on office desk,legs crossed asymmetrically,left hand gripping twisted stocking top,head tilted back exposing neck,stocking-clad foot pressing against leather chair,bare foot arching tensely,smudged burgundy lipstick,gradient blush spreading to ears,wet eyelash clumps,sweat-damp bangs,half-lidded gaze with upward glance,bitten lower lip,mascara streak near tear duct,dewy skin highlight on collarbones，scattered documents on mahogany desk,wine bottle tipped near keyboard,silk blouse partially soaked with red liquid,blurred city nightscape outside.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'8855145e-e982-40b4-94d3-3b8cc7e46495','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285928,864,'the city sprawls beneath her like a circuit board come alive—neon arteries pulse with data streams,holographic billboards flicker in smog-choked air,and skyscrapers claw at a starless sky. she stands atop a gargoyle-like drone docking station,her silhouette sharp against the cyan haze of the cyberpunk metropolis. clad in mechanical combat armor,the suit''s angular plates glow faintly at the seams,energy overflow bleeding through cracks in the alloy—a volatile reminder of systems pushed to their limits.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'50e2297e-ecaa-4f3f-8ad2-5249744159fc','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285929,864,'her neon-lit headband hums with a cold,cerulean radiance,casting jagged shadows across her face. mechanical detachment hardens her features; eyes like polished steel lock onto a target far below,pupils flickering with targeting subroutines. one knee braces against the ledge,her body coiled in a sniper''s crouch,a sleek,rail-thin plasma rifle gripped in gloved hands. the weapon''s barrel steadies as she aims downward,crosshairs overlaying a swarm of security drones ascending toward her perch.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'6209e84a-8632-41f3-9f41-5b249764c6af','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285930,864,'around her wrist,a vibrant energy blade flickers to life—a backup weapon humming with unstable magenta plasma,its edges fraying into sparks. the glow licks at the air,reflecting in her armor''s visor like captured lightning.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'80e949b9-dc7a-40e3-9b74-942f523b05f9','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285931,864,'the bird''s-eye view amplifies the chaos: streets teem with faceless crowds and rogue mechs,while her elevated isolation turns the scene into a chessboard. below,a drone''s lens catches her image—an apex predator framed by industrial decay and the sickly glow of corporate logos. her breath fogs the visor for a heartbeat before the suit''s filters scrub the air,leaving only the sterile precision of machine-enhanced resolve.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'46a98be8-a059-4391-bc10-56ea1a941ea4','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
