INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285953,864,'determined expression,swimming upwards,dynamic pose,athletic,underwater effect,surreal seascape,liquid glass,transparent sea,upside down cityscape visible through water,suspended debris,frozen fish school,glowing bubbles,dramatic lighting,chiaroscuro,high contrast,god rays,caustics,light refraction,lens flare,fisheye lens effect,dutch angle,low angle shot,looking up at character,vibrant colors,pink,blue,surreal,abstract,conceptual art,whimsical fantasy,detailed,intricate,painterly,illustration,dynamic composition,strong visual impact,bubble,an illustration of a person floating in the air. the background is filled with vibrant colors and shapes,including pink,blue,green,yellow,and purple. the person appears to be in mid-air,with their arms stretched out to the sides and their legs bent at the knees. the illustration has a dreamlike quality to it,with swirls of different colors creating a sense of movement and energy. they are wearing a white shirt and black pants,and their head is tilted back slightly upwards. the overall effect is one of chaos and destruction','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'bec0985a-7c04-469b-9099-5d25be12b0e3','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285954,864,'fantasy,1girl,the classic character chun li''s semi reclining posture. she was wearing the iconic blue cheongsam,adorned with golden curls,giving the overall outfit a luxurious look. her face is delicate,with a serious expression and a hint of warrior aura. the light and shadow processing in the picture is extremely delicate,especially on her skin and clothing,showing a very realistic texture. her legs show strong muscle lines,with white boots tightly wrapped around her calves and martial arts boots with shoelaces tied around her feet,giving her a sense of strength and beauty overall.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'a8e28315-77f4-4820-a979-9cc121bf6a2d','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285955,864,'翻译：幻想，1girl，经典人物春丽半卧的姿态，她身穿标志性的蓝色旗袍，点缀着金色的卷发，让整体造型显得奢华。她面容精致，表情严肃，略带一丝武士气息。画面中的光影处理极其细腻，尤其是在皮肤和服饰上，呈现出非常逼真的质感。她的腿部展现出强健的肌肉线条，白色的长靴紧紧包裹着她的小腿，脚上系着鞋带的武术靴，整体给人一种力量与美感。','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'9965c93f-a1d4-458b-91ea-cfb0fd0e100c','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
