INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285983,864,'midnight horror atmosphere,decrepit haunted mansion interior,collapsing wooden floorboards,peeling victorian wallpaper,broken chandeliers hanging from ceiling,thick cobwebs covering furniture,flickering candlelight casting dancing shadows,eerie green mist permeating air,floating dust particles,moonlight piercing through shattered windows,extreme low-angle shot from ground perspective,cinematic dutch angle,deep ominous shadows,high-contrast lighting,grimy textures,rotting wooden beams,slimy mold on walls,ghostly floating orbs,intense volumetric fog,suspenseful horror atmosphere,photorealistic details,8k ultra-detailed,dramatic chiaroscuro,fisheye lens distortion effect,motion blur on moving entities,dripping water sounds implied,terrified female student protagonist,torn school uniform (white blouse with ripped collar,navy pleated skirt),knee-high socks sliding down,messy shoulder-length brown hair,wide bloodshot eyes with burst capillaries,dilated pupils reflecting ghost figure,mouth distorted in silent scream,veins protruding on forehead,sweat-drenched pale skin,visible goosebumps on arms,clutching broken flashlight with trembling hands,body contorted in backward stumble,one shoe missing,backpack straps hanging loose,glowing demonic hand gripping her ankle,hyper-detailed facial expression of pure terror,snot dripping from flared nostrils,tear streaks cutting through dirty cheeks,visible breath vapor in cold air','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'b274a224-8262-474a-a3fd-455a14d10b8e','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285984,864,'翻译：午夜恐怖氛围、破旧的鬼屋内部、倒塌的木地板、剥落的维多利亚式墙纸、天花板上悬挂的破碎吊灯、覆盖家具的厚蜘蛛网、摇曳的烛光投射出舞动的阴影、弥漫在空气中的怪异绿色薄雾、漂浮的灰尘颗粒、透过破碎窗户射入的月光、从地面视角的超低角度拍摄、电影般的荷兰角度、深邃不祥的阴影、高对比度照明、肮脏的纹理、腐烂的木梁、墙壁上黏糊糊的霉菌、幽灵般的漂浮球体、强烈的体积雾、悬疑的恐怖氛围、逼真的细节、8k 超细节、戏剧性的明暗对比、鱼眼镜头畸变效果、移动实体上的运动模糊、暗示滴水的声音、惊恐的女学生主角、撕破的校服（白色衬衫，衣领破烂，海军蓝百褶裙）、及膝袜滑落，凌乱齐肩的棕色头发，毛细血管爆裂、布满血丝的大眼睛，瞳孔放大，映出鬼影，无声尖叫时嘴巴扭曲，额头青筋暴起，汗流浃背的苍白皮肤，手臂上起鸡皮疙瘩，颤抖的双手紧紧抓着坏掉的手电筒，身体向后踉跄，一只鞋不见了，背包带松松地挂着，一只发光的恶魔手紧紧抓住她的脚踝，面部表情极其恐惧，鼻涕从张开的鼻孔中滴落，泪痕划破肮脏的脸颊，冷空气中可见呼吸蒸汽','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'55d7034d-5ecb-475d-ab2d-63e8cd9e0760','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285985,864,'1girl,deep pupil,white pupils,diamond pupils,rhombus pupils,slit pupils,diamond-shaped pupils,bright pupils,clear eyes,solo,dynamic angle,{dynamic pose},sweating profusely,{{{{dunking}}}},{{jumping}},{{taking basketball}},{{motion blur}},{{side slit}},{boobside},{{puffy basketball uniform}},{{{whipping breasts}}},{{{shaking breasts}}},shorts,{{sagging breasts}},{{puffy nipples}},{{{lactation}}},{embarrassed},blush,{sweat},school,playground,{basketball court},basketball hoop,sky,crowd,an illustration of a female character in mid-air,performing a dance move. her hair is styled in a messy bun and she has a determined expression on her face. she is wearing a blue and white outfit with a high neckline and short sleeves. the background shows a basketball court with spectators in the stands.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'fcb934fd-5173-46d3-ad3a-ee5a19e2a327','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285986,864,'a young man with spiky dark hair and a somber expression stands in a futuristic city at dusk. he is shown from the waist up,in three-quarters profile,looking down and to his left. he wears a tattered,high-collared black coat that appears weathered and shredded,billowing around him. on his right hand is a black fingerless glove,and this hand rests on the hilt of a katana-style sword. the blade of the sword is not traditional metal but is composed of brilliant,crackling purple energy,akin to lightning,which casts a strong magenta glow on his clothes,arm,and the ground. he is set against a sprawling cityscape of towering,dark skyscrapers with glowing windows in shades of blue,orange,and purple. in the upper right background,a bright blue neon sign on a building reads "nexus-09". the sky is a deep,dark blue,streaked with wispy reddish-pink clouds. the ground appears wet,reflecting the neon lights of the city. the composition is shot from a slightly low angle,with a shallow depth of field that keeps the man and his sword in sharp focus while the cityscape behind him is softly blurred.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'61061e23-fc2a-4c58-873b-8e4f4842b6f2','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285987,864,'翻译：一位年轻男子，一头黑色尖刺，表情阴沉，站在黄昏时分的未来城市中。画面中，他上半身呈四分之三的侧面像，目光向下，目光左倾。他身穿一件破旧的高领黑色外套，饱经风霜，衣衫褴褛，在身旁飘动。他的右手戴着一只黑色的露指手套，这只手握着一把武士刀式长剑的剑柄。剑刃并非传统的金属材质，而是由闪耀的、噼啪作响的紫色能量构成，如同闪电，将他的衣服、手臂和地面投射出强烈的洋红色光芒。他身后是一片广阔的城市景观，高耸入云，摩天大楼鳞次栉比，窗户散发着蓝、橙、紫三色的光芒。画面右上方，一栋建筑上亮蓝色的霓虹灯招牌上写着“Nexus-09”。天空是深蓝色的，点缀着缕缕红粉色的云朵。地面看起来是湿的，反射着城市的霓虹灯。构图是从略低的角度拍摄的，景深较浅，使男人和他的剑保持清晰的焦点，而他身后的城市景观则柔和地模糊了。','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'5b33acda-9692-45df-9b74-16867f75fe93','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285988,864,'1girl,cowboy shot,falling down,broken body,glowing lighting fragments,girl is transforming into pink glowing fragments,girl is breaking,flying spots of fragment,missing hands,half of face,manga cover,light smile,gorgeous scene,ring in the sky','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'374ad963-fad2-44a0-93e1-427481696407','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285989,864,'bodystocking,breast curtain,see-through silhouette,a stunning anime illustration,delicate features,fair skin,wearing a modified black cheongsam with revealing cutouts,holding a red folding fan with calligraphy,looking to the side,elegant pose,indoor setting,light filtering through window panes,fan,folding fan,ponytail,bracelet,earrings,chinese dress,side glance,fair skin,light smile,indoor,window,potted plant,gold trim,tassels,detailed background,soft lighting,serene,gentle,upper body,cleavage,sexy dress,looking away,confident expression,white theme,half-closed eyes,seductive smile','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'3a7924df-3171-4b6c-aacb-664ccf32d6c8','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285990,864,'1girl,from ground,full face shield helmet,fighting,1.5::x logo covered 1eye,text on face shield::,sitting,crossed legs,big buttons,a dark and eerie machinery factory,a white-haired,0.5::girl stands in a combat stance::. she wears glowing white and red warcraft armor with a shoulder-mounted artillery system. her figure is elegant yet exudes an overwhelming intensity. her long hair flows slightly with her movement,and her head is tilted slightly with a stern expression. she wears a transparent glass face shield,giving her a high-tech yet unsettling appearance,dark see-through glass mask covered face,screen on face,her body is embedded with numerous cables,wires,batteries,and screws. exposed mechanical components and energy conduits emit a red glow and light particles,evoking a strong sense of physical terror. in one mechanical hand,2::holding 2handguns::,upper body,mechanical wings extend from her back,with thrusters and cylindrical energy batteries glowing on her armor. her body bears barcodes and identification markings such as "x logo" and "logo 05," suggesting she might be an ai-assisted weapon created for war. the scene is shown in a close-up,cowboy-shot perspective,rich in detail and texture. it''s a visually stunning masterpiece,blending futuristic aesthetics with horror and mech elements into a breathtaking,high-quality image,ai-generated,headgear','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'17f527fe-3954-4779-a981-df9fd51ce03a','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285991,864,'翻译：1girl,来自地面,全脸防护头盔,nsfw,战斗,1.5::x 标志覆盖 1eye,面罩上的文字::,坐着,交叉的双腿,大按钮,黑暗而怪异的机械工厂,白发,0.5::女孩以战斗姿态站立::。她穿着发光的白色和红色魔兽盔甲,配有肩扛式火炮系统。她的身材优雅却散发着压倒性的力量。她的长发随着她的动作微微飘动,她的头微微倾斜,表情严肃。她戴着透明的玻璃面罩,给她一种高科技但令人不安的外观,深色透明玻璃面具遮住了脸,脸上有屏幕,她的身体嵌有许多电缆、电线、电池和螺丝。暴露的机械部件和能量导管发出红光和光粒子,唤起强烈的身体恐惧感。一只机械手握着两把手枪,上身机械翼从她的背部延伸,推进器和圆柱形能量电池在她的盔甲上闪闪发光。她的身上带有条形码和识别标记,例如“x 标志”和“标志 05”,这表明她可能是一件为战争而制造的人工智能辅助武器。场景以特写镜头和牛仔视角呈现,细节丰富,纹理丰富。这是一部视觉上令人惊叹的杰作,将未来主义美学与恐怖和机甲元素融合成令人叹为观止的高质量图像,由人工智能生成,头饰。','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'0fa3618f-d697-411b-85a3-eb2a6d63468d','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285992,864,'white veil 2::cowboy shot::,covered breasts,3::sagging breasts::,2::,white hanfu,sitting on a big lotus,palm to palm::,shawl,hagoromo,a divine goddess sits gracefully in a meditative lotus position,her palms gently pressed together in a prayerful mudra. she radiates a serene yet alluring aura,combining sacred elegance with captivating beauty. her flawless skin glows softly like moonlight,and her long flowing hair cascades around her shoulders like dark silk. she wears translucent silken robes in shades of pearl white and rose gold,revealing the elegant contours of her body without vulgarity—balanced perfectly between divinity and sensuality. delicate golden ornaments and lotus-shaped jewelry adorn her wrists,neck,and forehead,shimmering with sacred light.behind her,a massive glowing halo of golden lotus petals and sanskrit-like sigils pulses with ethereal energy. she floats above a calm,misty pond covered in blooming lotuses,with divine light and warm incense smoke swirling around her form. her expression is calm and knowing—benevolent,yet with an air of mysterious allure. she is both mother of compassion and embodiment of beauty,a goddess who inspires devotion,awe,and desire in equal measure.1.5::hairpin,spread knees,crossed foot,half close eyes,1.5::pale skin,shiny skin,::,reme,forehead mark,flower mark,mole under mouth,from below,2::skindentation','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'1ce9ba7e-4f4b-4d2d-af45-3511b8875ccc','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285993,864,'翻译：白色面纱 2::牛仔镜头::,遮盖的乳房,3::下垂的乳房::,2::,白色汉服,坐在一朵大莲花上,掌心对掌心::,披肩,羽衣,一位神圣的女神优雅地以冥想的莲花姿势坐着,双手轻轻合十,做出祈祷的手印。她散发出宁静而迷人的气息,将神圣的优雅与迷人的美丽融为一体。她完美无瑕的肌肤像月光一样柔和地闪耀,飘逸的长发像深色丝绸一样披散在肩上。她穿着珍珠白和玫瑰金色的半透明丝绸长袍,展现出她优雅的身体轮廓,却不显粗俗——在神性与性感之间达到了完美的平衡。精致的金饰和莲花形珠宝装饰着她的手腕、颈部和前额,闪耀着神圣的光芒。在她身后,一圈巨大的金色莲花瓣和类似梵文的符号闪耀着空灵的能量。她漂浮在一个平静的、雾气弥漫的池塘上,池塘上盛开着莲花,神圣的光芒和温暖的香烟在她的身旁盘旋。她的表情平静而睿智——仁慈,却又带着一丝神秘的魅力。她既是慈悲的母亲,也是美的化身,是一位激发虔诚、敬畏和渴望的女神。1.5::发夹,张开的膝盖,交叉的脚,半闭的眼睛,1.5::白皙的皮肤,闪亮的皮肤,::,reme,额头上的印记,花印,嘴下的痣,从下方,2::皮肤凹痕','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'1702f8da-6629-4adb-a39b-d6abc1f66ae1','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285994,864,'viewed from a low angle,the image captures a formidable female warrior in a dynamic combat stance. she is clad in sophisticated white and gold mecha-style armor that gleams under the intense light,its design blending futuristic technology with ancient egyptian motifs. her elaborate headdress,reminiscent of a pharaoh,features stylized wings and a central insignia,complemented by modern,headphone-like components over her ears. the character has short,dark hair and her focused gaze is directed forward,her magenta eyes shining with determination. she wields a sword with a golden hilt,its blade composed of translucent,glowing cyan energy. surrounding her are abstract and technological elements,including fragmented digital artifacts,glitch effects,and a floating,holographic ring of light inscribed with indecipherable glowing characters,reinforcing the cybernetic and almost divine aura of the subject.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'7592b819-2c41-4d05-a3e8-f6b5d4529251','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285995,864,'a girl stands under a starry night sky,translucent flower chains glowing softly around her wrists. delicate petals drift like snow in the moonlight,thin light strands stretching from her hands into the distant horizon. misty silver moonlight bathes the meadow,dandelion seeds floating in the gentle breeze. she gazes at an ancient stone altar entwined with vines and luminous blossoms. the scene feels both fragile and eternal,woven from starlight and whispered memories.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'067e8d5f-efcb-4493-88f8-a4b853b35fe5','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285996,864,'an interior of a spacious fish store filled with multiple glass tanks containing vibrant orange and black goldfish swimming gracefully,arranged on shelves and against the walls. the floor features a checkered pattern in light and dark shades,with small items like a red pot and plastic-wrapped bags scattered about. a large fan hangs from the ceiling,and a clock and calendar are visible on the back wall,all set against a color scheme of green water and warm fish tones.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'d5b63848-b162-421a-8acb-e52fbc0141b5','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(285997,864,'a girl sits on a black piano bench,wearing a black dress with white lace trim,white collar,puffy short sleeves,white socks,buttons,black decorated shoes,black ribbon,black choker,and black lace gloves. a grand piano is positioned to her left. behind her,a black round marble table displays a bouquet of white and black roses. the white-tiled marble floor features scattered black and white petals,black and white candles adorned with ribbons. an ornate door appears in the background. the entire composition uses a black and white color palette to create an elegant and mysterious atmosphere.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'12fdb509-8b00-4259-87cb-0d46011b7f94','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
