INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286001,864,'1girl,a cold,emotionless,almost bored expression,a sharp anime-style face,in the middle of an iaijutsu quick-draw,her body is a blur of motion as she unsheathes her katana,the katana is halfway out of its scabbard,the exposed part of the blade glints with a cold,sharp light,a single drop of water is sliced in half mid-air,center,dynamic action pose,a dark,rain-slicked traditional japanese dojo,with strong depth of field','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'f771b5fa-0b5c-4450-864d-7db5b235a105','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286002,864,'the frame is bisected by a razor-thin vertical line,the left side features the loli (dark skin,white hair,black dress) against a pure white background,the right side is a perfect mirror image but in negative (white skin,black hair,white dress) against a pure black background','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'e62e9454-742f-43fd-8d0b-d885d9794585','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286003,864,'full body,from side,looking away,{{wide shot,landscape}},cinematic angle,aerial,trapped within the infinite recursion of a klein bottle mindscape,a girl curls around the topological singularity where her heart should be. her neural dendrites extend as glowing riemann surfaces,each memory fragment sliced into non-euclidean shards tumbling endlessly down penrose staircases. when cartesian axes shatter into klein-blue vines piercing her visual cortex,the invasion triggers surreal hallucinations - burning sierpiński carpets consuming logic centers,fractal ferns erupting from pituitary glands to rewire cognition into endless gödel loops. the oozing walls drip klein-bottled paradox honey that splashes into mathematical abyss,each drop crystallizing into cantor dust clouds containing all possible methods of intellectual annihilation','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'7e3b3989-fc60-4dec-8d88-b0a90388f5a6','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286004,864,'1girl,an ornate kimono with a beautiful,intricate pattern (e.g.seigaiha or karakusa),a serene,graceful,and slightly melancholic expression,posing elegantly with a traditional fan,positioned amidst several giant,stylized chrysanthemums and peonies,their bold patterns complementing her kimono,center,full body','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'173bd65b-4d49-45ba-999d-0a78b4c2605a','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286005,864,'black jacket,sailor collar,white shirt,choker,hair ribbon,red ribbon,silver ring,black chokerseductive,alluring,smug,looking at viewer,open mouth,teasing,pensive,calmpulling red string,string connected to eye,tying hair,holding ribbon,delicate finger movements,touching facewhite background,red border,two panel comic stripclean lineart,painterly shading,dramatic shadows,cast shadow,sharp focus,high contrastclose up,portrait,upper body,from side,profilemonochrome,black theme,red theme,limited palettea two-panel comic layout portrays a girl with striking red eyes and long black hair. in the top panel,a close-up shows her looking directly at the viewer with a seductive,smug expression,her mouth slightly open revealing small fangs. she playfully pulls a thin red string that seems to emerge from the corner of her eye. the bottom panel shifts to a side profile view,where she is calmly tying the same red ribbon into her hair,her expression now more pensive. the entire piece is framed with a red border against a clean white background,creating a stylish and focused narrative.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'67c09c26-56c9-4bab-bf44-e98bb1842980','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286006,864,'1girl,solo,solo,indoors,room interior,view from outside window,looking into room through window,heavy rain outside,raindrops on window pane (foreground effect),floor-to-ceiling window,girl seen through glass,sitting on wooden chair,one leg up on chair,hugging own leg,head resting on knee,staring blankly out window,blank expression,vacant stare,melancholic mood,sad eyes,soft indoor lighting emanating from room,cozy room details visible through window (e.g.bookshelf,dim lamp),reflections on wet window surface (showing faint outside elements or blurring interior),dark moody atmosphere,cool color palette,cinematic shot,medium shot from outside,eye level with girl through window,slight condensation on inner window pane (optional,if warm inside),portrait','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'35e46525-b407-4cd1-b402-886489b0667b','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286007,864,'set against a stark black background,a female warrior with short white hair and glowing red eyes is depicted in a dynamic,low-slung action pose. she wears a traditional conical straw hat,or sugegasa,which casts a shadow over the upper half of her face. her attire is a blend of martial and stylized elements,including a dark,billowing cloak with a red lining that frays and splashes into the surrounding darkness. she is dressed in a revealing top with black wrappings over her chest,black arm guards,and thigh-high black stockings. a red cord with tassels is tied around her waist. in a motion suggesting immense speed,she is sliding down a sharp diagonal,gripping the hilt of a katana with a vibrant red blade that is partially drawn from its black scabbard. the background is punctuated by a large,solid red circle resembling a blood moon,and the entire scene is animated by violent splashes and streaks of red,white,and grey,evoking a sense of powerful movement and conflict.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'ed01bb8a-5557-4fd7-afc6-69d6c981cc1d','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
