INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286013,864,'they are in a modern,clean gymnastics locker room with metallic lockers. they stand shoulder-to-shoulder,facing the viewer with an unwavering,challenging gaze. one sister has her arm casually draped over her twin''s shoulder. this pose is full of confidence and a silent declaration of their dominance. they wear matching,sleek leotards in a striking (black and crimson red design),giving them a powerful and almost dangerous aura.very aesthetic,masterpiece,no text','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'f23d2a61-113e-4012-b2e0-ed7f27f13041','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286014,864,'1girl,solo,full body,dynamic pose,from side,best quality,nude form partially clad in armor,intricate dragon claw gauntlets extending to chest (covering nipples with articulated metallic scales),crystal battle skirt with prismatic refractions,red luminous greatsword resting on shoulder,one hand on hip confident stance,head turned to side profilng graceful neckline,slender waist with visible abdominal definition,exposed navel,red crystal winged headpiece on forehead glowing,detailed western dragon head looming behind (breathing ethereal smoke),alluring expression with half-lidded eyes,parted lips,subtle blush on cheekbones,glistening skin with sweat sheen,muscular thighs and toned hips,dramatic night background with floating red crystal shards,theatrical lighting from sword glow and crystals,fantasy setting,wind sweeping hair strands,luminous particles drifting around form,hyper-detailed armor textures (metallic scales with engravings),complex weapon design (sword blade with glowing runic inscriptions),crystal skirt translucency revealing silhouette','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'b33fba68-cde4-406a-bfa9-6d1ec0801f10','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286015,864,'1girl,solo,pale skin,gothic lolita,black dress,corset,lace trim,frilled skirt,puffy sleeves,high collar,choker,cross necklace,headdress,veil,rose,thighhighs,heeled boots,lace gloves,1girl,walking gracefully down a grand golden staircase inside a magnificent ballroom,one hand lightly brushing the gilded railing,marble floor polished to a mirror shine below,towering golden pillars surrounding the hall,crystal chandeliers scattering dazzling reflections of light,ornate carvings and luxurious decorations covering the walls,flower petals drifting gently through the air,cinematic warm glow filling the space,elegant and refined posture,tilted angle','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'1aa6828b-8cb8-4bb6-a7f8-611e2727a7eb','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286016,864,'award winning photography,double exposure,multiple exposure,silhouette,black and white with partial color,1girl,profile silhouette,a sprawling city view of tokyo at night,rain-streaked train window,shinjuku,glowing neon signs,light trails from traffic,reflections on wet asphalt,the girl''s silhouette is filled with the city lights,her outline is sharp against a simple dark background,her hair seems to merge with the rain streaks,emotional,nostalgic,lonely,serene,strong artistic composition,asymmetrical,rule of thirds,film grain,light leak,signature,ozanculha (style),surrealism,high contrast,bokeh,bright colors (in city part),monochromatic (in silhouette part),blue theme,purple theme,a double exposure portrait where the silhouette of a girl looking out a window is perfectly blended with a breathtaking,rain-slicked panorama of nighttime tokyo. the vibrant neon lights of the city fill her form,creating a stark contrast with the dark,minimalist background. the boundary between the girl and the cityscape is blurred,as if she is made of memories and light. the composition places her silhouette on the right,leaving negative space that enhances the feeling of introspection and urban solitude.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'0c4a4c4b-a094-4e14-98ef-2df243c970f6','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286017,864,'翻译：获奖摄影作品,双重曝光,多次曝光,剪影,黑白部分彩色,一位女孩,侧面剪影,夜幕下的东京城市景观,雨水浸透的火车车窗,新宿,闪烁的霓虹灯,车流的光迹,湿漉漉的沥青路面上的倒影,女孩的剪影被城市灯光填满,她的轮廓在简洁的深色背景下显得格外清晰,她的头发似乎与雨痕融为一体,充满情感,怀旧,孤独,宁静,强烈的艺术构图,不对称,三分法构图,胶片颗粒,漏光,签名,ozanculha（风格）,超现实主义,高对比度,散景,明亮的色彩（城市部分）,单色（剪影部分）,蓝色主题,紫色主题,一张双重曝光肖像,女孩望向窗外的剪影与令人叹为观止的雨后东京夜景完美融合。城市里绚丽的霓虹灯光映照着她的身影,与深沉简约的背景形成鲜明对比。女孩与城市景观的界限模糊不清,仿佛她是由记忆和光芒构成。构图将她的轮廓置于画面右侧,留白强化了内省和都市孤独的氛围。','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'e3bdf4e1-2afc-41bf-b4aa-8ce0e508688d','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
