INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286022,864,'翻译：1位女孩,单人,赛博朋克夜总会,动态舞蹈姿势,飘逸长发,全息网状上衣饰有LED电路图案,皮质束身衣配铬合金扣环和链条,霓虹发光渔网袜,厚底战斗靴配脉冲灯条,露指手套配触摸屏界面,机械手臂植入物带有发光的蓝色血管,精致的头戴式耳机配天线和显示屏,电光蓝和洋红色霓虹接发,发光隐形眼镜,紫外线下汗水在皮肤上闪闪发光,烟雾机营造出光束效果,激光网格背景,反光舞池,旋转动作造成的动态模糊,张嘴狂喜的表情,身体在扭转中双臂伸展,9::动态::,8::活力四射::','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'447209a2-fa49-422d-8138-93dcf2edcb4b','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286023,864,'1girl,long sleeves,standing,hair ribbon,outdoors,day,cloud,wide sleeves,water,red bow,red ribbon,tree,bell,capelet,chinese clothes,umbrella,cloudy sky,building,scenery,rain,holding umbrella,hair bell,facing away,white capelet,oil-paper umbrella,architecture,east asian architecture,bridge,river,grey sky,hanfu,red umbrella,overcast,white dre,an illustration of a traditional japanese village scene. the buildings appear to be made of wood and have multiple levels,with balconies and terraces on each level. the village is surrounded by trees and shrubs,and there are several buildings with traditional japanese architecture visible in the background. in the center of the image,there are two people walking on a wooden bridge with red umbrellas. the bridge is supported by wooden pillars and has a red railing along the sides. they are dressed in traditional japanese clothing,with one person wearing a white kimono and the other wearing a black robe. the sky is overcast and the ground is wet,suggesting that it has recently rained. the overall mood of the illustration is peaceful and serene','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'83300177-efaf-43d7-8972-c22172006533','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286024,864,'a terrifying giant spider monster in a dark cave,wrapping a human victim tightly in thick spider silk,forming a cocoon-like human shape hanging from the ceiling,faint outline of the trapped person visible inside,glowing spider eyes in the shadows,webs covering the rocky walls,eerie torchlight and misty atmosphere,horror dark fantasy illustration with tension and dread.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'a9321f74-3863-4ee9-9ffe-cb009009e98d','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286025,864,'a girl holding an umbrella,turning back and smiling at the camera. overcast cloudy sky,soft side lighting. viewed through a car window glass with realistic water stain textures: flowing raindrops,streak marks,condensation,wet surface details. subtle horizontal line texture and frosted glass effect. strong emphasis on water stains and surface patterns on the glass. the girl is slightly blurred behind the textured wet glass,dreamy,cinematic mood,realistic glass distortion,cowboy shot,5::blurry::','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'af292506-c1b7-4b1f-a194-38a12c9fa3c5','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286026,864,'girl,sexy chinese ancient style cultivation third senior sister outfit: flowing black silk hanfu long robe with high collar and wide sleeves fitted around waist but open side slits from hips down no bra underneath allowing sideboob visibility and subtle nipple outline mid length ending at knees with layered fringes exposing thighs glossy silk material with wave and flute motif embroidery in gold threads semi-transparent in thigh areas for subtle skin tone visibility no additional ribbons,inner layer: black lace panties with garter straps visible through slits low-rise design for erotic exposure crotch area minimally covered allowing hints during stance,accessories: gold hair ornaments with tassels elaborate design denoting third seniority,footwear: black embroidered silk boots low heel sturdy material for agile steps with wave patterns and cultivation runes,overall highly revealing state with side slits and fitted waist for chest thigh and leg exposure slightly billowing for seductive immortal allure no full coverage in sideboob and thigh areas,standing pose with one hand holding a jade flute as magical artifact slight leg shift for seductive emphasis,elegant sexy expression with focused gaze looking at viewer directly,overall graceful immortal posture highlighting chest cleavage and thigh exposure through slits','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'f9a09bb1-4bfa-46cb-b4f9-15f3693f2a85','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286027,864,'1girl,scarf,cape,armor,the scene utilizes dramatic,moody lighting characterized by a dark theme where vibrant elements provide strong,glow-in-the-dark illumination,creating high contrast. a young woman with long hair,tinged with blue and purple highlights from the ambient neon light,crouches low,gazing directly forward with large,eyes. her pose is grounded and assertive,one hand placed firmly on the surface before her,which is itself marked by splashes of vivid magenta energy. dominating the space behind her is a colossal monster. this spectral figure appears composed of pure energy that swirls and splashes dynamically against the deep black void of the background. its mouth is wide open in a fierce roar,revealing sharp,glowing fangs in a potent display of untamed power. in the immediate foreground,beneath the woman,bold,jagged graffiti-style lettering rendered in acidic green proclaims a fragmented word,possibly "code vein," contributing to the overall urban,high-energy feel. the composition skillfully blends detailed character illustration with abstract energy forms and graphic text elements,creating a visually striking narrative steeped in neon-drenched atmosphere and futuristic style.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'64f87dbe-4ef2-48ca-9da0-bd3daccecce1','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286028,864,'翻译：画面中,一位年轻女子身披围巾、斗篷和盔甲,运用了戏剧性的氛围灯光,以暗色调为主,鲜艳的元素则在黑暗中发出强烈的荧光,形成鲜明的对比。她长发披肩,在霓虹灯光的映衬下泛着蓝紫色的光泽,低身蹲伏,目光炯炯地直视前方。她的姿态沉稳而坚定,一只手牢牢地按在面前的地面上,地面上闪烁着鲜艳的洋红色能量。在她身后,一个巨大的怪物占据了主导地位。这个幽灵般的身影似乎由纯粹的能量构成,在深邃的黑色背景中动态地旋转、飞溅。它张开血盆大口,发出凶猛的咆哮,露出锋利闪亮的獠牙,展现出一股狂野的力量。在画面前景,女子下方,醒目而锯齿状的涂鸦风格字母以酸性绿色呈现,拼凑出一个破碎的词语,可能是“code vein”（代码静脉）,增强了整体的都市感和活力。构图巧妙地融合了细致的人物插画、抽象的能量形态和图形化的文字元素,创造出一个视觉冲击力极强、充满霓虹灯光和未来主义风格的叙事故事。','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'e73a7791-619f-44a1-91aa-9ae8b229fac9','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286029,864,'solo,outdoors,day,signature,hood,from behind,tree,no humans,building,1other,scenery,snow,architecture,winter,east asian architecture,bare tree,castle,ambiguous gender,tower,fog,very wide shot,pagoda,temple,this is a digital illustration in a painterly realism style,dominated by a cool,desaturated palette of blues,grays,and whites,with subtle warmer earth tones on the structures,featuring visible,textured brushstrokes that blend forms and contribute to the atmospheric rendering.the scene is characterized by soft lighting and weak light,diffused by heavy fog,creating a moody atmosphere.the composition depicts a vast,snow-covered landscape shrouded in dense fog. in the lower center-right foreground,a solitary figure,diminutive against the imposing backdrop,stands cloaked and facing towards a complex of traditional east asian architectural structures. the foreground consists of uneven,dark,snow-dusted ground,with bare,skeletal branches reaching into the frame from the lower left,enhancing the desolate feel. occupying the midground are substantial buildings,including a wide,multi-tiered temple-like structure on the left and a tall,imposing pagoda piercing the fog on the right,both heavily laden with snow and exhibiting signs of significant weathering or perhaps neglect. thin cables or wires are faintly discernible,strung between these primary structures. the pervasive fog is a dominant element,enveloping the bases of the buildings and progressively obscuring architectural details with distance,contributing significantly to the strong sense of atmospheric perspective. further indistinct shapes,suggesting more distant traditional structures and potentially even the faint silhouettes of modern skyscrapers,loom ethereally in the deep background,almost entirely consumed by the thick mist. the overall mood conveyed is one of profound solitude,piercing coldness,and quiet mystery,set within a desolate yet visually striking environment that evokes a sense of forgotten grandeur or a post-event stillness.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'9101c6a3-bc87-4823-837f-19efffe0e251','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286030,864,'a girl,drenched in blood and clothed in torn remnants,stands amidst a crumbling ruin,gazing directly at the viewer with an emotionless expression. her eyes glow with an intense,piercing red light that cuts through the dust-filled air like twin embers in the dark.the entire scene is awash in shades of red—deep,shadowed crimsons blending with sharp scarlet highlights. the ruined surroundings are littered with shattered concrete,twisted metal,and scorched fragments of once-standing structures. faint trails of smoke curl up from the wreckage,tinted red by a flickering light source offscreen. sparks crackle faintly in the distance,and glowing cracks in the earth hint at a violent power still simmering beneath the surface. the atmosphere is suffocating—silent,yet thrumming with restrained chaos,as though the world has paused in awe or fear of her presence. every element of the scene builds toward a climax not yet seen,steeped in dramatic stillness and looming dread.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'79c20ba1-b293-4aac-bb46-c216088553c6','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286031,864,'1girl,table,soft pink lighting,closed eyes,sleeping peacefully,fake animal ears,curled up on a giant cake,mini girl,bow hairband (pink glitter),a white cat,frilled layered dress in soft pink and white with vertical pink stripes,puffy long sleeves with pink sleeve bows,white apron with lace trim and tiny embroidered cupcakes,asymmetrical legwear: one leg in pink-and-white polka dot thigh-high sock,the other in a single pink striped kneehigh with a brown bow,brown mary janes with pink bows,high heels,surrounded by floating pink sweets: strawberry slices,pink theme,pink macarons,whipped cream swirls,cupcakes with pink icing,sugar cubes,pink pocky sticks,hugging a spoon between legs,oversized pink dessert objects: giant strawberry,jar,light particles and sparkles drifting in the air,a stuffed pink cat toy,food-themed hair ornaments (strawberry and cherry),sitting with knees up,white border','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'f581236e-aaf3-4608-b9b3-26c7eddbbda0','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286032,864,'{{1girl}},the image depicts a fantastical,mythical creature with a dragon-like appearance. it has a dark,muscular body adorned with intricate,swirling patterns that resemble armor or scales. the creature''s head is adorned with a mane of flowing,vibrant blue and purple flames,giving it a dynamic and powerful presence. its eyes are narrowed,and it appears to be in a commanding stance,with one hand raised and glowing with fiery energy. the background is a swirling vortex of colors,predominantly blue and orange,with celestial elements like stars and planets,suggesting a cosmic or otherworldly setting. the overall style is highly stylized and vibrant,with a strong emphasis on contrast and movement.no text','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'d8af5be0-ebd0-4b9a-9098-1188fcb69a88','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286033,864,'翻译：{{1girl}}，这幅图描绘了一个奇幻的神话生物，外形酷似龙。它拥有黝黑健壮的身躯，上面布满了错综复杂的漩涡状图案，如同盔甲或鳞片。它的头部长着一头飘逸的、充满活力的蓝紫色火焰鬃毛，赋予它动感而强大的气场。它双目紧闭，摆出威严的姿态，一只手高高举起，闪耀着炽热的能量。背景是色彩交织的漩涡，以蓝色和橙色为主，点缀着星星和行星等天体元素，暗示着宇宙或异世界的氛围。整体风格高度风格化且充满活力，强烈强调对比和动感。','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'b5429a14-9af4-485e-b5c3-b9e1654fc6db','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286034,864,'1girl,nightfall,moonlit,mystical,solo,watercolor,ethereal,delicate,serene,dark colors,vibrant reds,crescent moon,stars,flowing hair,short hair,black hair,moon-shaped hairpin,large eyes,innocent expression,pale skin,small figure,lolita fashion,frilly dress,black and red color scheme,lace details,knee-high socks,mary jane shoes,blood moon,ominous atmosphere,wispy clouds,eerie shadows,glowing red eyes,moonlight reflecting on the ground,bats flying in the background,silhouette of a spooky tree,misty forest,haunted ambiance,enchanted aura,stillness,magical girl,blood-red ribbons,moonlit path,mysterious beauty,gothic elements,solemn expression,hidden powers,moonlit lake,reflection,tranquility,nocturnal creature,otherworldly presence,a young girl standing in front of a dark and eerie background. she is wearing a black dress with red accents and has long black hair that is styled in loose waves. the sky is filled with stars and there are trees on either side of her. the overall mood of the image is dark,ominous,and mysterious','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'a4aa6f5a-8d84-47b1-bbab-74b7007c603e','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286035,864,'a girl is crawling in a dimly lit cave,holding a large glowing blue crystal with a cheerful expression while wearing a backpack and a necklace with a pendant. the cave walls are covered with orange-hued mushrooms that emit a soft light,providing a warm contrast to the dark environment. the rocky ground features small sparkles scattered throughout the scene.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'4a9f1f57-0e63-4197-9adf-0b4b3e084351','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286036,864,'1girl,solo,photo background,real world location,a gallery room where multiple famous portraits like the ''mona lisa'' and ''girl with a pearl earring'' are slowly melting off their canvases,dripping onto the floor in colorful wax-like puddles,the frames remain perfectly intact on the wall,surreal,dreamlike,commentary on the erosion of cultural memory.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'d15c7251-600b-493a-a5ff-b93993bce159','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286037,864,'a marble goddess statue seated on a throne,her torso cracked like a porcelain doll,instead of blood or machinery,a galaxy of dying stars and nebulae spills from the wound,drifting into the dark,empty throne room,the scene is lit only by the faint glow of this escaping cosmos,baroque lighting,cosmic horror,sublime decay,philosophical.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'406c3638-3c08-4e09-a54c-cdccba7b4970','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286038,864,'1girl,cross necklace,jewelry,long dress,long sleeves,necklace,traditional nun,slight frown,standing,arms at sides,looking at viewer,ruins,from side,blue flames,night,a girl stands in ruins at night,surrounded by burning blue flames. she is wearing a traditional long nun dress with long sleeves,a cross necklace,and other jewelry. the camera is from a slightly side view. she is looking at the viewer with a slight frown,her arms hanging naturally at her sides. the scene is illuminated by the eerie blue light from the fire,creating a dark and mysterious atmosphere.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'7f50957c-b5c5-46bc-990e-695983e67477','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
