INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286046,864,'sunbeam,solo,1girl,parted lips,a celestial goddess,bead_bracelet,adorned with an intricate golden headdress. hagoromo,features her wearing an elegant,layered traditional east asian hanfu-style gown in flowing silks of white,pale gold,soft teal,and muted pink. her hair and robes swirl around her dynamically,merging with stylized,colorful cloud patterns and abstract floral/leaf motifs.ornate golden jewelry/headdress,the swirling,highly saturated colored cloud-like forms,golden floral/leaf accents,and scattered star-like glitter . she stands serenely,one hand raised gently,exuding an ethereal grace.swirling,highly saturated cloud-like forms in rich earthy tones,teals,pinks,and gold,interspersed with star-like glitter,magic,magic sparkles,magic circle','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'ff9125be-9454-414e-b11d-c41891e3cdfa','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286047,864,'weathered plaster walls with peeling paint and exposed brickwork,visible small windows on ascending floors,foreground dark wooden doorway leading to interior stairs,stained concrete ground with cracks,faint graffiti on walls,girl looking upward,silhouette of figure in deep shadow,silver hair ribbons barely catching light,cornflower blue eyes reflecting distant sky,translucent silk ribbon on left wrist,simple dark school uniform,head tilted back gazing at small bright sky patch at top,dramatic top-lighting creating rapid falloff,harsh contrast between dark foreground and overexposed sky,isolated and oppressive atmosphere with faint hope,dostoyevskian aesthetic,saint petersburg courtyard ambiance,moisture stains on walls,floating dust particles in light beam,subtle motion blur on hanging laundry lines,chiaroscuro lighting on facial profile','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'62498c96-c1dc-43e0-9bac-2092973b93e7','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286048,864,'geometric wireframe cube centered,girl contorted within framework,slender body bending in mathematical curves,voluminous hair cascading beyond frame boundaries,minimalist composition,stark white background,subtle lighting gradients,ethereal glow from within cube,hair strands morphing into digital particles,dynamic pose suggesting motion blur,monochromatic palette with accented pastel,fine line art precision,optical illusion of depth,floating micro crystals around edges,skin texture contrasting geometric hardness,ambiguous emotional expression,hair transforming into smoke trails,cube lines pulsing faintly,surreal confinement aesthetic,high concept visual narrative','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'75afed8f-83d1-4c0c-8bd0-cef090fd576b','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286049,864,'pov hand holding enormous soft white eraser mid-swipe across lined notebook paper,aggressively erasing part of a furiously angry pencil-drawn girl sitting on the page,her tight crop top already half-vaporized from the bottom up revealing bold underboob and bare midriff as thick gray rubber shavings and pencil dust explode everywhere,remaining fabric edges fraying into rough sketch lines,girl glaring directly at viewer with clenched teeth and flared nostrils,eyebrows sharply furrowed,speech bubble screaming “stop it!!!” in jagged letters,scattered eraser crumbs and graphite smudges across horizontal blue-lined paper background,high-contrast monochrome pencil art style with heavy cross-hatching on remaining clothes and skin,dramatic motion blur on eraser and flying debris,intimate top-down pov angle,chaotic meta fourth-wall-breaking atmosphere','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'2edadd5c-8a8d-4717-b867-670db1202c9a','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286050,864,'1girl,solo,extreme ito junji horror manga style,pure black and white high-contrast ink with dense hatching and screentone,sanity-shattering spiral-eyed girl in tattered school uniform,mouth unnaturally stretched into impossible widening scream revealing endless rows of spiraling teeth,long black hair morphing into writhing tendrils that pierce through her own skull and coil into fractal voids,body contorted in grotesque impossible angles with joints bending backward,skin covered in crawling obsessive spiral patterns and gaping eye-covered sores,background collapsing into infinite spiraling abyss of screaming faces and fragmented reality,heavy ink splatter and distortion waves,broken panel borders bleeding into each other,obsessive detailed linework with microscopic horror elements,complete mental collapse and cosmic dread atmosphere,drop in sanity,pure terror','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'0aee8578-9941-424b-9ba8-0dc233fea8fc','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286051,864,'1girl,solo,absolute peak ito junji black-and-white nightmare,zero grey,only pure ink and void,girl''s face split vertically into perfect left-right mirror yet each half devours the other in endless spiral of teeth biting teeth,eyes replaced by bottomless spiraling holes that suck in the panel borders themselves,tongue elongating into a barbed drill piercing through her own forehead and exiting the back of the skull still spinning,hair transformed into thousands of segmented centipede legs crawling out of scalp and burrowing back in,neck twisted 540 degrees with vertebrae visibly popping through skin in perfect screentone dots,arms elongated to impossible length wrapping around torso seven times while fingers melt into dripping ink that forms new screaming mouths on her ribs,uniform shredded into razor-sharp paper strips slicing her own flesh yet blood drawn as obsessive cross-hatching that forms smaller copies of her screaming face,background no longer exists,only infinite recursive spiral panels showing the same girl getting progressively more broken and fused with the page,gutters bleeding black ichor,speech bubbles filled with unreadable spiraling calligraphy that makes viewer''s eyes bleed,every line hand-drawn with murderous precision,maximum possible detail density,sanity instantaneous zero,pure distilled cosmic body horror terror that cannot be unseen','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'87164ac2-7cdb-4fb4-9165-c2ff5dbeef48','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286052,864,'翻译：1girl，独奏，绝对巅峰伊藤润二黑白噩梦，零灰，只有纯粹的墨水和虚空，女孩的脸垂直分裂成完美的左右镜像，但每一半都在无尽的牙齿撕咬螺旋中吞噬着另一半，眼睛被无底的螺旋状黑洞取代，甚至连画面边缘都被吸入其中，舌头伸长成带倒钩的钻头，刺穿自己的额头，从后脑勺穿出，仍在旋转，头发变成成千上万节的蜈蚣腿，从头皮爬出又钻回，脖子扭转540度，脊椎骨清晰可见地从皮肤中凸出，形成完美的网点，手臂伸长到不可能的长度，缠绕躯干七圈，手指融化成滴落的墨水，在她的肋骨上形成新的尖叫嘴巴，制服被撕成锋利的纸条，割破她自己的血肉，而血液则被画成执拗的交叉阴影线，形成她尖叫的更小副本脸庞，背景已然消逝，只剩下无限循环的螺旋状画面，同一个女孩逐渐破碎，与纸张融为一体，书页边缘渗出黑色的脓液，对话框里填满了难以辨认的螺旋状书法，令人目眩神迷，每一笔都以杀气腾腾的精准手绘而成，细节密度极高，瞬间丧失理智，纯粹而又令人毛骨悚然的宇宙恐怖，一旦目睹便无法忘怀。','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'7ae3cab1-fef2-4683-bd5f-6d11bbe8d71f','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286053,864,'1girl,solo,miniature size,sitting on the rim of a tall,slender cocktail glass with a delicate stem and a crystal-clear,frosty surface,viewed from a side angle that captures her full posture against the glass,she is tilting her head back to look directly up at the camera with a playful,curious expression,her right hand holding a single,glossy red cherry poised just before her slightly parted lips as if about to take a bite,her left hand pressed firmly against the smooth,cool edge of the glass for balance,inside the glass,a vibrant,translucent blue carbonated drink fills the lower portion,packed with clear,geometric ice cubes that sparkle and refract light,a slender,striped straw leaning against the inner side of the glass,the overall scene is bright,whimsical,and dreamlike with soft,emphasizing the contrast between her tiny figure and the large glass,a sense of playful fantasy and summer vibes','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'5086516e-8d98-4a31-84c2-98b83e72bcf7','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286054,864,'{lying,hige angle,from above},2girls,intimate embrace in snowy landscape,side view dynamic composition,intimate framing,girl a with flushed cheeks burying face in girl b''s scarf,girl b smiling softly while adjusting earmuffs on girl a,matching cream knitwear sets,fluffy earmuffs with pom-poms,intertwined fingers in wool mittens,gentle snowfall catching in eyelashes,frost crystals on hair tips,snow-covered pine forest background,hazy morning light,visible breath mist,soft diffused lighting,shallow depth of field blurring distant trees,falling snowflakes catching light,nose brushing intimate gesture,bashful expression,peaceful winter atmosphere,cool color palette with warm accents,backlit highlights on snow crystals,translucent skin blushing pink,wool skirts dusted with snow,leather boots sinking in powder,cinematic winter romance aesthetic,from side perspective,intimate nose touch,snow reflection glow,dreamlike soft focus','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'a74b813d-e5f7-4866-939e-558b5607cf96','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286055,864,'翻译：{躺着，高角度，俯视视角}，两个女孩，在雪景中亲密拥抱，侧面动态构图，亲密特写，女孩A脸颊泛红，把脸埋在女孩B的围巾里，女孩B温柔地笑着，帮女孩A整理耳罩，两人穿着配套的米色针织衫，蓬松的耳罩上有绒球，手指戴着羊毛手套交织在一起，轻柔的雪花落在睫毛上，发梢上结着霜晶，背景是白雪覆盖的松树林，朦胧的晨光，可见的呼吸水汽，柔和的漫射光，浅景深使远处的树木模糊，飘落的雪花反射着光芒，鼻子轻触的亲密动作，羞涩的表情，宁静的冬日氛围，冷色调搭配温暖的亮点，雪晶上的逆光高光，半透明的肌肤泛着粉红色，羊毛裙上沾着雪，皮靴陷在雪地里，电影般的冬日浪漫美学，侧面视角，亲密的鼻子触碰，雪地反射的光芒，梦幻般的柔焦效果。','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'2b47effd-51fb-4fd1-91ec-90a8e2a45523','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286056,864,'1girl,side view,dutch tilt,sitting against rough brick wall in prison cell,whole body entangled with thick thorny vines wrist bonds,neck constriction,ankle wraps,fresh blood stains on white tattered chemise,shoulder wound,trickle down arm,dried blood on thorns,head tilted back against wall exposing throat,eyes closed with pained expression,single deep crimson rose blooming from chest vines,roots mingling with blood,strong tyndall effect: diagonal light beam from high window cutting through dusty air,illuminating rose petals and floating blood droplets,spotlight on face,gritty texture on mossy bricks,broken chains on floor,shallow puddle reflecting light,dramatic chiaroscuro lighting,cold blue shadows vs warm golden light,cinematic atmosphere,hyper-detailed skin texture with sweat and grime,added details: cat paw-shaped dust motes in light beam,tiny carved cat silhouette in brick crevice,rose dewdrops reflecting slit-pupil shapes,vine thorns glistening with saline fluid,fabric tears revealing glowing rune-like scars,breath fog in cold air,emotion: anguish with acceptance,symbolic martyrdom,dark romanticism,color palette: desaturated blues and greys with vivid red and gold accents','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'148a520e-53a3-4047-ab23-c6b3ca826b4f','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
