INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286062,864,'the image depicts two young anime-style girls,both dressed in elaborate train conductor uniforms,interacting with a colorful,detailed toy playset on a table. the girl on the left has long black hair and dark red eyes,wearing a black and gold uniform,and holds a black miniature train. the girl on the right has short,light pink hair and golden-brown eyes,wearing a cream uniform with a red bow,and holds a red and white miniature train. both are smiling brightly as they place and move their miniature trains along the toy tracks that run through the whimsical playset,which includes miniature houses and various small dolls.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'6f71a5a9-908f-446d-8082-02ba369706f4','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286063,864,'alchemy guild masters,conducting grand experiment,observing reaction,recording results,protective aprons over ornate robes,glass lens eyewear,complex apparatus of copper and glass,bubbling flasks with colorful liquids,cavernous workshop lit by forge and gaslamps,shelves of rare ingredients in jars,massive central worktable,dramatic contrast of dark stone and warm light,glow from chemical reactions,swirling fumes capturing light,atmosphere of discovery and slight peril,medium shot of focused group,deep focus on details,rich with texture.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'522f1a89-7c1d-4be4-9f4b-20287eb07677','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286064,864,'翻译：炼金术士公会大师们正在进行一项宏大的实验，观察反应，记录结果。他们身穿华丽长袍，外面套着防护围裙，戴着玻璃镜片眼镜，操作着由铜和玻璃制成的复杂仪器。烧瓶里盛着五颜六色的液体，冒着气泡。宽敞的作坊里，锻炉和煤气灯散发出光芒，照亮了整个空间。架子上摆满了装在罐子里的稀有原料，中央是一张巨大的工作台。黑暗的石头墙壁与温暖的光线形成鲜明的对比，化学反应散发出光芒， swirling的烟雾捕捉着光线。整个场景弥漫着探索和一丝危险的气氛。镜头中景拍摄，聚焦于这群专注的人，细节清晰，质感丰富。','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'e9c1c50c-3fd5-4dbd-93d9-38b9ea4a9bfa','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286065,864,'street diviners and seekers,crowded night market stall row,reading cards,observing crystal balls,vibrant bohemian attire,scarves and amulets,small tables laden with tools of divination,lanterns and candles illuminating tarps,narrow cobblestone alley at night,mix of curiosity and skepticism on faces,pools of warm intimate light,shadows dancing on walls,mystical and earthly intersection,medium group shot over the shoulder,shallow focus,vibrant street life scene','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'7f3ff9dd-742b-4009-96d8-59610864fdb0','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286066,864,'beast lore enthusiasts,gathering in verdant aviary,sketching rare birds,sharing observations,comfortable field attire with scholarly touches,notebooks and satchels,lush hanging garden aviary,glass dome roof open to blue sky,exotic plants and small tame creatures,dappled morning sunlight,soft green golden tones,natural sunbeams,peaceful and intellectual ambiance,medium wide shot of scattered group,shallow depth of field,sense of curiosity and wonder','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'c44bd552-e83b-47e4-9168-14c2ac1233f7','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
