INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286074,864,'3. **左侧中央：** 一个透明塑料cd盒，里面装着一张印有女孩脸的cd，上面印有“37”字样和音频波形图。','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'44edace7-a969-41f0-ab1f-13e844105ce1','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286075,864,'serif fonts with an aged or distressed look. main title in elaborate,ornate calligraphy at the top,slanted slightly. sub - title in a more subdued,italicized serif beneath,offset to the right. issue number and date in a small,faded - looking font at the bottom corner. text colors inspired by vintage tones like sepia,burgundy,or gold.retro - textured magazine cover style,illustration,warm yellow color scheme,nostalgic atmosphere,long red wavy hair,bright features,retro pearl earrings and necklace,crimson - red form - fitting retro dress,ruffled collar,puffed sleeves,delicate lace skirt,vintage handbag,body turning,looking back with smile,dark - wood - colored retro wall,vintage chandelier','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'6b3da7c5-50ce-45fd-b3b2-629c8e445c8e','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286076,864,'trendy magazine - cover feel,illustration,high - saturation colors,visual impact,young female,platinum - colored short hair,brow piercing,unruly eyes,black cropped leather jacket,fluorescent green crop top,ripped jeans,martin boots,color - painted baseball cap,hands in pockets,graffiti - covered wall,geometric or graffiti - inspired fonts. title in a large,blocky,multi - colored font that overlaps with the image. sub - title in a sharp,angular font placed diagonally across the cover. social media handles or hashtags in a small,neon - colored font at the edge. text colors are bright,high - contrast,and include fluorescent or metallic hues.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'e855a2ec-b5cd-42bc-8124-f863e246ac5c','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286077,864,'modern magazine cover style,commercial illustration,high contrast,sharp details,young elegant female,shoulder - length golden curls,delicate features,narrow - rimmed black - framed glasses,off - white loose suit,light blue silk bow - collared blouse,black floor - length wide - leg pants,stiletto - heeled shoes,right hand propping chin,left hand on armrest,legs crossed,off - white,light blue,black,light gray color palette,sans - serif fonts. bold,concise title at the top center. sub - title in smaller size directly below the title,centered. character name vertically arranged on one side of the image. text colors in stark contrast to the main color palette of the cover.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'da640a5e-81c8-4ad0-96dc-44e0e0c5878d','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286078,864,'snowy day,park covered in white snow,a girl standing under a bare tree,holding a warm milk tea cup with both hands (steam curling upward),wearing a thick oversized winter coat (pastel pink),fuzzy earmuffs,knitted gloves,breath visible in cold air,slight smile,snowflakes falling gently,soft winter light,cozy yet chilly atmosphere,detailed snow texture on ground and coat','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'f47c9e51-cebd-4b4e-8e6a-ea58e436253a','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286079,864,'wife opening the door,welcoming home,warm smile,soft eyes,wearing a cozy oversized sweater over a floral apron,gentle posture (one hand on the doorknob,the other slightly raised),warm indoor lighting spilling out,faint scent of home-cooked food implied,comfortable and familiar atmosphere,soft color tones,detailed texture of sweater and apron fabric','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'8c171867-c41c-492e-a491-dcbb55a3cb27','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286080,864,'1girl,from above,motion blur,a model wearing a modular techwear outfit in matte black and neon green,with asymmetrical zippers,utility straps,and a translucent visor helmet','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'99cd7c7f-feba-4b86-b527-cb419c43e07c','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286081,864,'glowing,speed lines,streamlined electric motorcycle weaving through vertical traffic in a dense cyberpunk city,holographic advertisements and flying vehicles in the background','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'7634a493-b939-48ea-9b3d-a20a659b6111','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286082,864,'the image presents a highly stylized depiction of a heavily armored figure,rendered in a dramatic and evocative manner. the primary subject is clad in a dark,imposing suit of armor that seems to be intricately designed and detailed. the helmet is particularly striking,featuring sharp angles and a menacing countenance,with a single,crimson-colored light emanating from within. this gives the impression of glowing eyes. the facial structure within the helmet suggests an aggressive,perhaps even demonic,character.the figure holds a large,broadsword. the blade''s surface is stained with blood,reflecting the intense color palette that dominates the composition. blood spatters can also be seen on the armored gauntlets and lower arm,further emphasizing the violent narrative. the sword,itself a formidable weapon,appears to be an extension of the figure''s power and might.a dark cloak billows behind the armored individual,adding to the sense of motion and providing a stark contrast to the lighter,almost ethereal,glow emanating from above the helmet. this light adds an element of the supernatural or otherworldly to the scene. the background is predominantly dark and undefined,which allows the armored figure to become the absolute focus of the composition.the artwork''s style leans towards fantasy or dark fantasy,evoking a sense of danger,power,and perhaps a tragic narrative. the level of detail in the armor,the bloodstains,and the lighting creates a dynamic visual experience that could captivate a viewer. the overall impact is one of intimidating strength and a hint of darkness,drawing the viewer into an imagined world of conflict.the image presents a celestial and fantastical scene dominated by a female figure rendered in a digital art style,characterized by vibrant colors and a crystalline aesthetic. the figure,centrally positioned,is depicted as a young woman with short,light-colored hair and large,expressive eyes,suggesting a youthful and possibly otherworldly appearance. she is adorned in a dress-like garment that appears to be a delicate blend of translucent white fabric,embellished with crystalline structures in shades of blue. the dress is notably short,drawing attention to the legs. the overall attire evokes a sense of fragility and elegance,with an ethereal quality.the most striking aspect of the composition is the pair of large,stylized wings extending from the figure''s back. these wings are constructed from multifaceted crystalline formations,radiating a spectrum of colors,predominantly blue,pink,and purple,creating a visual spectacle. the wings seem to capture and refract light,adding to the magical atmosphere of the artwork.the figure''s pose is erect and poised,indicating a sense of confidence or perhaps serenity. she is standing on a surface that seems to be comprised of fragmented crystalline formations,which blend with the larger backdrop. the background itself is a dynamic representation of a cosmic environment,with swirling colors and particles suggesting a vast and unknown space. this cosmic setting reinforces the ethereal and otherworldly nature of the central figure.the lighting in the image is dramatic and contributes significantly to the visual impact. the crystalline wings and the figure''s attire are illuminated with highlights,which further accentuate the image''s texture and color palette. this strategic use of light gives the image depth and reinforces the theme of beauty and power.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'733a7c1e-eef0-4f18-a8c7-8ffb741abe96','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286083,864,'photo background,real world location,a room with a dim,moody atmosphere is filled with many tall stacks of books and scattered open pages on the floor. a girl sits hunched over,focused on an open book in front of her. a large floor-to-ceiling window frames a view of a city skyline at night with glowing lights. most strikingly,countless luminous fish swim through the night sky like a phantom sea,glowing with soft blue,green,and aqua light,creating a dreamlike aquatic world above the city. the overall palette is dark and subdued,evoking a quiet,mysterious mood.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'f91dccf8-6d78-4c73-9f24-0c7ebe0c0009','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286084,864,'1girl,solo,1.6::lying amidst scattered sketchbook pages in morning light,her body fragmented into twenty-seven intimate geometric studies across the sheets,slowly rotating and hovering in space::,1.5::a transitional pose between fragmentation and wholeness,one wrist reaching through a conceptual rib structure to touch a floating icosahedron labeled "heart",her expression a composite of multiple mirrored emotions::,1.5::bare skin subtly imprinted with a permanent cubist grid of faint lines-a tactile memory of having been measured and drawn-as light shifts across the pages and her form::,1.4::sunlight gradually illuminates the pages and her body,causing the floating geometric studies to realign and collapse back into a coherent whole,while the heart polyhedron reflects splintered glimpses of her face from the night before::,1.3::textures of rough sketch paper,smooth skin,soft morning light,the waxy trace of lipstick annotations,and the conceptual sheen of floating forms::,1.2::background of a quiet,sunlit studio with a tousled bed and scattered drawing tools,a space suspended between analysis and intimacy::,masterpiece,anatomical tenderness,a portrait where love is expressed through the meticulous,painful,and beautiful geometry of seeing and being seen.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'8ede6b54-0997-4e78-baf0-0196c3c76281','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286085,864,'1girl,solo,1.6::fragmented within a cubist atelier,her form and crimson dance dress disassembled across a 90-degree space framed by four canvases,elements floating in three dimensions::,1.5::a dynamic pose of reassembly,her body parts displaced and reconfigured-a real hand passing through a sketched rib structure,a knee''s cubic shadow transforming into an elbow''s spherical form on the wall::,1.5::a red dance dress deconstructed into floating geometric fabric planes-triangles,diamonds-some attached,others hovering independently to suggest absent curves,with cobalt paint flowing over a conceptual thigh plane::,1.4::shattered mirrors reflect her neck in seven distinct perspective slices,each showing a different curvature of the same spine,while her breath condenses into hovering transparent polyhedra capturing unseen intimate angles::,1.3::textures of smooth silk,wet paint,fractured glass,skin with visible veins,and the grainy surface of stretched canvas::,1.2::background of an artist''s studio with easels,scattered brushes,and studies of geometric forms,all immersed in sharp,analytical light::,masterpiece,dimensional poetry,a portrait where body,fabric,and breath are perpetually rearranged into a living theorem of form and perception.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'7b2acab7-db65-4bc2-80fc-0ded7bc0dca5','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286086,864,'1girl,solo,1.6::positioned within a moonlit temple colonnade,her physical form and its painted shadow on the wall perform separate,symbolic rituals under the shifting light::,1.5::a composed,mystical pose,one hand touching the eye of horus tattoo on her collarbone while her shadow raises the feather of truth,her body still yet alive with the subtle vibration of a heartbeat against golden armor::,1.5::an ornate golden chestplate with geometric openings,the skin beneath dusted with lapis lazuli pigment,her eyelashes sprinkled with gold dust that falls and creates tiny,glyph-like marks on her chest::,1.4::moonlight moves across the scene,emphasizing the disconnect between her solid form and its symbolic shadow,with each heartbeat causing a visible tremor along the edges of the metal::,1.3::textures of cool metal,fine mineral powder,warm skin,ancient painted plaster,and the delicate fall of gold particles::,1.2::background of massive,eroded stone columns and fragments of mythological murals under a predawn starry sky::,masterpiece,dual ritual,a living body caught between the weight of ceremony and the quiet,insistent truth of its own pulse.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'a4a549b7-41ab-4d65-8189-1d846ff69220','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286087,864,'1girl,solo,1.6::standing on the edge of a city''s highest rooftop,engulfed by translucent tendrils of solidified light pollution rising like viscous liquid from the urban glow below::,1.5::a pose of arrested observation,one hand holding an astronomical telescope now entangled by the creeping light-tendrils,face tilted upward with an expression of overwhelmed awe and resignation::,1.5::a silver reflective dress mirroring the chaotic light,etched sharply against the swirling orange-yellow and purple lightscape,illuminated from within by the flowing ghost-images of billboards,traffic trails,and neon shards inside the tendrils::,1.4::long exposure motion blur blends with digital glitch artifacts,making buildings waver while she remains in stark focus::,1.3::textures of liquid light,brushed metal,optical glass,and hazy smog::,1.2::background of a distorted violet night sky,where true stars are drowned out by the pulsating web of artificial light::,masterpiece,urban sublime,a portrait of cosmic longing swallowed by the city''s own electric bloodstream.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'ed69af00-9c35-4ab7-800f-5d91e89789a9','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286088,864,'1girl,a quiet and introspective atmosphere,a minimalist and surreal scene,pure black background,subtle contrast between darkness and light,the girl sits on the ground hugging her knees,gentle water ripples spreading across the surface beneath her,reflective and dreamlike mood,the girl positioned on the right side of the frame,side view composition,the girl lifts her eyes and gazes upward above her head,a sense of stillness and solitude','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'cfcab73a-598e-4070-b0ba-06654140bd20','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286089,864,'1girl,solo,magical girl,1.6::standing before a shattered mirror,tendrils of solidified “reflection” leaking from its wounds—composed of fragmented images,inverted colors,and mirrored textures that distort whatever they touch::,1.5::a defensive yet mesmerized posture,one hand reaching toward her own fractured double,expression caught between horror and recognition::,1.5::her vibrant magical attire is both source and victim—its colors warped into deep cyan and teal where the mirror-tendrils replicate and corrupt,lit by the cold flicker of surveillance-style multiple exposures::,1.4::visuals are layered through broken glass prisms,infinite recursive echoes processed with vhs tape delay and magnetic ghosting::,1.3::textures of sharp glass shards,liquid mirror silver,pixelated duplicates,and analog noise::,1.2::background of a dim room filled with countless broken mirrors,each shard reflecting a distorted version of the scene::,masterpiece,ontological horror,the self devoured by its own reflection,an identity shattered into a thousand glitching echoes.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'0eb7ffbc-cb80-4d88-a143-d1b808bb40f5','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286090,864,'翻译：一名少女,独自一人,魔法少女,1.6::站在一面破碎的镜子前,凝固的“倒影”如触手般从镜子的裂缝中渗出——由破碎的图像、反转的颜色和扭曲的纹理构成,所触之处皆被扭曲::,1.5::她摆出防御却又着迷的姿势,一只手伸向自己破碎的倒影,表情介于恐惧和认同之间::,1.5::她鲜艳的魔法服饰既是源头也是受害者——它的颜色在镜子触手复制和腐蚀的地方扭曲成深青色和蓝绿色,被监控摄像头式的多重曝光的冷光照亮::,1.4::画面通过破碎的玻璃棱镜层层叠加,无限递归的回声经过VHS磁带延迟和磁性重影处理::,1.3::纹理包括锋利的玻璃碎片、液态的镜面银、像素化的复制品和模拟噪声::,1.2::背景是一个昏暗的房间,里面摆满了无数破碎的镜子,每一块碎片都反射出场景的扭曲版本::,杰作,本体论恐怖,自我被自己的倒影吞噬,身份被粉碎成无数个故障的幻影。','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'b232434f-c58e-4893-8fac-262b5e6b393c','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286091,864,'1girl,solo,flowing in water current,editorial underwater gown,deconstructed white dress,asymmetric sheer fabric,bioluminescent harness details,geometric jellyfish like accessories,mysterious gaze,direct eye contact,hair swirling around facedynamic swimming pose,body arching gracefully,one hand releasing a school of silver fish,the other touching a large coral,strong water current creating motion in hair and dress,sharp focus on face and hand,motion blur on swimming fish and flowing hair,foreground out of focus passing jellyfish and bubbles,blurred background of a deep sea trench with sunbeams,dramatic caustic light from surface,high contrast,sparkling bioluminescence,cinematic blue tone,low angle shot,from below,full body,vibrant deep sea palette,electric blue,neon purple,stark white,silver highlights','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'a2732c4a-08a4-4360-a741-9fad3405562b','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286092,864,'a deep-sea diver in a broken suit at the ocean floor,their body being slowly encrusted and assimilated by strange,phosphorescent deep-sea corals,anemones,and barnacles,an alien yet beautiful transformation,the abyss looming around,cosmic horror aesthetic,by the art of h.p. lovecraft''s worlds and the game ''subnautica'',half of the body has decayed to reveal the skeleton inside','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'a171be2d-8dbe-49ec-9406-0b094baa1867','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286093,864,'翻译：一名身穿破损潜水服的深海潜水员躺在海底，身体被奇特的、发出磷光的深海珊瑚、海葵和藤壶慢慢覆盖并同化，这是一场既诡异又美丽的转变，深渊环绕四周，充满宇宙恐怖美学，灵感源自H.P.洛夫克拉夫特的世界和游戏《Subnautica》，身体的一半已经腐烂，露出了里面的骨骼。','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'72e5f7bb-bb9e-4613-a73f-8e70b3207923','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286094,864,'a human figure lying in a damp,dark part of an ancient forest,their body covered in a vibrant ecosystem of glowing mushrooms,colorful molds,and intricate fungal networks,new plant life sprouting from the form,bioluminescent details,macro photography style,cycle of life and decay,by the art of fantasy biology and scientific illustration,half of the body has decayed to reveal the skeleton inside','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'9f24474f-2126-474c-a24c-baa97cfbcda7','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286095,864,'slowly being overtaken by moss,vines,and small white flowers,skin turning into bark,hair into leaves,sunlight filtering through the canopy,serene and mystical atmosphere,symbolic of becoming one with nature,by the art of hayao miyazaki and the photography of brooke shaden','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'c200a74b-1af9-4478-8b8e-1e26b5c13a95','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286096,864,'a terrifying biomechanical construct,flesh fused seamlessly with rusted iron and glowing circuitry,multiple insectoid eyes,hydraulic limbs ending in bone blades,leaking black fluid,in a filthy workshop,cybernetic horror,by the art of necromunda and the video game scorn','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'c5ee7274-6a29-4e10-bb3e-e974539bbb19','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286097,864,'rhythm game concept art,grand narrative illustration,monochromatic black and white. a lone,fragile girl stands atop a floating ruin,facing a colossal,crumbling megastructure composed of interlocking gears and celestial rings that fill the entire horizon. high-tension composition with dramatic low-angle perspective to emphasize the overwhelming scale. shattered glass shards and abstract geometric prisms swirl in a violent vortex. intense chiaroscuro lighting with blinding white highlights and deep abyssal shadows. sharp,clean linework combined with expressive ink splashes and halftone patterns. the atmosphere is epic,somber,and filled with cosmic dread. in the center,the stylized title "void" is rendered in a sharp,glitchy font. masterpiece,ultra-detailed,cinematic framing,high contrast,dynamic motion blur,ethereal aesthetic,8k resolution.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'5259fbe6-18bf-47d1-b85c-98edfa20bb1e','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286098,864,'翻译：节奏游戏概念艺术，宏大叙事插画，单色黑白风格。一个孤独脆弱的女孩站在漂浮的废墟之上，面对着一座由相互交错的齿轮和天体环组成的巨大、摇摇欲坠的巨型建筑，它占据了整个地平线。高张力的构图，戏剧性的低角度透视，以强调其压倒性的规模。破碎的玻璃碎片和抽象的几何棱镜在猛烈的漩涡中旋转。强烈的明暗对比，刺眼的白色高光和深邃的阴影。锐利清晰的线条与富有表现力的墨迹飞溅和半色调图案相结合。画面氛围史诗般宏大、阴沉，充满宇宙般的恐惧。画面中央，风格化的标题“VOID”以锐利、带有故障效果的字体呈现。杰作，超精细，电影般的构图，高对比度，动态运动模糊，空灵的美感，8K分辨率。','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'1b795d49-13cc-40ab-a575-b4b61af30544','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286099,864,'2girls (tiny),2boys (huge foreground),sterile white laboratory room seen through a glass window,framing,view between two people,depth of field,tragic,clinical,voyeuristic,oppressive,narrative,bright cold light inside the room,dark shadowed foreground,foreground elements: on the left edge,a doctor in a white coat (half body visible,back view); on the right edge,another doctor in a white coat (half body visible). they hold medical clipboards and pens,filling the sides of the frame. the gap between them reveals the children.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'4bde767e-2bdf-44f3-955b-451520ef6433','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286100,864,'wearing a yellow safety helmet and sleeveless industrial workwear vest,holding heavy-duty cable cutters in both hands,cutting thick power cables and stealing copper wires,end-of-the-world industrial ruins,abandoned terminal land,dynamic action pose,extremely low-angle shot,cables,debris,and twisted metal looming over her,tight framing,oppressive composition,claustrophobic perspective,dark gritty atmosphere,dramatic high-contrast lighting,dust and sparks in the air,tension and danger,cinematic,intense focus on character under looming objects,visually heavy foreground elements,extreme sense of pressure','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'fa450440-ac33-4e02-a334-a95c5d1bfe78','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286101,864,'a young girl with long white hair and blue hair accessories stands in a green field dotted with white flowers. she holds a yellow flower,extends her arm toward a large,dark-armored figure. the figure kneels before her. the armor is black,detailed with spikes and sharp horns on the helmet. tall,futuristic buildings with geometric shapes stand in the background. the sky is clear blue with scattered white clouds. the composition is centered on the interaction between the two characters: the girl on the left,the armored figure on the right. the color palette includes blue sky,yellow flower,white hair,black armor,green grass,and white flowers. the art style is digital painting,with clean lines and a contrast between organic nature and synthetic architecture.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'d3a26fda-8bc8-4633-b088-9f29c880e411','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286102,864,'a luxurious and ethereal anime-style illustration,niji 7 style,a blonde girl with delicate features lounging lazily on an ornate silver carved sofa,wearing a flowing pale gold and white frilled gown with a soft satin sash,sheer white stockings with delicate vine tattoos on her thigh. she holds a black book titled "asuka" in front of her face,half-hidden. the scene is surrounded by opulent details: abundant white roses with silver leaves,vintage table lamps with soft warm glow,crystal wine glasses,stacked old leather-bound books,and draped silk fabrics. the atmosphere is a blend of dark fairy tale and aristocratic luxury,with cool-toned metallic reflections and soft cinematic lighting,highlighting the translucency of skin and the luster of fabrics. intricate details of hair strands,floral textures,and ornate furniture carvings,dreamy and immersive ambiance,high detail,8k resolution,soft brush strokes,muted and elegant color palette of silver,white,pale gold,and deep charcoal','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'0bb4c334-71fa-49da-bb09-bf6fb925bfc9','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286103,864,'翻译：一幅奢华而梦幻的动漫风格插画，Niji 7风格，一位金发少女慵懒地躺在华丽的银色雕花沙发上，她五官精致，身穿飘逸的淡金色和白色褶边长裙，腰间系着柔软的缎带。她穿着透明的白色丝袜，大腿上纹着精致的藤蔓图案。她手中拿着一本名为“明日香”的黑色书籍，半遮着脸。画面周围环绕着奢华的细节：盛开的白色玫瑰，银色的叶子，散发着柔和暖光的复古台灯，水晶酒杯，堆叠的旧皮质装帧书籍，以及垂坠的丝绸面料。整体氛围融合了暗黑童话和贵族奢华，冷色调的金属光泽和柔和的电影感光线，突显了肌肤的通透感和面料的光泽。画面细节丰富，包括发丝、花朵纹理和华丽的家具雕刻，营造出梦幻而沉浸式的氛围，8K分辨率，柔和的笔触，采用银色、白色、淡金色和深炭灰色等柔和优雅的色彩。','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'3834ec5a-8c80-4dd7-a8c3-4900823bc179','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286104,864,'masterpiece,best quality,2girls,honkai star rail,sparkle and stelle,sparkle has black twin tails with red ribbons and a kitsune mask on her head,red eyes,blushing and flustered expression. stelle has long grey hair and glowing yellow eyes,wearing a school uniform,leaning over sparkle from behind,stelle is playfully nibbling sparkle''s shoulder. stelle has an open book balanced on her head. intimate pose,messy classroom background,scattered papers and books on the desk,soft sunset lighting through the window,cinematic lighting,depth of field,vibrant colors,detailed eyes,high contrast,by kyoto animation style','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'03b3f4d6-9b3c-4df4-b62b-cdf08f19b726','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286105,864,'翻译：杰作，最佳品质，两名女孩，《崩坏：星穹铁道》，Sparkle 和 Stelle，Sparkle 扎着黑色双马尾，系着红色丝带，头上戴着狐狸面具，红色眼睛，脸颊泛红，表情慌乱。Stelle 留着灰色长发，眼睛闪烁着黄色光芒，穿着校服，从 Sparkle 身后俯身靠近，Stelle 调皮地轻咬着 Sparkle 的肩膀。Stelle 头上顶着一本打开的书。亲密的姿势，凌乱的教室背景，桌子上散落着纸张和书籍，窗外透进柔和的夕阳余晖，电影般的灯光，景深效果，鲜艳的色彩，细节丰富的眼睛，高对比度，京都动画风格。','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'db4bf01a-5787-47a9-8337-06bd345a85fa','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286106,864,'3girls,blue archive,tsukatsuki rio and ichinose asuna and kakudate karin,performing in a grand orchestra,rio in the center with long black hair and red eyes wearing an alluring black high-slit evening gown,asuna on the left with long blonde hair holding a white violin,karin on the right with dark skin and white stockings holding an erhu,iconic halos above their heads,intricate lace and silk textures,plunging necklines,elegant and sophisticated poses,luxury concert hall background,dark atmosphere with golden bokeh,soft dramatic spotlight,high contrast,cinematic lighting,masterpiece,highly detailed,sharp focus,vibrant colors,official art style','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'1db9e594-db28-4869-825c-c40532791330','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286107,864,'翻译：三位少女，来自《蔚蓝档案》，分别是月见里绪、一之濑明日奈和角馆花凛，正在一个盛大的管弦乐团中演奏。里绪居中，留着黑色长发，红色的眼睛，身穿一件迷人的黑色高开衩晚礼服；明日奈在左侧，留着金色长发，手持一把白色小提琴；花凛在右侧，肤色黝黑，穿着白色丝袜，手持一把二胡。她们头顶上方都有标志性的光环，服装上有着精致的蕾丝和丝绸纹理，深V领口，姿态优雅而精致，背景是一个豪华的音乐厅，整体氛围昏暗，带有金色散景，柔和而富有戏剧性的聚光灯，高对比度，电影般的灯光效果，杰作，高度精细，焦点清晰，色彩鲜艳，官方艺术风格。','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'f53403a9-7dcd-467b-a2dc-2befc62b6ffc','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286108,864,'a cute girl with long pink hair,wearing black stockings and white high heels is sitting on the keyboard of her computer in an anime-style setting. she has cyberpunk elements around her and wears headphones that look like small stuffed animals floating above his head. the background features musical instruments such as guitars,drums,keyboards and electronic curved screens. on one side there''s also some graffiti and cartoon characters such as bear-like figures. the overall scene exudes a vibrant atmosphere.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'60eecc69-99f6-454c-b2fa-25bfde767b73','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286109,864,'an anime girl in a black and white uniform,with silver hair and red eyes,wearing a cape and hat,holding an iron sword surrounded by blue light energy effects,standing on the ground,against a dark background,in the anime style,a full-body portrait,an anime art illustration,with a dark atmosphere,in a fantasy world setting,with a dark purple color scheme,in the anime aesthetic,with a detailed design,a fantasy concept art,in the anime style.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'73539096-7a33-441d-bf23-8e251fb204c2','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286110,864,'1girl,solo,beautiful seductive woman,elegant mature face,fair glowing skin,wearing oversized black blazer one-piece dress,loose fitting black suit skirt dress,loose deep v-neck overlapping exposing half breasts and deep snow-white cleavage,black genuine leather waist belt tightly cinching waist highlighting perfect hourglass figure,extremely short skirt hem barely covering plump round ass,skirt hem very short and easy to flash,black letter patterned stockings,glossy sheer black stockings wrapping long slender legs,high heels with brass rivet decorative stitching on high arch,black pointed toe with visible toe cleavage,standing graceful provocative pose,slight body tilt,modern luxury setting,soft elegant lighting,cinematic depth of field,nsfw,erotic office lady,cleavage tease,short skirt exposure,stocking gloss,loose v-neck slipping further exposing more breast,skirt riding up flashing ass cheek,low angle emphasizing long legs and heels,glossy stockings reflection,subtle nipple outline through fabric,hand on waist,from side view showing s-curve and cleavage,aroused blush,toe cleavage detail,wind lifting skirt slightly','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'fb1bc247-f2b1-403a-a945-3f9a495eaec7','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286111,864,'翻译：一位女孩，独身，美丽性感，优雅成熟的面容，白皙透亮的肌肤，身穿宽松黑色西装式连衣裙，宽松的深V领口略微露出半边乳房和雪白的深V领口，黑色真皮腰带紧紧束住腰身，凸显完美沙漏型身材，超短裙摆几乎遮不住丰满圆润的臀部，裙摆极短，容易走光，黑色字母图案丝袜，光泽透明的黑色丝袜包裹着修长的双腿，高跟鞋鞋跟处饰有黄铜铆钉，黑色尖头鞋露出脚趾缝，摆出优雅挑逗的站姿，身体略微倾斜，现代奢华的场景，柔和优雅的灯光，电影般的景深，NSFW，性感OL，乳沟挑逗，短裙走光，丝袜光泽，宽松的V领口滑落，露出更多乳房，裙子向上滑落露出臀部特写，低角度突出修长的双腿和高跟鞋，光泽的丝袜反射，透过布料隐约可见的乳头轮廓，手放在腰间，侧面展现出S形曲线和乳沟，脸颊泛红，脚趾缝隙的细节，裙摆被风轻轻吹起。','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'3dd099f2-6a8c-45f1-b6e0-747fcb2ebc5a','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286112,864,'a striking selective-color digital anime illustration of the mischievous fox-girl,rendered primarily in monochrome and greyscale with vivid red accents. she features her signature long black twin-tails with bright red gradient tips,a bold red highlight in her bangs,and piercing red eyes looking over a pair of round wire-rimmed glasses. atop her head are huge,fluffy black animal ears with white inner tufts and red-tipped ends,accessorized with red ribbon bows and small golden bells. her massive,extremely fluffy black tail with a red gradient tip curls on the ground beside her. she is dressed in a trendy,oversized streetwear outfit consisting of a short-sleeved graphic t-shirt layered over long sleeves,baggy cargo pants,a bold red canvas belt,and casual sneakers. she is sitting casually on a tiled urban sidewalk,leaning comfortably against a large glass storefront window. her legs are relaxed,and she is playfully pulling her glasses down slightly with one hand to gaze directly at the viewer with a confident smirk that reveals her cute snaggletooth. the background features the intricate tubes of neon signs glowing behind the dark glass. the image features high-contrast dramatic lighting,a stark black-and-white environment where only the vibrant red elements—her eyes,hair gradients,ear and tail tips,ribbons,and belt—pop dramatically,creating a cool,edgy,and highly stylized urban atmosphere.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'b2a272da-c676-44c0-b1e8-15e71a9871d7','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286113,864,'翻译：这是一幅引人注目的数码动漫插画，描绘了一位调皮的狐狸女孩。画面以黑白灰为主色调，点缀着鲜艳的红色。她标志性的黑色双马尾辫，发梢渐变为亮红色，刘海中也挑染了一缕醒目的红色，一双锐利的红眼睛透过一副圆形金属框眼镜凝视着前方。头顶上长着一对蓬松的大黑耳朵，内里是白色的绒毛，耳尖是红色的，还装饰着红色的丝带蝴蝶结和金色的小铃铛。她那条又粗又蓬松的黑色尾巴，尾巴尖也渐变为红色，卷曲地垂在身旁。她身着一套时髦的宽松街头服饰：短袖印花T恤叠穿在长袖T恤外面，下身是宽松的工装裤，腰间系着一条醒目的红色帆布腰带，脚上穿着休闲运动鞋。她随意地坐在铺着瓷砖的城市人行道上，舒适地倚靠在一家大型玻璃橱窗前。她双腿放松，一只手俏皮地将眼镜往下拉了拉，自信地笑着直视着镜头，露出可爱的龅牙。背景是错综复杂的霓虹灯管，在深色玻璃后闪闪发光。画面采用高对比度的戏剧性光线，黑白分明的画面中只有鲜艳的红色元素——她的眼睛、渐变的发色、耳朵和尾巴尖、丝带和腰带——格外醒目，营造出一种酷炫、前卫且极具风格化的都市氛围。','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'299e5e11-02ca-45d9-915b-cc5780a7d636','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286114,864,'1girl,gradient clothes,white dress,blue dress,a girl is captured in a dynamic,low-angle shot against a clear,vibrant blue sky. she is spinning gracefully,her body tilted back as if caught in a moment of joyful motion.a shower of pink and red rose petals swirls around her,caught mid-air by the wind,creating a sense of ethereal movement. she holds a lush bouquet of matching red roses close to her chest,with more petals trailing upward and outward from the center of the frame. the scene is bathed in bright,natural sunlight,casting soft shadows and highlighting the dreamlike,romantic atmosphere of the moment.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'ba1d93c2-4715-4054-9f18-d0e99951dab0','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286115,864,'standing poised atop an ornate open metallic pocket watch in the midground,facing forward while gazing serenely away from the viewer toward a starry crescent moon frame in the foreground,with white roses and a glowing letter positioned right-of-center in the shallow depth structure against a dark ethereal background. soft rim lighting from the upper left casts high contrast glows and lens flares on the pocket watch''s intricate clockwork gears,roses,and character edges,evoking a mystical nocturnal ambiance.white rose,crescent moon,pocket watch,letter,envelope,hand on own chest,sparkle,star (symbol),wide shot','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'1ba648b4-e918-4dad-9b3d-1c46ccdbba0a','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286116,864,'cowboy shot,upper body,1girl,solo,indoors,dark pristine corrupted laboratory,intense glitch effects,glowing dark purple and neon pink originium crystals floating,holographic data rings shattering; sweet but terrifyingly obsessive yandere smile,head extremely tilted,staring intensely,chromatic aberration,scanlines,digital decay','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'084209d9-8b71-41b1-857a-0de411d4c713','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286117,864,'the character is lying on her back on a dark reflective surface,sleeping peacefully with eyes closed,hands gently placed near her chest,legs slightly bent. lying,on back,sleeping,eyes closed.she is wearing a highly detailed white and pale pink frilled dress with a layered skirt,intricate lace trims,and puffy sleeves. the dress is decorated with large red bows featuring bright blue gems in the center. her legs are adorned with white thighhighs and pink ribbons wrapped around her legs. frilled dress,layered skirt,puffy short sleeves,red bow,jewel,ribbon-wrapped legs,cross-laced,white thighhighs.the scene has a dark fantasy and melancholic atmosphere. the character is entangled and bound by dark red thorny vines. scattered red roses and floating rose petals surround her. there are subtle blood splatters on her dress and skin. dark background,red rose,rose petals,thorny vines,plant vines,bound by vines,blood splatter,dramatic lighting,cinematic lighting,sunbeam,high contrast,chiaroscuro.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'95b104b4-8e82-4755-aba8-1e91575beb11','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286118,864,'1girl,open mouth laugh,colorful overalls,paint bucket in hand,caught mid joyful gesture,playfully splashing paint from the bucket,a cascade of color erupting into the air,hair and clothes reacting to the sudden motion,close up shot,dynamic angle,captured at the peak of the splash,paint droplets suspended in a colorful arc,her face alight with pure creative joy,sharp focus on her laughing eyes and the explosive paint splash,motion blur on the moving hair and paint droplets,foreground with blurred colorful trails,hard window light,creating brilliant sparkles on each paint droplet,high contrast,frozen moment of creative abandon,close up shot {approximate cowboy shot distance},dynamic low angle,high impact creative palette,bright skin,rainbow paint explosion','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'cd74ce93-b106-475e-9580-428bca17f4b1','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286119,864,'1girl,solo,editorial steampunk wear,deconstructed white shirt with clockwork details,geometric skirt,headphones with roman numeral accents,focused gaze,wind blown hair across face,direct gaze,dynamic sitting pose on a giant gear,body twisted,one hand reaching towards a floating roman numeral,the other bracing on the gear,strong wind from the clockwork whipping hair,skirt,and loose cogs,scattering them in foreground air,sharp focus on face and floating numeral,motion blur on hair and flying cogs,foreground out of focus gears,blurred background of a massive clockwork mechanism with dramatic light beams,dramatic backlight from light beams,high contrast,lens flare,wind streak effects,cinematic steampunk grade,full body shot,letterboxed,low angle,high contrast steampunk palette,electric aqua,deep brass,silver,black,white','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'aec6dc12-76d4-4742-bc43-504e12b24d4b','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286120,864,'extremely detailed,melancholic atmosphere,standing,1.2::hands on chest::,hand to neck,delicate posture,1.3::gothic dress::,black dress,white collar,black ribbon collar,long sleeves,white frilled cuffs,layered skirt,1.3::dress dissolving into feathers::,1.4::falling black feathers::,floating feathers,flying feathers,dynamic floating debris,1.2::gothic architecture::,cathedral,church spire,overcast,cloudy sky,mist,fog,muted colors,desolate background,a highly detailed,melancholic illustration of a character standing gracefully against a bleak and desolate cloudy sky. she holds her hands delicately against her chest and neck in a fragile,sorrowful posture. she is dressed in an ornate black gothic dress with a white collar,a dark ribbon tied at the neck,and elegant long sleeves ending in crisp white frilled cuffs. in a surreal and magical display,the dark fabric of her dress is breaking apart and dissolving into a massive swarm of dark feathers. a dramatic flurry of falling black feathers blows dynamically around her in the wind. behind her,towering majestically through the thick mist,are the intricate spires of a grand gothic cathedral. the entire scene features a moody,desaturated color palette,evoking a strong sense of tragedy and ethereal beauty.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'5ec4f691-be46-4f6e-a31d-2aab8060438a','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286121,864,'a heavily stylized,stream-of-consciousness watercolor piece where a ghostly,half-melted human profile is violently swallowed by an explosive,abstract bloom of dark crimson and black. the flower petals are not literal,but frantic,bleeding slashes of black watercolor over a suffocating indigo base,leaving rough,frayed edge lines that crawl across the canvas like spreading veins. a single,weeping eye remains visible through the chaotic ink,its form merging with the thick red pigment. highly detailed,jagged gold leaf texture is embedded deep into the core of the dark bloom,acting as a corrosive,blinding rot spreading outward into the dark blue. the composition abandons realistic form completely,relying on aggressive textures to convey an agonizing,beautiful consumption.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'b79d60f9-e592-49ff-ba1a-ba2fe6faca87','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
