INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286132,864,'1girl,solo,standing,a girl dressed in a classic black and white nun''s habit with a prominent white collar and a small cross ornament. she is standing with her body slightly angled,looking down with a deeply blushing and bashful expression. her hands,covered in white frilly gloves,are nervously clasped together at her waist. the long habit features a daring high slit on the side,revealing a garter strap holding up a dark thigh-high stocking. the scene is focused entirely on her timid posture and the contrast between her modest attire and the subtle,revealing details of her outfit against a plain,neutral background.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'b6092650-9b91-4ab1-ada1-d5e74c27e6f9','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286133,864,'1girl,solo,muscular female figure,ornate golden lion-themed armor with intricate engravings,golden helmet with curved horns and green gem on forehead,purple fabric under armor at waist and legs,right arm extended forward with open palm glowing with golden energy,left fist clenched emitting bright golden light burst,mouth open in shouting expression,dynamic combat pose with body leaning forward,{low angle view,dramatic composition},{cosmic space background with stars and nebulae},{massive glowing golden lion head spirit roaring behind left side},{intense golden energy explosion and light rays from fists},{sparkling golden particles and lens flares throughout scene},detailed metallic texture on golden armor plates,accurate hand positions with glowing palms,precise helmet ornament and horn shapes,flowing golden energy trails and beams,accurate purple fabric folds under armor,strong backlight from energy burst,correct clenched fist and open palm gestures,depth of field with sharp focus on figure and lion spirit,bokeh on distant stars,powerful golden glow illuminating armor,accurate armor joint and engraving details,professional anime game art style,clean lines,vibrant golden color palette with dark cosmic background,accurate proportions,precise facial expression with open mouth and intense eyes,no text,correct lion spirit size and position in background,detailed energy burst intensity and rays,accurate helmet gem and horn placement,precise armor shoulder and chest plate designs,intricate golden glove textures,correct light source from fists and lion head,dynamic action pose,epic cosmic atmosphere,foreground energy beams,bright radiant lighting from center left','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'e3faa954-ce21-4905-99cc-a451203a0f6f','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286134,864,'1girl,solo,straight-on,{{{{dark fantasy}}}},{{{{monochrome}}}},{{{{greyscale}}}},{{{{high contrast}}}},{{{{ink wash painting}}}},rough sketch,brush strokes,heavy lines,traditional media,dark fantasy,2.0::perfect hands, detailed fingers, five fingers::,{{{{chiaroscuro}}}},{{{{half shadow}}}},{{{{face in shadow}}}},dramatic lighting,deep shadows,cinematic shadows,backlighting,1.5::pointing staff forward::, 1.7::giant hydra in distance::, 1.6::looming in background::, 1.6::massive scale::, 1.5::nine headed serpent::, 1.4::dark green and black scales::, 1.4::ice blue theme::, 1.5::massive magic circle in distance::,1.3::shimmering ice shards flying::, 1.3::depth of field::, vibrant, dynamic, imaginative, surreal, prismatic, kaleidoscopic, rainbow-inspired, 1.4::prismatic shattering ice::, 1.3::explosive bursts of cool colors::, interplay of light and shadow, magical and otherworldly, reflection and refraction, 1.2::glowing neon blue hues::, translucent layers and textures, a sense of depth and movement, prismatic rays of light, translucent hair, refraction hair, extreme aesthetic, 0.7::quasarcake::, 1.3::a shot with tension::, 1.2::visual impact::, impactful picture, official art, movie perspective, advertising style, magazine cover','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'20454193-de7f-4e6e-8fa0-a2b6120e5ddb','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286135,864,'this image is rendered through a monochromatic tone,presented in a chaotic and slightly tilted,overhead perspective. it depicts three unclothed,long-haired female human figures scattered within a complex,flowing environment filled with swirling,wave-like patterns bubble-like textures. in the upper left lies the figure in the lowest dark corners supine,her face slightly turned to the right,eyes open,a ring-like structure near her left ear,her right arm bent and placed. the figure slightly to the left of center is prone or semi-concealed,her face tilted to the lower left,eyes closed,left arm bent and hand placed below her cheek. the figure on the right is completely turned away from the viewer,revealing only her head and upper back covered by long hair,while her lower body blends into the dark,wavy area. the overall image is sharply focused,with even lighting. the pale,shadowless outlines of the figures contrast sharply with the dark,tallied textures of the surrounding environment without any depth-of-field blurring effect.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'fc8cd150-9484-42bc-9478-4da4ef6e4436','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286136,864,'this image presents a wide horizontal frame composition,looking out through a massive structure with rough block textures. the structure consists of several huge,horizontally parallel dark brown beams,forming narrow rectangular views between them. on the edge of the beam slightly below the center of the frame,there is a tiny black silhouette of a person wearing a wide-brimmed hat,with a long object placed flat beside them,and their posture is turned away from the viewer. the right wall inside the frame structure is light yellow,illuminated by strong side light,the shadows of the beams are cast on the wall. through the gaps between the beams,distant natural landscapes can be seen: a pale blue sky and horizon in the distance,with a large expanse of white clouds below,with clouds showing dense and scattered textures. white flighty clouds are scattered on the right side and bottom of the image,obscuring some details of the building structure and creating a hazy sense of depth. light shines in from the right and front,creating heavy shadows inside the building structure,which forms a strong contrast between light and dark with the bright outdoor landscape. the entire scene is viewed from a straight angle,with uniform focus,and the shows obvious brush textures and graininess.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'9811664b-7ecd-42fa-b593-2a7b948465a1','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286137,864,'this image,set against a pure black background,presents two humanoid entities in a close-up half-body composition. the entity in the foreground on the left has extremely pale skin and long,light blue-gray hair with irregularly pointed ends. its face features large,dark brown eyes and a short,horizontally slit-like black mouth,and it wears a white sleeveless top with a black ribbon bow at the chest. to the right rear,partially obscured by the foreground entity,is a second entity. its torso,face,and long hair are covered in a deep red,irregularly intersecting net-like texture,revealing only a dark right eye. the two entities are in physical contact at opposite ends of the image: on the right,the pale left hand of the foreground entity clasps the right hand of the rear entity,which is covered in red texture; on the left,the foreground entity''s right hand rests on the extended,red-textured left hand of the rear entity. all visible fingertips of both entities have a sharp,white,cone-shaped appearance. the image is taken from eye level,is sharply focused,and has no depth-of-field blurring effect. the even lighting creates a strong contrast in color and light between the red and white of the foreground and background objects and the pure black background. no traces of censorship or pixelation were found in the image.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'4893cc12-340f-485b-99fd-0d69c7ac8b4c','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286138,864,'this image presents a flat composition made up of paper-cut or collage elements,containing two main entities. on the left side of the picture is a huge white animal skull-shaped structure in right-profile. its surface has black shadows and hatching. it has long and open upper and lower jaws,exposing square teeth. the eye socket of the skull is replaced with an image of a real human eyeball with a pink sclera and a black pupil. on the top of the head,there extends a structure with rough texture and serrated protrusions. on the right side of the picture,a female figure stands half-length. it is presented in high contrast black and white textures,wearing a black top hat,a thick coat with a rough and mottled pattern,and multiple layers of scarves around the neck. her face is covered with strong black shadows,and she has pure white eyes without pupils and a rectangular black nose. the background of the main body consists of a pure black area and a dark brown vertical wood-grain surface at the upper-right corner of the picture. the picture has no photographic depth-of-field blurring effect,and all visual elements are on the same flat focal plane.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'9c982145-6190-44d6-8e78-a4d5fcb70406','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286139,864,'this image depicts two figures engaging in close interaction against a white background,with a vertically centered medium shot composition. on the left is a tall,heavily armored knight clad in silver-gray metal armor adorned with intricate engravings,and a thick white fur collar around his shoulders. the knight wears a fully enclosed helmet with a decorative protrusion at the top that curves backward. both the armor and the fur are extensively stained with splotches of bright red blood. his body leans slightly forward,with his head bowed against the shoulder of the figure on the right,and his right hand hangs down,gripping a cross-hilted longsword covered in blood. on the right is a smaller female figure wearing a dark green hooded robe,with the hood pushed back to reveal long dark brown hair that partially covers her left eye. her skin is fair,her expression calm yet tinged with melancholy,and her gaze is directed downward. her arms are wrapped around the knight''s chest and back,assuming an embracing posture. a bright red vertical line runs straight down from the center of the top of the frame,passing through the center of the knight''s head and the point where the two figures meet,extending to the bottom of the frame. the edges of the image have a soft fade-out effect,with no environmental background. light is cast from the upper right,creating distinct light and shadow contrasts on the folds of the armor and robe. the overall focus is sharp,with no lens distortion,reverse style.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'52d5c5bb-fec9-405c-acb8-8c5b51e30568','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286140,864,'1girl,solo,she stands confidently,holding an ornate golden-hilted sword in one hand,the other resting at her hip,her posture exuding authority. her expression is calm yet determined,with striking teal eyes and long,flowing white hair that frames her face and cascades down her back. she wears an elaborate red military-style coat with gold trim and blue accents,layered over a white corset-style top and tight white trousers,paired with sleek gold stiletto heels. the coat features intricate patterns and decorative details,enhancing her noble and powerful presence.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'0ec912ef-8325-4bce-8039-5e9df8d74e28','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286141,864,'{narrative-rich composition},{dramatic angle,dynamic angle},{cinematic feeling},action shot,motion blur,sparks,dynamic angle,chiaroscuro,metallic reflection,intense atmosphere,a high-octane battle scene featuring a female knight in heavily polished,full-plate silver armor. she has the pale skin,short white hair,and cold,golden eyes of a cyborg,expressionless in the heat of combat. she is captured in mid-swing,wielding a massive greatsword that is cutting through a swarm of dark,shadowy abstract entities. the impact generates blinding sparks and shockwaves that distort the air. the background is a blur of dark blue and black motion lines. the lighting is dramatic,with the bright flashes of sparks illuminating the scratches and dents on her armor,while the rest of the scene falls into deep shadow.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'0fe3ed30-eed7-403a-9580-449d9b1adb4e','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286142,864,'a high-angle top-down view of a sunny beach. the character is lying on a beach chair,completely shaded by a beach umbrella. she has a relaxed and casual posture,legs crossed,with a happy expression and a warm smile looking up at the viewer. she is wearing an exquisite and beautiful floral-patterned swimsuit,with a stylish leg garter on one leg. in the corner,a part of a coconut tree is visible. scattered beach toys are on the sand. intense sunlight,strong contrast between light and shadow,sharp shadows,cinematic lighting,photorealistic,daily life atmosphere','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'d3d04a90-fa57-4299-8667-c0b22e826fac','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286143,864,'1girl,white fur,maid style clothes,kimono,white and blue print pattern,solo,gentle smile,face focus on her face and fan,serene expression,loose strands,elegant style,hand focus,delicate fingers,elegant hand pose,detailed nails,glossy nails,ring,jewelry,subtle accessories,folding fan,ornate fan,crystal fan,translucent fan,glass-like material,intricate patterns,lace edges,detailed structure,iridescent light','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'eb211b1f-8671-48a4-8adf-37392842b34b','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286144,864,'1girl,solo,her teal eyes glowing with fierce red battle energy. she is captured mid-combat in a wide,aggressive stance: one hand slams down,summoning sharp red crackling energy bursts from the ground,while the other swings a large black katana with glowing red accents behind her,motion blur on the blade emphasizing blistering speed. she wears her signature dark blue rhodes island coat with teal lining,blue plaid skirt,black thigh-high stockings,and dark shoes,her hair and coat billowing dramatically with the force of her movement. the background is a vast,swirling deep space galaxy,filled with teal and purple nebulas,scattered bright stars,and wispy cosmic dust trails. floating black-and-red glowing rectangular portals blend seamlessly into the starscape,framing the character. stark contrast lighting clashes her fiery red/teal battle energy against the cool,infinite cosmic tones,with dark spiky energy effects framing the foreground. the intense,high-octane battle aosphere is amplified by bold linework and painterly texture,set against the awe-inspiring expanse of outer space.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'bc6080eb-cfcf-4092-9107-f6d39ff19b65','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286145,864,'character charging from right to left,swinging fist forward and shattering the space itself,glass-like cracks spreading through the air,dynamic action shot with intense motion blur,hair blowing backward by the wind,serious expression with gritted teeth,a pair of crimson blood-colored eyes looming in the background,dramatic combat atmosphere,powerful impact moment','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'91872b52-85e5-4b0b-a7de-420749c58b64','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286146,864,'1girl,white long shan,monster,monster holding girl,monster pov,black background,size difference,its huge clawed hand is lifting and grabbing a beautiful young girl into the air. the girl looks frightened yet strangely captivated,her body dangling helplessly. dramatic low-angle view emphasizing the monster''s overwhelming size and power','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'e5affc09-bfd2-44e2-a51c-311ea0ccc972','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286147,864,'illustration with complex gritty linework and muted colors. a young,curvaceous woman with an athletic,fit physique and a large-breasted body. she has a petite frame and an athletic,toned torso and legs. she is wearing large,round sunglasses with bold yellow-orange lenses,and her lips are vividly red,glossy,and open in a bold expression. she has dark,short hair with a chic cut and bangs. her clothing is a colorful,patchwork outfit made from torn sections of old newspaper and torn magazine pages,in shades of yellow,red,blue,green,and orange,creating a collage effect that creates a striking and disorienting visual experience. the artwork uses an extreme low angle shot and extreme close-up perspective,showing the image from below and very close to the face,creating a sense of intimacy,distortion and foreshortening. the face is angled slightly upwards and to the side,with the chin exposed,lips parted,revealing the tongue and teeth,which enhances the seductive,assertive pose. the background is a solid color that provides a stark contrast to the collage elements of the outfit and the colorful,patchwork fashion of the outfit. the style is a gritty,urban collage art style,evoking the texture and layered complexity of street art and urban graffiti,with bold color contrasts and fragmented textures from the collage elements of the clothing. the pose is seductive,assertive,and alluring,with a sense of forward motion and confident sexuality. the image is framed in a way that emphasizes the upper body,face,and hands interacting with the clothing,creating an intimate,provocative,and sexually charged composition. the scene is dynamic and visually intense,capturing a moment of assertive sensuality and power,4::solo::','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'74e7c9b1-cdf4-4912-8c58-fc56829f57d8','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286148,864,'1girl,silhouette,from behind,holding weapon,handgun,appearing as a stark pitch-black silhouette,featuring textured hair and a jacket outline,clutching a detailed handgun firmly in the center. this artwork is a striking cinematic poster design set against an intense,vibrant hot pink background. a brilliantly glowing,ethereal halo hovers above,while sharp,fragmented crystalline light wings radiate powerful energy from her back. the dark figure dissolves at the base into dramatic,gritty ink splatters,1.3::stark contrast::,1.2::glowing light effects::','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'f1255f84-a36f-4430-9c79-b4f348e7a449','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286149,864,'1girl,lolita dress,frills,crystal,solo,upper body,sitting,basement floor,surrounded by toys and crystals,playful,cross-legged,holding crystal up,chaotic room,horizontal composition. frame her sitting cross-legged on the basement floor surrounded by scattered toys,broken crystals,and colorful debris,holding a glowing crystal up in front of her face with both hands. use a horizontal composition capturing the chaotic spread of her playthings around her. use eye-level camera. keep her face sharp with a cheerful,manic smile. scattered colorful light from multiple crystals creates a whimsical yet unsettling atmosphere','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'11e7947e-c7f8-4747-81a9-7ca530fba4c5','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286150,864,'in a dark and shadowy setting,tachibana sherry holds several thin red strings between her fingers like a quiet puppeteer. tachibana sherry wears a dark outfit with blue decorative accents,along with a black hat adorned with ribbons and small ornaments. one hand is raised near her face as she carefully controls the strings,while the other hand reaches forward to guide them. her golden-orange eyes and calm expression make her look mysterious and composed in the dim light.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'611404b1-0bf5-4277-9e42-11c2618d684f','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286151,864,'at the center of the scene,tono hanna is suspended like a delicate marionette,connected to the red strings controlled by tachibana sherry. tono hanna wears an elegant green dress with white frills,dark trim,ribbons,and rose-like decorations. a focused beam of light falls directly onto tono hanna,making her the main visual focus. the light highlights her blonde hair,the folds of her green dress,and the pale ribbons around her,making her appear graceful,fragile,and almost like a performer on a dark stage.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'69f042f8-b50f-47cd-ad7f-1ae4d44f79f3','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286152,864,'the surrounding darkness makes tono hanna stand out even more,while tachibana sherry stays closer to the shadows. the thin red strings between them glow visually against the dark atmosphere,creating a magical,theatrical,and slightly eerie mood.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'ccdcc52e-ee10-449a-a335-a84bccaa8112','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286153,864,'a somber,muted anime-style illustration shows nikaido hiro sitting on the floor beside sakuraba ema''s empty clothes. the scene is viewed from above at a slight angle. nikaido hiro is positioned on the left,seated with her body leaning backward in panic,as if startled by what she sees. she is mostly seen from behind,with long black hair,subtle dark red highlights,and a crimson flower hair ornament. her visible outfit is a dark black-and-red dress. one hand reaches tensely toward the empty clothes beside her.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'98400fed-d303-4d3a-9647-2a1cafec76a6','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286154,864,'on the ground lies sakuraba ema''s empty outfit in a collapsed human-like shape,with no body,no face,and no person inside. the clothing reflects sakuraba ema''s appearance,showing a navy-and-white outfit with a large bow at the chest. the collar is open and hollow,with many red butterflies emerging from the neckline as the central surreal focal point.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'afe8811a-c8fb-49c8-b0ad-9e38d60c0bfc','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286155,864,'red bloodstains and red splashes are scattered across the empty clothes. the pale,simple background keeps the focus on nikaido hiro,sakuraba ema''s empty clothes,the red butterflies,and the red stains. japanese text appears on the right side of the image. the overall atmosphere is tragic,eerie,unsettling,and filled with panic.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'9600bd2b-905d-4133-b3ee-cf0759772d90','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286156,864,'a close-up,eye-level shot captures a single young anime girl nestled within a dense field of large sunflowers. the scene is enveloped in a soft,melancholic cool purple and pale yellow color atmosphere,suggesting a diffused dusk light. the girl,positioned slightly to the right of the center,has short,messy pale pinkish-white hair and reflective,pale lavender eyes that look forward with a solemn,vacant expression. she is partially obscured by a large sunflower on the right,which she gently touches with her raised right hand,while her left hand is visible below it with fingers softly spread. the composition features a strong sense of depth,with a blurred sunflower dominating the left foreground,the girl in the midground,and a dense wall of softer,out-of-focus sunflowers filling the background.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'6e3ec37e-5ea2-43b6-8519-8cc346734b3b','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286157,864,'a cinematic wide-angle distant shot on a grassy hillside under a clear blue sky. the first character is a mature girl pouncing down from the sky midair with a huge,joyful smile;fluttering dynamically in the wind as she falls. on the ground below,the second character is a mature girl.she is standing firmly on the grass,looking up at the girl with his arms spread wide open in a fully welcoming gesture,actively preparing to catch her securely in her embrace.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'128fb5fc-cc60-4a1e-847b-40224c2c71c0','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286158,864,'The scene depicts Hatsune Miku as the printed artwork on a compact disc enclosed in a clear plastic CD jewel case. The figure of Hatsune Miku printed on the disc surface, whose long, angular twin-tailed dark teal hair is interspersed with digital glitch artifacts that fragment its edges with streaks of bright blue, purple and cyan, wears her signature futuristic form-fitting outfit constructed of sharp segmented dark and light fabric panels, and is posed in side profile facing toward the left of the frame with loose strands of her hair fanning out as if moved by a light breeze, with parts of her torso and lower form broken up by fragmented glitch patterns that blend into the reflective iridescent surface of the CD. The entire jewel case is set against a smooth pale blue gradient background that lightens to an off-white shade directly behind the center of the disc, the shot is a straight-on eye-level full view of the front face of the closed jewel case, even cool-toned ambient light creates subtle refractions and rainbow iridescent highlights across the raised edges of the clear plastic case and the shiny CD surface, multiple text elements are present in the image: a matte light gray rectangular sticker affixed to the left side of the jewel case reads "17 HATSUNE MIKU", a transparent overlay on the right half of the disc displays the text "01", a globe icon, the phrase "HIGH QUALITY SOUNDS", followed by several lines of Python code referencing the import of the pygame module, loading an audio file named "MIKU THANK YOU.mp3", playing the file, and printing the string "HAPPY BIRTHDAY", while lines of binary code','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'5ea9af56-cbd5-41cd-9527-e118d85edba6','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286159,864,'翻译：画面描绘的是初音未来以印刷在透明塑料CD盒中的光盘形象出现。光盘表面印着初音未来的形象，她长长的、棱角分明的双马尾深青色头发中夹杂着数码故障艺术效果，发梢呈现出明亮的蓝色、紫色和青色条​​纹。她身着标志性的未来主义紧身服装，这套服装由明暗相间的布料拼接而成。她侧身面向画面左侧，几缕碎发仿佛被微风吹拂般飘散开来。她的躯干和下半身部分被破碎的故障图案所分割，这些图案与光盘反光的虹彩表面融为一体。整个CD盒置于柔和的浅蓝色渐变背景之上，背景在光盘中心正后方逐渐过渡为米白色。镜头以平视角度正面拍摄，展现了闭合的CD盒的全貌。即使是冷色调的环境光，也能在透明塑料盒的凸起边缘和光滑的CD表面上产生微妙的折射和彩虹般的光泽。图像中包含多个文字元素：CD盒左侧贴着一张哑光浅灰色矩形贴纸，上面写着“17 初音未来”；光盘右半部分覆盖着一层透明薄膜，上面显示着“01”字样、一个地球图标、“高品质音效”字样，以及几行Python代码，这些代码导入了pygame模块，加载了名为“MIKU THANK YOU.mp3”的音频文件，播放了该文件，并打印出字符串“生日快乐”。此外，图像中还包含一些二进制代码。','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'734c5522-b402-4c6a-babb-efb70097b8ad','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286160,864,'an illustration set against a vast,vivid blue sky. two girls are suspended in open space,creating a quiet sense of falling or drifting. the composition feels airy and weightless,with most of the frame filled by a rich,saturated blue sky that gradually fades into a lighter cyan tone,giving the image a calm yet melancholic atmosphere.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'1ccead03-b0bf-4122-989f-cc64b814deac','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286161,864,'the upper figure is 1,positioned near the center-left and upside down,with bent legs and one arm reaching downward. she wears a white outfit with a red tie and a few black accessories. the lower figure is 2,placed near the bottom-left,reclining backward in midair and stretching one hand upward toward 1. she wears a white sailor-style dress with a red tie and dark shoes.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'387521a9-af91-4a70-836a-1112c4691fc2','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286162,864,'their bodies create a diagonal flow from the lower-left to the upper-center,emphasizing distance,separation,and a fragile emotional connection. the white clothing stands out clearly against the deep blue sky,while the red ties add a strong visual accent. the contrast between 1''s warm hair and 2''s cool hair gives the image a balanced color contrast,and the open sky enhances the feeling of drifting,loneliness,and quiet emotion.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'0db8237a-6981-4a0c-a9a1-f6b977ffc46d','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286163,864,'a soft,surreal anime-style illustration from a first-person perspective shows a pair of oversized pale hands gently cupped together,holding a small girl in their palms. the hands are solid and softly colored,with a light whitish skin tone,subtle pink warmth,and faint cool blue shading along the contours. a small glimpse of white sleeve cuffs is visible at the wrists. the girl is small enough to lie completely within the space of the two hands,with her whole body resting securely inside their range.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'dce74e70-3454-4e51-835d-c6f74177a5db','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286164,864,'the girl lies on her side in a curled,sleeping-like pose. her knees are drawn up toward her body,her torso folds inward slightly,and both arms are bent close to her chest. her head tilts gently to one side,and her eyes are closed,giving her a quiet,fragile,and withdrawn presence. she has long pale blonde hair flowing around her in ribbon-like twin tails,and she wears a delicate floral headdress decorated with roses,lace,and feather-like ornaments. her outfit is an elaborate green,white,and black frilled dress with layered ruffles,floral decorations,and ribbon details,preserving a refined doll-like elegance. she wears white thigh-high stockings,and her feet are covered only by the white stockings.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'018643d5-86b0-4718-b826-0133da14fd3b','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286165,864,'the composition is close and intimate,with the hands filling most of the frame and the girl placed securely at the center. thin red threads stretch across the image and loop around several fingers. one red thread is tied to the little finger of the girl lying in the hands,and it connects continuously with the other red threads,giving the image the feeling of a red string of e. the overall color palette is soft,pale,and low-saturation,dominated by white,light gray,faint pink skin tones,and cool pale blue shadows. these muted tones are gently contrasted by the green and black accents of the girl''s dress,her pale golden hair,and the vivid red threads,creating a dreamlike,delicate,and slightly unsettling atmosphere.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'d42291db-341d-4f2a-8623-d651850b6792','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286166,864,'a surreal and artistic illustration featuring a girl standing inside a large,ornate,gold-framed mirror that is placed in the middle of a vast field of vibrant red poppies. the girl has long,straight light blonde hair and gentle,soft-focused eyes,wearing a simple white long-sleeved top and a muted blue-grey skirt,with a dark messenger bag slung over her shoulder. inside the mirror frame,the background is an interior gallery wall with two smaller framed pictures hanging on it. outside the mirror,the landscape is a moody,overcast field under a sky filled with dramatic grey clouds and rolling distant mountains. the overall lighting is soft and diffused,characteristic of an overcast day. the art style is painterly,with delicate textures and a warm-to-cool color contrast between the red flowers and the muted grey landscape.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'f781c3f5-a93b-418d-81c2-29e362a6ec2f','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286167,864,'a dramatic,surreal anime-style illustration set in a vast black space. on the far right,akemi homura kneels on the reflective ground,facing left toward a dense floating mass of figures. she is shown in profile,with long straight hair and a school-uniform-like outfit,holding one hand forward as if reaching toward or confronting the glowing center in front of her. behind and around her,a series of bright concentric circles radiates outward like a tunnel or a time distortion,drawing the eye toward a small brilliant point of light near the center-right.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'c6ac4e96-5849-41ea-8c22-fc470800ecc0','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286168,864,'on the left and center-left,kaname madoka appears as a large clustered formation of many overlapping versions of herself,suspended in midair. the figures are layered together in a chaotic yet flowing arrangement,surrounded by countless thin curved lines that loop and cross through the dark space. some versions of kaname madoka are softly illuminated in warm pale gold and cream,while others are reduced to darker blue-black silhouettes,creating a sense of repetition,memory,and accumulation. the mass seems to surge toward the light,as if pulled through time or space.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'157f8944-6127-455e-b6c2-438957f743a2','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286169,864,'the overall color palette is dark,low-key,and highly cinematic,dominated by black,deep blue-gray,pale gold,cream,and muted orange light. the brightest areas gather around kaname madoka and the circular light structure behind akemi homura,while the surrounding darkness makes the glowing figures and white lines stand out sharply. the reflective floor adds a faint mirrored shimmer below the characters. the image feels lonely,cosmic,and emotionally intense,with the contrast between darkness and warm light creating a powerful sense of obsession,distance,and longing.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'cec08a57-3344-45e0-8505-0e4c192ec5d1','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286170,864,'翻译：这是一幅极具戏剧张力、带有超现实色彩的动画风格插画，背景设定在广阔的漆黑空间之中。画面最右侧，晓美焰（Akemi Homura）跪在具有反射效果的地面上，侧身面向左方，那里悬浮着一团密集的人影。她留着长直发，身穿类似校服的服装，一只手向前伸出，仿佛正试图触碰或与前方那个发光的中心点对峙。在她身后及周围，一系列明亮的同心圆向外扩散，宛如隧道或时空扭曲的景象，将视线引向画面中右侧偏中心位置的一个微小而耀眼的光点。','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'ec75e92a-ec56-416e-9321-11bf76c04d04','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286171,864,'画面左侧及中左侧，鹿目圆（Kaname Madoka）以一种由众多重叠的自身形象构成的巨大集群形态悬浮在半空。这些形象以一种既混乱又流畅的方式层叠交织，周围环绕着无数纤细的曲线，在黑暗空间中蜿蜒穿梭。部分鹿目圆的形象沐浴在柔和的浅金与奶油色光芒中，而另一些则呈现为深蓝黑色的剪影，营造出一种关于重复、记忆与积淀的氛围。这团身影仿佛正向着光芒涌动，宛如被某种力量牵引着穿越时空。','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'2e7cff1f-d7ac-43f4-a979-4b082eeb8f61','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286172,864,'close-up portrait of charactera and characterb,looking down with provoking expressions,breaking the fourth wall,gestures,pose,chaotic hyperpop art style,vibrant and clashing colors,distorted digital effects,futuristic punk outfits,incredibly detailed background,masterful composition,cinematic 8k,only two characters. charactera''s posture is finger gun,characterb''s posture is peace hand,kuji-in,tongue out,expressionless,crazy angry smile,grin','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'99deac81-80cd-47d5-a271-23ffbd2a3b95','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286173,864,'翻译：人物A和人物B的特写肖像，两人低头，表情挑衅，打破了第四面墙，手势、姿势，混乱的超波普艺术风格，鲜艳而冲突的色彩，扭曲的数字特效，未来主义朋克服装，极其细致的背景，精湛的构图，电影级8K分辨率，只有两个人物。人物A的姿势是手指枪，人物B的姿势是和平手势，有的竖中指，有的吐舌，有的面无表情，有的疯狂愤怒的笑容，有的咧嘴大笑。','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'2bca2094-85ec-45ee-b985-1f198af83dba','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286174,864,'1girl,split composition,dual personality,red ribbon,black dress,school uniform,cracked skin,facial mark,looking at viewer','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'e735275f-8ff1-49df-a658-c08db37965a7','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286175,864,'a single-body duality composition of matou sakura,divided vertically down the center by black mud. the left half of her body is normal sakura: long purple hair,purple eye,red ribbon,school uniform,gentle but hollow expression. the right half is dark sakura: white hair,red eye,black dress,cracked skin,facial mark,yandere trance.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'ebde1beb-9684-411c-a61e-837b9ef62429','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286176,864,'the black mud forms a thick vertical seam from the top edge of the frame to the bottom edge,running through the center of her face,chest,and body. on the left side,the mud stains the school uniform and reaches toward her purple hair. on the right side,the mud blends into the black dress and spreads into cracked skin lines. the two halves should still read as one person,not two separate characters.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'3bc6db64-a434-450e-b51f-ddcaad73dac3','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286177,864,'color system: purple on the left,black and white on the right,red accents shared by both halves. her left hand is raised near her heart,hesitant and closed. her right hand hangs lower,relaxed but threatening,fingers slightly spread. one purple eye and one red eye both look directly at the viewer.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'10fcce1d-1cb2-4ebf-93ae-2f04e09d6b54','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286178,864,'画面呈现间桐樱（Matou Sakura）单体双重人格的构图，被黑泥沿垂直中线一分为二。左半身是常态樱：紫色长发、紫眸、红丝带、校服，神情温和却空洞。右半身是黑化樱：白发、红眸、黑裙、皮肤龟裂、面部印记，呈现出病娇般的恍惚神态。','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'1cbb826c-77fa-4234-bdbb-a4b2386c46b2','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286179,864,'1girl,solo,sensitive,upper body,from below,cropped jacket,white jacket,long sleeves,black shirt,black miniskirt,ring,looking to the side,dynamic pose,glowing ring,glowing,rain,wet,wind,grey sky,overcast,raining,outdoors,cloudy sky .','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'957e6fd8-0721-427b-8ab2-a87cee2b40a2','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286180,864,'**camera**: close-up upper body shot from a low angle {from below},horizontal composition,dynamic perspective looking up at the character.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'568fb120-fa6c-476e-a430-e9c2ccca4cf6','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286181,864,'**character**: young girl,wearing a white cropped jacket with long sleeves over a black inner shirt and a black miniskirt,wearing a ring. **action**: she looks off to the side with a dynamic,lively pose; her ring emits a vivid cyan-green glow lighting up her hand.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'ad9ab17c-b052-4254-9785-4b5b4eef3da0','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286182,864,'**scene**: outdoors under a grey overcast sky,rain falling around her,wet atmosphere with wind blowing.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'9af9a7cd-b375-44c0-9537-51276e163490','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286183,864,'close-up portrait,1girl,tears falling,looking at bright sky with painful smile,wind blowing hair,sunset or dawn sky with dramatic clouds,bittersweet expression,hand gently touching cheek,glowing tear drops,hair strands','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'a53f9f22-40ff-4dfb-9bfc-bfead893af56','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286184,864,'a vibrant and sweet surreal scene with bright warm lighting and sparkling lens flares,a girl sitting inside a giant glass bowl filled with clear sparkling liquid,surrounded by a massive feast of oversized desserts. a girl,smiling gently. she is leaning back in the glass bowl with her legs lifted high in the air,resting one hand delicately near her mouth. giant strawberries,large waffle on a white plate,shiny wrapped candies,pink sprinkled donut,bowl of pastel round candies,large glass of yellow juice,sliced fruit,light rays refracting through the glass,soft pastel aesthetic,detailed food','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'dfe1b6e6-4ac5-4e3b-9971-c1704a5f56de','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286185,864,'1girl,solo,canonical appearance,canonical outfit,flowing hair,looking at viewer,faint blush,calm expression,closed mouth,seated,knees together,legs forward,one hand resting beside her,centered foreground,full body,black thighhighs,brown leather satchel beside her,retro windows xp desktop,windows xp bliss wallpaper,green hill,vivid blue sky,white clouds,multiple overlapping classic computer windows,grey dialog boxes,blue title bars,beveled buttons,pixelated user interface,large desktop window behind the character,smaller dialog windows overlapping one another in the midground,character sitting on the lower edge of a dialog window,interface elements partially behind her body,brown satchel overlapping the window frame,prominent popup dialog on the left reading "do you love me?",the word "love" in red,two separate beveled buttons labeled "yes" and "yes",windows title text "windows xp",desktop icons aligned along the upper left,exact readable interface text,no additional text,nostalgic early-2000s computer aesthetic,retro anime illustration,slightly pixelated edges,crisp cel shading,saturated blue and green palette,red accent color,surreal digital collage,layered depth,symmetrical central composition,preserve composition','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'3d3851a4-9b40-4f81-936f-bbbab7230820','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286186,864,'翻译：1个女孩，单人，经典形象，经典服装，飘逸长发，看向观众，脸颊泛红，表情平静，嘴唇紧闭，坐着，双膝并拢，双腿向前，一只手放在身侧，画面居中，全身像，黑色过膝长袜，身旁放着棕色皮质挎包，复古windows xp桌面，windows xp壁纸，绿色山丘，湛蓝天空，白色云朵，多个重叠的经典电脑窗口，灰色对话框，蓝色标题栏，斜面按钮，像素化用户界面，大型桌面窗口位于角色身后，较小的对话框在中景处相互重叠，角色坐在对话框的下边缘，界面元素部分位于角色身后，棕色挎包遮挡了窗口边框，左侧醒目的弹出对话框显示“你爱我吗？”，“爱”字为红色，两个独立的斜面按钮分别标有“是”和“是”，windows标题文字“windows xp”，桌面图标沿……排列左上角，清晰易读的界面文字，无其他文字，怀旧的2000年代初期电脑美学，复古动漫插画，略带像素化的边缘，清晰的赛璐珞着色，饱和的蓝绿色调，红色点缀色，超现实的数字拼贴，层次丰富的景深，对称的中心构图，保持构图完整。','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'2e8a3849-4ad8-4483-81d5-2fc822ece09b','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286187,864,'an absolute masterpiece cinematic cosmic-gothic anime illustration matching the surreal frame-in-frame composition a cute anime girl stands smiling inside a glowing rectangular wardrobe showcase with hanging clothes behind her. framing the showcase is a giant,ominous background girl with intense glowing eyes,and cosmic galaxy-patterned gloves covering her face in a crossed-arm dark pose. shadowy hands reach towards the central showcase,surrounded by floating creepy organic eyes with red pupils,blue neon rings,glowing blue chains,and a brilliant swirling iridescent rainbow vortex in the top-left corner.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'d7e8adad-d2e7-4a79-a751-d4e0883c2f7b','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286188,864,'a dynamic and minimalist anime-style ink illustration featuring a sleek black cat in motion. the overall composition is highly dramatic,built upon a strong diagonal axis running from the lower-left to the upper-right of the frame. the background is a clean,stark,pure white negative space,creating a powerful contrast with the deep black elements of the subject.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'5fba068e-7f67-4c70-b95c-ef639cf5c5a0','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286189,864,'the central figure is an agile black cat sliding down a curved,diagonal ink path. the cat is captured mid-movement,leaning forward with its front paws landing gracefully on the path. its body is rendered in solid,rich black with smooth,glossy reflections. bright white highlights run along the curve of its back and shoulders,defining its muscular,fluid shape. the cat’s head is in profile,facing right,featuring a sharp,alert ear and a stylized,solid white eye that stands out against its dark fur.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'754af9ab-6c1f-4ed6-bcad-3f7bb284fa3d','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286190,864,'the cat''s tail is the most dramatic element of the piece; it extends upwards and twists in a sweeping arc,morphing into a large,fluid splash of wet black ink. the ink trail starts thick and solid near the body,then splinters into multiple fine,flowing calligraphic lines,dry-brush textures,and flying ink droplets that scatter across the white canvas. the top-right corner of the image is dominated by the heavy,expressive end of this ink stroke,which looks like a masterfully executed japanese sumi-e brush stroke.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'f2c3460e-26f0-460f-8ae3-aac3dc1dd327','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286191,864,'the path the cat is sliding on is a thin,sharp ribbon of black ink that cuts diagonally across the lower half of the composition. splashes and droplets of ink burst from where the cat’s paws touch the path,conveying speed and friction. beneath this main path,there are faint,delicate,thin ink outlines suggesting abstract waves or wind currents,rendered in a clean manga-style line art that adds depth without cluttering the minimalist aesthetic.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'5ae0c1bf-beea-4e0a-a86c-94bd51431668','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286192,864,'the style combines modern japanese anime aesthetics with traditional ink-wash painting techniques. the lines are sharp and precise,yet organic and fluid. the contrast is absolute,relying entirely on deep carbon black and pure paper white,with subtle grey washes used only for minor shading. the lighting is harsh and direct,creating stark,graphic reflections on the glossy ink surfaces. the atmosphere is energetic,elegant,and filled with a sense of swift,effortless motion.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'27bd0abe-5239-4fc7-a91d-92e26c11dac5','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286193,864,'a three-panel anime-style illustration set beneath a deep blue night sky,with strong chiaroscuro,rich tonal depth,and a vivid contrast between cool ambient light and warm sparkler glow. in the top panel,girl1appears in a centered half-length composition,leaning slightly forward with one hand raised beside her face while the other holds a glowing sparkler in front of her chest. she smiles gently as she watches the scattering sparks. deep navy and cobalt-blue shadows surround her,while concentrated golden-orange light illuminates her face,hands,and the edges of her figure. pink-white bokeh and small glowing particles drift through the darker background,making the warm light appear brighter and more dimensional.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'1f4b799b-551e-482b-b837-fe9346e43809','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286194,864,'the middle panel presents girl2 from a slightly tilted side angle in a head-and-shoulders close-up. her face,neck,collar,shoulders,and part of her upper chest are clearly visible within the frame as she holds a brilliant sparkler near the lower-left corner and looks toward it. the warm amber light strongly illuminates the side of her face closest to the sparkler,while the opposite side falls into cool blue and dark indigo shadow. bright sparks,soft pink highlights,and glowing reflections cross the foreground,creating a clear separation between the warm illuminated areas and the cool nocturnal surroundings. the framing feels intimate and contemplative,with dramatic yet delicate lighting.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'614bf1da-f2ab-49a2-911e-f347ab73afc4','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286195,864,'in the bottom panel,girl1and girl2 stand together at the center of a wide composition. they are shown mostly from behind,with their backs facing the viewer as they stand extremely close to one another. their heads turn slightly toward each other,bringing their faces nearly into contact,while their arms remain lowered naturally rather than wrapped around each other. large white-gold fireworks bloom behind them,casting a powerful warm backlight between their figures,while the surrounding sky remains deep blue and violet. their silhouettes are outlined by pale gold,pink,and icy blue rim light,with darker shadows preserving the depth of their forms. floating luminous particles and blurred reflections fill the foreground,creating a romantic,dreamlike atmosphere with pronounced light-dark contrast and a striking balance of warm and cool colors.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'732e7302-853f-41b8-bd13-0d6bb009e887','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286196,864,'hachi easy cel flat color style,masterpiece,highres,sharp focus,intricate details,very aesthetic,cinematic,traditional media,messy brushstrokes,thick paint,painterly,high contrast,hand over eye,peeking through fingers,crazy,insane expression,crazy smile,pitch-black silhouette,shadow figure,completely dark,only eyes and mouth visible,glowing yellow eyes,pure black background,portrait,a close-up portrait of manhattan cafe depicted as a completely dark shadow. her entire face and body are pitch-black,blending into the darkness. the only things visible are her piercing,glowing yellow eyes and a creepy,bright smile shining through the pure dark atmosphere.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'28f3ffd6-56cb-431a-9a2a-6be4a34bbc60','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286197,864,'翻译：Hachi Easy Cel 平涂风格，杰作，高分辨率，焦点清晰，细节丰富，极具美感，电影质感，传统绘画风格，凌乱笔触，厚涂法，油画质感，高对比度，手遮眼睛，透过指缝窥视，疯狂，癫狂神情，疯狂笑容，漆黑剪影，暗影轮廓，完全黑暗，仅可见双眼与嘴巴，发光的黄色眼睛，纯黑背景，肖像，特写肖像，描绘成完全黑暗剪影的 Manhattan Cafe；她的面部与身躯皆漆黑一片，与黑暗融为一体；唯有那锐利发光的黄眼，以及在纯粹黑暗氛围中闪现的诡异灿烂笑容清晰可见。','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'d4ecba35-b479-4be5-8b4a-89a65bc90d64','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286198,864,'a monochromatic,abstract illustration from a profile camera angle,depicting a silhouette of a person standing in the middle of the image,with a large,dark umbrella floating above them,creating a surreal and dreamlike atmosphere. the person appears to be a child,with no specific age or gender,and is facing away from the viewer,giving a sense of mystery and isolation. the umbrella is suspended above their head,with swirling swirls and dots adding to the surreal and dreamlike quality of the artwork. the background is a gradient of light grey and white,with subtle hints of darker grey,creating a sense of depth and dimension. the person is wearing a dark cloak,and their face is obscured by the umbrella,giving a sense of isolation and mystery. the overall style is reminiscent of a dark fantasy novel,with a monochromatic and abstract feel. woman,solo,looking at viewer,black hair,standing,full body,sky,from behind,umbrella,silhouette,abstract,dotted face,black umbrella','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'8f04f761-eb1e-4f8b-a602-06b07ae2b4e7','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286199,864,'a cinematic underwater farewell scene featuring girl,preserving her iconic character design and recognizable silhouette. her lifeless body rests peacefully on an ancient abyssal stone platform,surrounded by quiet deep-sea ruins and drifting marine snow. she remains unmistakably herself: long pale-green hair spreads gently through the water,the twin looped buns behind her pointed elf ears slowly unraveling into flowing strands. her large jagged dark gray dragon horns rise from her head,their golden inner markings still glowing faintly like the last remaining trace of her life. her half-lidded blue eyes are closed in peaceful silence,her expression calm and composed rather than suffering. the silver headpiece across her forehead catches the faint underwater light. her black high-neck collar,metallic clasps,and blue-white angular bodice remain intact,with the golden-brown harness details and decorative cords drifting naturally with the current. the massive black arm cuff on her left arm,decorated with flame-like protrusions and gold-white ornaments,rests beside her as a final reminder of her strength. from her body rises her final dragon spirit — not a separate creature,but the pure manifestation of si herself. a translucent ethereal dragon formed from her own silhouette,carrying the shape of her horns,her flowing green hair,and fragments of her armor design within its luminous body. the dragon''s scales resemble layers of crystal glass and aurora light,glowing with sapphire blue,pale jade,and warm golden energy. its eyes mirror her own calm blue gaze. the spirit dragon slowly ascends above her,curling through the dark ocean like a celestial ribbon. every movement releases countless glowing particles,like fragments of her memories dissolving into the sea. the golden markings from her horns transform into streams of warm light,weaving through the cold blue abyss and creating a contrast between farewell and rebirth. around her,the deep ocean remains realistic and silent: ancient rocks covered with sparse algae,tiny bioluminescent organisms drifting in the water,distant silhouettes of deep-sea creatures passing through the darkness. no fantasy flowers,no impossible scenery — only the immense scale of the ocean witnessing a final transformation. a single beam of pale cyan sunlight descends from the unreachable surface,passing through the translucent dragon spirit and scattering into thousands of glowing rays. the contrast between her still body below and her ascending dragon soul above creates a solemn,beautiful moment of transcendence. japanese mono no aware,quiet farewell,the beauty of impermanence. ultra cinematic underwater photography,realistic water physics,volumetric god rays,ethereal lighting,refined anime realism,delicate textures,deep emotional atmosphere,masterpiece composition.','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'202a6e86-b573-4d82-bddb-c2195a48364d','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286200,864,'{{light blue dashed grid background panel}},{{mint green character silhouette/outline}},{{pink polka dot shadow}},1girl,solo,cowboy shot,{{{giant upside-down ice cream cone on head}}},melting strawberry swirls dripping over bare shoulders and chest,chocolate wafer texture visible on cone surface,rainbow sprinkles stuck to collarbone and cheeks,half-lidded seductive gaze toward viewer,soft parted lips,one hand lightly bracing the wobbling cone,other hand resting on hip,completely nude body,strategic whipped cream and melting vanilla cream covering breasts and lower body,sticky syrup trails running down skin,mint-tinted skin sheen,vanilla cream pooling on thighs,waffle cone grid pattern shadow across upper body,cherry stem dangling over left ear,dynamic slight body tilt,pastel pink and mint color scheme,studio lighting with soft bounce,glossy sticky skin texture,hair strands glued by syrup,scattered sprinkles on background surface,exaggerated translucent melt effects with refraction,cartoonish sparkles around unstable cone,creamy texture emphasis,alluring chibi-proportioned expression,rim lighting on syrup strands and body curves,shallow depth of field,chromatic aberration on edges,faux wood floor background,whipped cream dollop sliding off cone rim','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'117adac0-ec1f-49f3-b3a0-0031587d18d1','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(286201,864,'翻译：{{浅蓝色虚线网格背景面板}},{{薄荷绿人物轮廓}},{{粉色波点阴影}},1个女孩,单人,牛仔造型,{{{头顶巨大的倒置冰淇淋甜筒}}},融化的草莓酱顺着裸露的肩膀和胸膛滴落,甜筒表面可见巧克力威化饼的纹理,彩虹糖屑粘在锁骨和脸颊上,半睁着眼,眼神充满诱惑地看向观众,嘴唇微张,一只手轻轻扶着摇晃的甜筒,另一只手放在臀部,全身赤裸,胸部和下半身巧妙地涂抹着鲜奶油和融化的香草奶油,粘稠的糖浆顺着皮肤流淌,薄荷绿色的肌肤泛着光泽,香草奶油在大腿上积聚,华夫饼甜筒的网格图案阴影覆盖上半身,樱桃梗垂在左耳上方,身体微微倾斜,柔和的粉色和薄荷绿配色方案,柔光摄影棚灯光,光滑粘稠的肌肤纹理,被糖浆粘住的发丝,背景表面散落的糖屑,夸张的半透明融化效果和折射,不稳定的蛋筒周围闪烁的卡通光芒,强调奶油般的质感,迷人的Q版人物表情,糖浆丝和身体曲线的边缘光,浅景深,边缘的色差,仿木地板背景,一团鲜奶油从蛋筒边缘滑落。','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789470947,'7a286045-7d73-4b39-a731-2ae71345a629','67a73ca2-1094-486f-9ad8-25f9b4bcfaa7');
