INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(334243,935,'2girls.two resolute young women with clenched jaws and blazing defiant eyes.sprawled on the rough cold floor of a grimy cell.dressed in tight weathered outfits hugging their tense sweat-slicked bodies.necks tethered by sleek high-tech collars joined by a taut humming chain.wrists bound behind their backs with gleaming metallic handcuffs emitting a soft electric pulse.ankles locked in advanced cuffs restricting their steps.one girl propped on her knees shielding the other with her shoulder.her body angled protectively as she glares at the enemy.the second girl slumped against the first.pushing herself up with one elbow.her fierce stare cutting through the gloom toward their captor.a shadowy slaver looming at the cell’s rusted doorway.his presence outlined by the stuttering glow of a lone ceiling light.cell walls of pitted steel etched with claw marks.air heavy with the musty reek of damp metal and the faint buzz of restraints.charged atmosphere of rebellion and confinement.dynamic angle capturing their separate struggles and united defiance against the oppressor.detailed textures on the linked collars.scuffed handcuffs.and scarred cell floor,','综合拘束姿态','',1789512226527,'c84e3df7-1052-4cb0-890c-f38cc1e2bc32','ca3bbeff-b409-450e-8896-ad79e3140266');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(334244,935,'2girls.two frightened young women with tense expressions and flushed faces.dressed in sleek form-fitting outfits clinging to their trembling bodies.captured and restrained by advanced slavers.wrists locked behind their backs with polished high-tech handcuffs emitting a faint electric hum.ankles bound by gleaming metallic cuffs restricting their every step.necks encircled by sophisticated collars pulsing with soft blue light to sap their strength.eyes covered with smooth black visors blocking their sight.forcing blind submission.thick metallic leashes attached to their collars tugged sharply by a cold-eyed slaver.his gloved hand controlling their pace.marching down a sterile high-tech metal corridor with polished steel walls and glowing neon strips.faint whirs of unseen machinery echoing in the distance.air cool and sharp with the scent of ozone and polished alloy.oppressive atmosphere of captivity and technological domination.dynamic angle capturing their hesitant stumbles and the slaver’s unyielding pull.detailed textures on the sleek restraints.shimmering outfits.and reflective corridor surfaces.','综合拘束姿态__002','',1789512226527,'cf20e62a-b752-46d5-9b56-e3c97d7559bc','ca3bbeff-b409-450e-8896-ad79e3140266');
