INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(343188,864,'原Tag：this image depicts a pale humanoid entity clinging to a pitch-black rectangular structure standing vertically in the water. the entity has the outline of a human torso and limbs. the skin on the left side of its body is gray white,with shriveled and distinct muscle lines,while the right side of its body is partially merged into the black rectangle behind it. the entity''s face is wrapped in pale substance,with no distinct facial features,but straight arms stretch forward,palm open; its legs extend downward and gradually transform into a dark red fluid-like structure,hanging down and touching the water surface below,creating a ring of dark red stains on the water. the background consists of a dark gray calm water surface and an overcast gray sky,divided by a straight horizontal horizon. there is a diffuse bright white light source in the upper right of the sky. there is a tiny,barely legible black handwritten signature on the lower right edge of the image. the colors of the picture are mainly black,white,and gray,with local dark red accents. the composition is centered,with a平视视角 (note: "平视视角" might need here context to be accurately translated,here it''s left as a placeholder).','自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789793931,'55925c0b-ae46-4377-b6ab-a9f47e314a8d',NULL);
